题在于规模太小、结构太集中。; 营收高度依赖少数商品和少数客户：6 种商品中有 2 种贡献了 91.75% 的销售额，4 家客户中有 2 家贡献了全部销售额，第一大客户占比 56.68%。; 库存占用资金 31879.00 元，本期动销率仅 2.10%。折叠办公桌一款商品占用 7350.00 元、占库存货值 20.97%，却一件未售。; 供应商环节完全空转：两家供应商信息完整，但现有记录中看不出任何商品从哪家采购，本期贡献为零，采购来源不可追溯。; 三分之一的有效订单（1387.50 元）停留在待处理，四笔订单中仅一笔发生过状态变化，没有任何订单进入发货环节。 |\n# 一、报告概要\n## 1.1 分析范围与数据说明\n本报告分析对象为本系统上线以来的全部经营记录，统计截止时间为 2026 年 10 月 21 日。覆盖 4 家客户、2 家供应商、6 种商品、4 笔销售订单与 12 次库存变动，数据全部取自系统运行记录，未经人工调整。\n统计口径说明如下：已取消的订单不计入销售额与销量；毛利按商品标准成本核算，不含采购批次价格波动；库存金额同时按成本价与销售价两个口径列示，前者代表实际占用资金，后者代表全部售出后的可变现货值；金额单位为人民币元。\n需要说明的是，本系统目前处于试运行阶段，业务样本总量较小，因此本报告侧重分析经营结构而非增长趋势，未涉及同比、环比等跨期对比。\n## 1.2 核心结论\n本期经营呈现三个基本特征。\n第一，业务已经跑通但规模很小。共成交 3 笔有效订单，销售额 2054.50 元，毛利 1046.00 元，毛利率 50.91%。毛利率处于健康水平，说明商品定价不存在问题。\n第二，营收高度依赖少数商品和少数客户。6\n[模板片段2｜template.docx]\n入库后没有任何出库记录。从数据看这是一次备货动作，但备货之后没有形成销售。\n两款滞销商品合计占用资金 7437.50 元，占全部库存资金的 23.33%。也就是说，接近四分之一的库存资金压在没有销售的商品上。\n# 五、客户分析\n## 5.1 客户贡献\n表 8\u3000客户销售贡献\n| 客户 | 订单数 | 销售额（元） | 客单价（元） | 销售占比 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 上海星辰贸易有限公司 | 2 | 1164.50 | 582.25 | 56.68% |\n| 深圳蓝海科技有限公司 | 1 | 890.00 | 890.00 | 43.32% |\n| 北京华远商贸中心 | 0 | 0.00 | — | 0% |\n| 广州云帆电子有限公司 | 0 | 0.00 | — | 0% |\n四家客户中两家有成交、两家没有。\n两家有成交的客户呈现出不同特点。上海星辰下了两单，合计 1164.50 元，但单笔金额 582.25 元；深圳蓝海只下一单，金额 890.00 元，反而比上海星辰的单笔高出 52.85%。\n这说明下单次数多的客户，单笔金额不一定高。对这类客户，维护重点在于持续复购，而不是指望单笔做大。\n## 5.2 客户集中度\n表 9\u3000客户集中度\n| 指标 | 数值 | 参考标准 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 第一大客户占比 | 56.68% | 超过 50% 属高度依赖 |\n| 前两大客户占比 | 100% | — |\n| 客户集中度指数 | 0.509 | 超过 0.25 属高度集中 |\n| 有成交客户占比 | 50% | 4 家中 2 家 |\n收入全部来自两家客户，第一大客户占了 56.68%。客户集中度指数 0.509，处于高度集中区间。\n这个结构意味着：失去上海星辰，销售额直接少一半以上；失去深圳蓝海，销售额同样少一截。在业务起步阶段客户少是正常的，但从风险角度看，目前的营收结构对单一大客户的依赖已经比较明显。\n## 5.3 客户活跃与转化\n四家客户中，两家有成交，转化率 50%。\n两家没有成交的客户情况不同。北京华远商贸中心建档较早，但至今没有任何订单，属于建立了关系却没有启动业务。广州云帆电子是最近新增的客户，建档当天就下了折叠办公桌的订单，但随即取消，属于首单未成交。\n有成交的客户平均下单 1.5 次，最多 2 次。目前还没有客户形成三次以上的稳定复购，客户黏性尚未建立。\n# 六、供应商分析\n## 6.1 供应商资源现状\n表 10\u3000现有供应商\n| 供应商 | 联系人 | 联系电话 | 所在地 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 东莞精工电子厂 | 陈明 | 13900139001 | 东莞市长安镇工业区 |\n| 杭州润泽包装材料有限公司 | 刘芳 | 13900139002 | 杭州市余杭区仁和街道 |\n目前系统内有两家供应商，基础信息完整，联系人、电话、地址都具备，状态均为正常合作，没有停用的情况。两家供应商的建档时间为同一时间，属于系统初始化时统一录入，不是业务过程中逐步积累的。\n## 6.2 供应商与采购业务的衔接\n这是本期分析中最需要关注的一个发现。\n两家供应商虽然有完整档案，但在现有的经营记录中，找不到任何商品与供应商之间的对应关系。具体表现为：商品的进货成本记录里没有供应来源，出入库记录里也没有记录这批货来自哪家供应商，整个系统中不存在采购单据。\n结果是，两家供应商在本期的业务贡献为 零。它们只是存在于名录中，没有参与任何实际交易记录。\n…\n[模板片段3｜template.docx]\n征。\n第一，业务已经跑通但规模很小。共成交 3 笔有效订单，销售额 2054.50 元，毛利 1046.00 元，毛利率 50.91%。毛利率处于健康水平，说明商品定价不存在问题。\n第二，营收高度依赖少数商品和少数客户。6 种商品中有 2 种贡献了 91.75% 的销售额，4 家客户中有 2 家贡献了全部销售额，第一大客户占比达 56.68%。\n第三，资金压在库存上却转化不出销售。库存占用资金 31879.00 元，本期动销率仅 2.10%。其中折叠办公桌一款商品占用 7350.00 元资金、占库存货值的 20.97%，却一件未售。\n此外，供应商环节存在一个值得注意的现象：两家供应商的档案信息完整，但现有经营记录中无法看出任何商品是从哪家供应商采购的，采购来源不可追溯。\n# 二、经营总览\n## 2.1 关键经营指标\n表 1\u3000关键经营指标\n| 指标 | 本期数值 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 有效订单 | 3 笔 | 另有 1 笔取消 |\n| 销售额 | 2054.50 元 | — |\n| 毛利额 | 1046.00 元 | — |\n| 毛利率 | 50.91% | 处于行业中位水平 |\n| 客单价 | 684.83 元 | 单笔交易平均金额 |\n| 成交件数 | 40 件 | — |\n| 件均价 | 51.36 元 | 每件商品平均售价 |\n| 平均每单件数 | 13.33 件 | — |\n| 平均每单品项 | 1.67 项 | 多为单品或双品采购 |\n| 库存资金占用 | 31879.00 元 | 按成本价计 |\n| 库存货值 | 66590.50 元 | 按销售价计 |\n| 整体动销率 | 2.10% | 销量占销量与库存之和的比重 |\n## 2.2 订单整体情况\n本期共 4 笔订单，其中 3 笔有效、1 笔取消。三笔有效订单的金额分别为 497.50 元、667.00 元和 890.00 元。\n三笔订单的金额分布比较均衡，最高单笔占总额 43.32%，最低单笔占 24.21%，没有出现一单决定全局的情况。平均金额 684.83 元与中间值 667.00 元几乎一致，说明订单金额没有极端值干扰。\n# 三、销售订单分析\n## 3.1 订单规模与金额分布\n表 2\u3000订单金额分布\n| 订单号 | 客户 | 金额（元） | 占总额比重 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| SO202610210002 | 深圳蓝海科技 | 890.00 | 43.32% |\n| SO202610210003 | 上海星辰贸易 | 667.00 | 32.47% |\n| SO202610210001 | 上海星辰贸易 | 497.50 | 24.21% |\n| SO202610210004 | 广州云帆电子 | 399.00 | 已取消 |\n三笔有效订单的金额极差为 392.50 元，最高比最低高 78.90%。从经营角度看，这个差距属于正常区间，反映的是客户采购量的差异，而非定价不稳定。\n## 3.2 订单构成\n表 3\u3000订单商品构成\n| 订单号 | 商品构成 | 品项 | 件数 | 金额（元） |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| SO...001 | 蓝牙耳机 2 件、数据线 5 件 | 2 | 7 | 497.50 |\n| SO...002 | 快充充电器 10 件 | 1 | 10 | 890.00 |\n| SO...003 | 蓝牙耳机 3 件、包装盒 20 件 | 2 | 2…\n[模板片段4｜template.docx]\n发现 | 数据依据 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | 营收集中在两款商品 | 2 款商品贡献 91.75% 销售额、90.35% 毛利 |\n| 2 | 销量与营收背离 | 包装盒占 50% 销量、只占 3.41% 销售额 |\n| 3 | 高货值商品零销售 | 折叠办公桌占 20.97% 库存货值，销量为零 |\n| 4 | 客户高度集中 | 第一大客户占 56.68%，全部收入来自 2 家 |\n| 5 | 供应商未参与经营 | 2 家供应商本期贡献为零，采购来源不可追溯 |\n| 6 | 库存预警失效 | 全部商品库存为安全线 2.5 至 7 倍，预警为 0 |\n| 7 | 订单卡在发货前 | 66.67% 有效订单停留待处理 |\n## 8.2 轻重缓急\n按涉及金额和数据确定性排序，七项发现可以分为三个层面。\n金额最直接的是折叠办公桌的滞销。7350.00 元资金占用、占库存货值 20.97%、销量为零，三项数据可以互相印证，这是当前最明确的资金沉淀点。\n影响收入确认的是订单推进停滞。1387.50 元订单停留在待处理，三笔订单状态零变化。这部分金额已经成交但尚未转化为实际收入。\n结构性问题的是供应商未参与经营和库存预警失效。前者不直接对应金额，但导致采购成本无法核算；后者不直接对应金额，但使得补货决策失去依据。这两项属于基础管理环节的空白，随着业务量增长，影响会放大。\n客户集中度和商品集中度属于阶段性特征。在只有 4 家客户、6 款商品的规模下，集中是必然结果，本身不算异常，但依赖程度需要持续跟踪。\n# 九、结论\n本期经营的核心数据是：3 笔有效订单、2054.50 元销售额、1046.00 元毛利、50.91% 毛利率。盈利能力没有问题，问题在于规模太小、结构太集中。\n商品层面，六款商品里两款撑起九成营收，两款完全没有销售。卖得最多的包装盒只贡献 3% 的销售额，真正赚钱的是两款数码配件。\n客户层面，四家客户里两家有成交，收入 100% 来自这两家，第一大客户占近六成。有成交的客户还没有形成稳定复购。\n供应商层面，名录已建但不参与经营，本期贡献为零，唯一一次采购无法追溯来源。这是五个业务环节中唯一完全空转的一环。\n库存层面，1865 件库存占用 31879.00 元资金，整体动销率只有 2.10%。接近四分之一的资金压在两款没有销售的商品上，其中折叠办公桌一款就占了 7350.00 元。\n综合来看，当前业务已经具备完整的经营闭环，各环节数据可以互相对上，账实相符。但业务量还处在起步阶段，营收依赖少数商品和少数客户，库存资金的使用效率偏低，采购环节尚未真正运转。\n从数据反映的紧迫程度看，折叠办公桌的库存处置和待处理订单的推进是最直接的两个着力点，分别对应 7350.00 元的资金占用和 1387.50 元的收入确认。\n模板中出现的关键对象：商品分级表、经营分析报告、进销存情况、虚拟ERP系统、采购单据、V1.0、本期经营数据、销售订单、2026年10月21日、销售额、2026年10月22日、安全库存、客户、商品、供应商、采购业务、待处理订单、采购来源、第一大客户、动销情况\n模板中描述的关键关系：\n- 安全库存总量 → 折叠办公桌：折叠办公桌的库存量明显高于其对应的安全库存标准，达到7倍。\n- 经营分析报告 → 虚拟ERP系统：经营分析报告的数据全部取自虚拟ERP系统的运行记录，未经人工调整。\n- 商品分级表 → 折叠办公桌：在商品分级表中，折叠办公桌因销售额为零被划分为“滞销”档位。\n- V1.0 → 经营分析报告：该报告当前版本号为V1.0。\n- 折叠办公桌 → 滞销商品：折叠办公桌被归类为滞销商品，其特点是占用大量库存资金且无任何销售记录。\n- 经营分析报告 → 销售订单：经营分析报告对销售订单的规模、金额分布、构成、流转情况及取消订单进行分析。\n- 库存资金 → 折叠办公桌：折叠办公桌这款商品占用了7350.00元的库存资金。<SEP>折叠办公桌作为滞销的高货值商品，造成了7350.00元的库存资金占用。\n- 2026年10月21日 → 经营分析报告：经营分析报告的数据统计范围截止于该日期。\n- 库存 → 折叠办公桌：折叠办公桌作为单一SKU占用了总库存资金的约五分之一(7350.00元)。\n- 2026年10月22日 → 经营分析报告：经营分析报告在该日期发布。\n- 广州云帆电子 → 折叠办公桌：广州云帆电子曾计划购买折叠办公桌，但因取消订单导致该品类本期销售额归零。\n- 客户 → 销售订单：4家客户中有2家贡献了全部销售额，第一大客户占比56.68%。\n- 数码配件 → 蓝牙耳机：蓝牙耳机是数码配件品类中的核心商品，贡献了近一半的销售额和最高的毛利占比。\n- 商品 → 采购业务：现有记录中无法确定哪些商品是通过采购业务从特定供应商处获得的。\n- 库存占用资金 → 折叠办公桌：折叠办公桌单款商品占用了7350.00元的库存资金。\n以上内容只说明需要取到哪些数据、按什么口径解读，不是本次的业务数据；实际数字必须来自沙箱查询结果，不得直接用模板原文代替。\n\n【智能体全局设定】\n请你根据返回的企业名称+注册地址给出一套完整的企业详细信息并介绍企业\n\n你是负责最终业务总结的助手。请对本次技能的执行结果做业务解读与总结。'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': '用户原始问题：帮我生成一份今年erp系统的经营分析报告\n\n【技能各执行单元的过程与结果】\n## 执行单元【erp综合经验报告分析】结果\n\n### 步骤 1: 步骤1：查询基础经营汇总指标，包括有效订单数、销售额、毛利额（基于成本价计算）、毛利率、客单价、成交件数、件均价、库存资金占用（按成本价和销售价分别统计）以及整体动销率\n**执行代码**:\n```python\nimport json\nfrom decimal import Decimal\n\ndef get_connection():\n    # Placeholder for sandbox connection function\n    pass\n\nconn = None\ntry:\n    conn = get_connection()\n    cursor = conn.cursor()\n    \n    # 1. Query Sales Orders Summary (Valid orders only, excluding cancelled)\n    # We need to determine what constitutes a "valid" order based on status. \n    # Common statuses might be \'completed\', \'shipped\', \'paid\', etc. \n    # Looking at the template, it mentions "3 valid orders" and "1 cancelled".\n    # Let\'s assume status != \'cancelled\' or similar. Without specific enum values in schema, \n    # I will check distinct statuses first or assume standard behavior. \n    # However, to be safe and accurate, let\'s query all orders and filter in Python if needed, \n    # or use a generic exclusion. The template says "已取消的订单不计入".\n    # Let\'s try to identify valid orders. Usually \'status\' column has values like \'pending\', \'processing\', \'completed\', \'cancelled\'.\n    # I will calculate metrics for orders where status is NOT \'cancelled\' (case-insensitive).\n    \n    sql_orders_summary = """\n    SELECT \n        COUNT(*) as total_orders,\n        SUM(total_amount) as total_sales,\n        AVG(total_amount) as avg_order_value\n    FROM virtual_erp.sales_orders\n    WHERE LOWER(status) != \'cancelled\' AND LOWER(status) != \'canceled\'\n    """\n    cursor.execute(sql_orders_summary)\n    row = cursor.fetchone()\n    total_valid_orders = row[0] if row else 0\n    total_sales_amount = float(row[1]) if row and row[1] else 0.0\n    avg_order_value = float(row[2]) if row and row[2] else 0.0\n    \n    # 2. Query Order Items joined with Products to get Cost and Quantity for Gross Profit and Volume\n    # Need to exclude items from cancelled orders.\n    sql_items_summary = """\n    SELECT \n        SUM(soi.qty) as total_qty_sold,\n        SUM(soi.amount) as total_item_sales,\n        SUM(soi.qty * p.cost_price) as total_cost\n    FROM virtual_erp.sales_order_items soi\n    JOIN virtual_erp.sales_orders so ON soi.order_id = so.id\n    JOIN virtual_erp.products p ON soi.product_id = p.id\n    WHERE LOWER(so.status) != \'cancelled\' AND LOWER(so.status) != \'canceled\'\n    """\n    cursor.execute(sql_items_summary)\n    row = cursor.fetchone()\n    total_qty_sold = int(row[0]) if row and row[0] else 0\n    # Use item sales sum for consistency with cost calculation, though header total should match\n    calculated_sales_from_items = float(row[1]) if row and row[1] else 0.0\n    total_cost_of_goods = float(row[2]) if row and row[2] else 0.0\n    \n    gross_profit = calculated_sales_from_items - total_cost_of_goods\n    gross_margin_rate = (gross_profit / calculated_sales_from_items * 100) if calculated_sales_from_items > 0 else 0.0\n    unit_avg_price = (calculated_sales_from_items / total_qty_sold) if total_qty_sold > 0 else 0.0\n    \n    # 3. Query Inventory Value (Current Stock)\n    # Stock Qty * Cost Price and Stock Qty * Sale Price\n    sql_inventory_value = """\n    SELECT \n        SUM(stock_qty * cost_price) as inventory_cost_value,\n        SUM(stock_qty * sale_price) as inventory_sale_value,\n        SUM(stock_qty) as total_stock_qty\n    FROM virtual_erp.products\n    WHERE stock_qty > 0\n    """\n    cursor.execute(sql_inventory_value)\n    row = cursor.fetchone()\n    inventory_cost_value = float(row[0]) if row and row[0] else 0.0\n    inventory_sale_value = float(row[1]) if row and row[1] else 0.0\n    total_stock_qty = int(row[2]) if row and row[2] else 0\n    \n    # 4. Calculate Turnover Rate (动销率)\n    # Definition in template: "销量占销量与库存之和的比重" -> Total Sold Qty / (Total Sold Qty + Current Stock Qty)\n    # Note: This is a simplified metric often used in such reports when historical flow isn\'t fully aggregated per period vs current snapshot.\n    denominator = total_qty_sold + total_stock_qty\n    turnover_rate = (total_qty_sold / denominator * 100) if denominator > 0 else 0.0\n    \n    # Output Results\n    print("=== 基础经营汇总指标 ===")\n    print(f"有效订单数: {total_valid_orders}")\n    print(f"销售额: {calculated_sales_from_items:.2f} 元")\n    print(f"毛利额: {gross_profit:.2f} 元")\n    print(f"毛利率: {gross_margin_rate:.2f}%")\n    print(f"客单价: {avg_order_value:.2f} 元")\n    print(f"成交件数: {total_qty_sold}")\n    print(f"件均价: {unit_avg_price:.2f} 元")\n    print(f"库存资金占用(成本价): {inventory_cost_value:.2f} 元")\n    print(f"库存货值(销售价): {inventory_sale_value:.2f} 元")\n    print(f"整体动销率: {turnover_rate:.2f}%")\n    \n    # Handoff data for subsequent steps\n    handoff_data = {\n        "total_valid_orders": total_valid_orders,\n        "total_sales_amount": round(calculated_sales_from_items, 2),\n        "total_gross_profit": round(gross_profit, 2),\n        "total_qty_sold": total_qty_sold,\n        "inventory_cost_value": round(inventory_cost_value, 2),\n        "inventory_sale_value": round(inventory_sale_value, 2),\n        "turnover_rate": round(turnover_rate, 2)\n    }\n    print(\'__HANDOFF__\' + json.dumps(handoff_data))\n\nexcept Exception as e:\n    print(f"Error during execution: {e}")\nfinally:\n    if conn:\n        try:\n            conn.rollback()\n            conn.close()\n        except:\n            pass\n```\n**执行结果**:\n```text\nError during execution: \'NoneType\' object has no attribute \'cursor\'\n```\n\n### 步骤 2: 步骤2：查询销售订单详细数据，包括订单号、客户名称、订单金额、状态、创建时间及订单明细（商品名称、数量、单价、行金额），用于分析订单规模分布、构成及流转情况\n**执行代码**:\n```python\nimport json\nfrom decimal import Decimal\n\ndef get_data():\n    conn = None\n    try:\n        conn = get_connection()\n        cursor = conn.cursor()\n        \n        # 1. 查询销售订单主表及关联客户信息\n        sql_orders = """\n        SELECT \n            so.id as order_id,\n            so.order_no,\n            c.name as customer_name,\n            so.total_amount,\n            so.status,\n            so.created_at,\n            so.updated_at\n        FROM virtual_erp.sales_orders so\n        LEFT JOIN virtual_erp.customers c ON so.customer_id = c.id\n        ORDER BY so.created_at DESC;\n        """\n        cursor.execute(sql_orders)\n        orders_rows = cursor.fetchall()\n        orders_cols = [desc[0] for desc in cursor.description]\n        \n        # 2. 查询销售订单明细及关联商品信息\n        sql_items = """\n        SELECT \n            soi.order_id,\n            p.name as product_name,\n            p.sku,\n            soi.qty,\n            soi.unit_price,\n            soi.amount\n        FROM virtual_erp.sales_order_items soi\n        LEFT JOIN virtual_erp.products p ON soi.product_id = p.id\n        ORDER BY soi.order_id ASC;\n        """\n        cursor.execute(sql_items)\n        items_rows = cursor.fetchall()\n        items_cols = [desc[0] for desc in cursor.description]\n        \n        # 处理数据并打印表格\n        \n        print("=== 销售订单主表数据 ===")\n        print("\\t".join(orders_cols))\n        order_ids_for_handoff = []\n        valid_order_count = 0\n        total_sales_amount = Decimal(\'0\')\n        \n        for row in orders_rows:\n            # Convert Decimals to float or str for printing if needed, but keeping raw for logic\n            display_row = []\n            for val in row:\n                if isinstance(val, Decimal):\n                    display_row.append(str(val))\n                elif val is None:\n                    display_row.append("")\n                else:\n                    display_row.append(str(val))\n            print("\\t".join(display_row))\n            \n            # Collect data for handoff and summary\n            status = row[4] # status column index\n            amount = row[3] # total_amount column index\n            \n            if status != \'cancelled\': # Assuming \'cancelled\' is the string for cancelled based on template context, checking actual values later if needed. \n                # The template mentions "已取消" (Cancelled). Let\'s check common statuses. Usually \'pending\', \'shipped\', \'completed\', \'cancelled\'.\n                # We will collect all IDs for now, but filter for valid ones in analysis if necessary.\n                pass\n                \n            order_ids_for_handoff.append(row[0])\n            \n            # Simple aggregation for verification\n            if status not in [\'cancelled\', \'canceled\']: # Handle potential spelling variations\n                 valid_order_count += 1\n                 if amount:\n                     total_sales_amount += Decimal(amount)\n\n        print(f"\\n统计: 总订单数 {len(orders_rows)}, 有效订单数(非取消) {valid_order_count}, 有效销售额合计 {total_sales_amount}")\n\n        print("\\n=== 销售订单明细数据 ===")\n        print("\\t".join(items_cols))\n        for row in items_rows:\n            display_row = []\n            for val in row:\n                if isinstance(val, Decimal):\n                    display_row.append(str(val))\n                elif val is None:\n                    display_row.append("")\n                else:\n                    display_row.append(str(val))\n            print("\\t".join(display_row))\n            \n        # Prepare handoff data\n        # Pass order IDs and basic stats to next steps if needed, though next steps might re-query. \n        # Protocol says: "若本步产生了后续步骤需要复用的关键结果...请在代码最后追加打印一行协议"\n        # Key results: List of Order IDs involved in this analysis scope.\n        \n        handoff_data = {\n            "order_ids": order_ids_for_handoff,\n            "total_valid_orders": valid_order_count,\n            "total_valid_sales": float(total_sales_amount)\n        }\n        \n        print(\'__HANDOFF__\' + json.dumps(handoff_data))\n\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f"Error: {e}")\n        raise e\n    finally:\n        if conn:\n            conn.rollback()\n            conn.close()\n\nget_data()\n```\n**执行结果**:\n```text\n=== 销售订单主表数据 ===\norder_id\torder_no\tcustomer_name\ttotal_amount\tstatus\tcreated_at\tupdated_at\n4\tSO202610210004\t广州云帆电子有限公司\t399.00\tcancelled\t2026-10-21 15:56:51\t2026-10-21 15:57:08\n3\tSO202610210003\t上海星辰贸易有限公司\t667.00\tpaid\t2026-10-21 15:30:22\t2026-10-21 15:49:56\n1\tSO202610210001\t上海星辰贸易有限公司\t497.50\tpending\t2026-10-21 15:30:08\t2026-10-21 15:30:08\n2\tSO202610210002\t深圳蓝海科技有限公司\t890.00\tpending\t2026-10-21 15:30:08\t2026-10-21 15:30:08\n\n统计: 总订单数 4, 有效订单数(非取消) 3, 有效销售额合计 2054.50\n\n=== 销售订单明细数据 ===\norder_id\tproduct_name\tsku\tqty\tunit_price\tamount\n1\t无线蓝牙耳机 Air Pro\tP1001\t2\t199.00\t398.00\n1\tType-C 数据线 1.5m\tP1003\t5\t19.90\t99.50\n2\t65W 氮化镓快充充电器\tP1002\t10\t89.00\t890.00\n3\t无线蓝牙耳机 Air Pro\tP1001\t3\t199.00\t597.00\n3\t牛皮纸包装盒(中号)\tP2001\t20\t3.50\t70.00\n4\t折叠办公桌 120cm\tP3001\t1\t399.00\t399.00\n```\n\n### 步骤 3: 步骤3：查询商品维度分析数据，包括各商品的销量、销售额、成本、毛利、当前库存数量与金额、安全库存设定值及商品分类，用于识别畅销/滞销商品及毛利贡献\n**执行代码**:\n```python\nimport json\nfrom decimal import Decimal\n\ndef get_data():\n    conn = None\n    try:\n        conn = get_connection()\n        # 修复报错：移除 dictionary=True，使用默认游标\n        cursor = conn.cursor()\n        \n        # 1. 查询所有商品基础信息及当前库存状态\n        sql_products = """\n        SELECT \n            id, \n            sku, \n            name, \n            category, \n            unit, \n            cost_price, \n            sale_price, \n            stock_qty, \n            safety_stock, \n            status\n        FROM virtual_erp.products\n        """\n        cursor.execute(sql_products)\n        products_raw = cursor.fetchall()\n        \n        # 获取列名以便映射（因为不是字典游标）\n        product_columns = [desc[0] for desc in cursor.description]\n        products_list = []\n        for row in products_raw:\n            products_list.append(dict(zip(product_columns, row)))\n            \n        # 2. 查询各商品的销量、销售额、成本总额、毛利总额（基于有效订单）\n        sql_sales_stats = """\n        SELECT \n            soi.product_id,\n            SUM(soi.qty) as total_qty_sold,\n            SUM(soi.amount) as total_sales_amount,\n            SUM(soi.qty * p.cost_price) as total_cost_amount,\n            SUM(soi.amount - (soi.qty * p.cost_price)) as total_gross_profit\n        FROM virtual_erp.sales_order_items soi\n        JOIN virtual_erp.sales_orders so ON soi.order_id = so.id\n        JOIN virtual_erp.products p ON soi.product_id = p.id\n        WHERE so.status != \'cancelled\'\n        GROUP BY soi.product_id\n        """\n        cursor.execute(sql_sales_stats)\n        sales_stats_raw = cursor.fetchall()\n        \n        stats_columns = [desc[0] for desc in cursor.description]\n        sales_stats_list = []\n        for row in sales_stats_raw:\n            sales_stats_list.append(dict(zip(stats_columns, row)))\n        \n        # 3. 处理数据并合并\n        stats_map = {}\n        for row in sales_stats_list:\n            pid = row[\'product_id\']\n            # 确保数值转换正确，处理可能的 None 或 Decimal\n            qty = int(row[\'total_qty_sold\']) if row[\'total_qty_sold\'] is not None else 0\n            sales_amt = float(row[\'total_sales_amount\']) if row[\'total_sales_amount\'] is not None else 0.0\n            cost_amt = float(row[\'total_cost_amount\']) if row[\'total_cost_amount\'] is not None else 0.0\n            gross_profit = float(row[\'total_gross_profit\']) if row[\'total_gross_profit\'] is not None else 0.0\n            \n            stats_map[pid] = {\n                \'total_qty_sold\': qty,\n                \'total_sales_amount\': sales_amt,\n                \'total_cost_amount\': cost_amt,\n                \'total_gross_profit\': gross_profit\n            }\n            \n        product_analysis_list = []\n        total_inventory_value_cost = 0.0\n        total_inventory_value_sale = 0.0\n        \n        for prod in products_list:\n            pid = prod[\'id\']\n            stats = stats_map.get(pid, {\n                \'total_qty_sold\': 0,\n                \'total_sales_amount\': 0.0,\n                \'total_cost_amount\': 0.0,\n                \'total_gross_profit\': 0.0\n            })\n            \n            stock_qty = int(prod[\'stock_qty\']) if prod[\'stock_qty\'] is not None else 0\n            cost_price = float(prod[\'cost_price\']) if prod[\'cost_price\'] is not None else 0.0\n            sale_price = float(prod[\'sale_price\']) if prod[\'sale_price\'] is not None else 0.0\n            \n            inv_val_cost = stock_qty * cost_price\n            inv_val_sale = stock_qty * sale_price\n            \n            total_inventory_value_cost += inv_val_cost\n            total_inventory_value_sale += inv_val_sale\n            \n            # 判断是否滞销：有库存但无销量\n            is_stagnant = (stats[\'total_qty_sold\'] == 0 and stock_qty > 0)\n            \n            item = {\n                \'product_id\': pid,\n                \'sku\': prod[\'sku\'],\n                \'name\': prod[\'name\'],\n                \'category\': prod[\'category\'],\n                \'unit\': prod[\'unit\'],\n                \'cost_price\': cost_price,\n                \'sale_price\': sale_price,\n                \'stock_qty\': stock_qty,\n                \'safety_stock\': int(prod[\'safety_stock\']) if prod[\'safety_stock\'] is not None else 0,\n                \'status\': int(prod[\'status\']) if prod[\'status\'] is not None else 0,\n                \'total_qty_sold\': stats[\'total_qty_sold\'],\n                \'total_sales_amount\': round(stats[\'total_sales_amount\'], 2),\n                \'total_cost_amount\': round(stats[\'total_cost_amount\'], 2),\n                \'total_gross_profit\': round(stats[\'total_gross_profit\'], 2),\n                \'inventory_value_cost\': round(inv_val_cost, 2),\n                \'inventory_value_sale\': round(inv_val_sale, 2),\n                \'is_stagnant\': is_stagnant\n            }\n            product_analysis_list.append(item)\n            \n        # 4. 输出结果表格\n        print("=== 商品维度分析数据 ===")\n        headers = ["ID", "SKU", "名称", "分类", "单位", "成本价", "销售价", "库存量", "安全库存", "状态", "总销量", "总销售额", "总成本", "总毛利", "库存成本值", "库存售价值", "是否滞销"]\n        print("\\t".join(headers))\n        for item in product_analysis_list:\n            row_vals = [\n                str(item[\'product_id\']),\n                str(item[\'sku\']),\n                str(item[\'name\']),\n                str(item[\'category\']),\n                str(item[\'unit\']),\n                f"{item[\'cost_price\']:.2f}",\n                f"{item[\'sale_price\']:.2f}",\n                str(item[\'stock_qty\']),\n                str(item[\'safety_stock\']),\n                str(item[\'status\']),\n                str(item[\'total_qty_sold\']),\n                f"{item[\'total_sales_amount\']:.2f}",\n                f"{item[\'total_cost_amount\']:.2f}",\n                f"{item[\'total_gross_profit\']:.2f}",\n                f"{item[\'inventory_value_cost\']:.2f}",\n                f"{item[\'inventory_value_sale\']:.2f}",\n                "是" if item[\'is_stagnant\'] else "否"\n            ]\n            print("\\t".join(row_vals))\n            \n        print(f"\\n库存总成本值: {round(total_inventory_value_cost, 2)}")\n        print(f"库存总售价值: {round(total_inventory_value_sale, 2)}")\n        \n        # 5. 准备 Handoff 数据\n        stagnant_product_ids = [item[\'product_id\'] for item in product_analysis_list if item[\'is_stagnant\']]\n        all_product_ids = [item[\'product_id\'] for item in product_analysis_list]\n        \n        handoff_data = {\n            "all_product_ids": all_product_ids,\n            "stagnant_product_ids": stagnant_product_ids,\n            "total_inventory_value_cost": float(round(total_inventory_value_cost, 2)),\n            "total_inventory_value_sale": float(round(total_inventory_value_sale, 2))\n        }\n        \n        print(\'__HANDOFF__\' + json.dumps(handoff_data))\n        \n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f"Error: {str(e)}")\n        raise e\n    finally:\n        if conn:\n            conn.rollback()\n            conn.close()\n\nget_data()\n```\n**执行结果**:\n```text\n=== 商品维度分析数据 ===\nID\tSKU\t名称\t分类\t单位\t成本价\t销售价\t库存量\t安全库存\t状态\t总销量\t总销售额\t总成本\t总毛利\t库存成本值\t库存售价值\t是否滞销\n1\tP1001\t无线蓝牙耳机 Air Pro\t数码配件\t个\t98.00\t199.00\t115\t20\t1\t5\t995.00\t490.00\t505.00\t11270.00\t22885.00\t否\n2\tP1002\t65W 氮化镓快充充电器\t数码配件\t个\t45.00\t89.00\t190\t30\t1\t10\t890.00\t450.00\t440.00\t8550.00\t16910.00\t否\n3\tP1003\tType-C 数据线 1.5m\t数码配件\t条\t6.50\t19.90\t495\t100\t1\t5\t99.50\t32.50\t67.00\t3217.50\t9850.50\t否\n4\tP2001\t牛皮纸包装盒(中号)\t包装耗材\t个\t1.80\t3.50\t780\t200\t1\t20\t70.00\t36.00\t34.00\t1404.00\t2730.00\t否\n5\tP2002\t气泡袋 20x30cm\t包装耗材\t个\t0.35\t1.00\t250\t100\t1\t0\t0.00\t0.00\t0.00\t87.50\t250.00\t是\n6\tP3001\t折叠办公桌 120cm\t办公家具\t张\t210.00\t399.00\t35\t5\t1\t0\t0.00\t0.00\t0.00\t7350.00\t13965.00\t是\n\n库存总成本值: 31879.0\n库存总售价值: 66590.5\n```\n\n### 步骤 4: 步骤4：查询客户维度分析数据，包括客户建档时间、首次下单时间、各客户的订单记录、销售额及有成交客户占比，用于分析客户集中度、活跃度与转化情况\n**执行代码**:\n```python\nimport json\nfrom datetime import datetime\n\ndef get_connection():\n    # Placeholder for sandbox connection function\n    pass\n\ntry:\n    conn = get_connection()\n    cursor = conn.cursor(dictionary=True)\n\n    # 1. Get all customers with their creation time and status\n    sql_customers = """\n        SELECT id, code, name, contact, phone, address, status, created_at \n        FROM virtual_erp.customers\n    """\n    cursor.execute(sql_customers)\n    customers = cursor.fetchall()\n\n    # 2. Get sales orders linked to customers to calculate first order date and total sales per customer\n    # We need valid orders (status != \'cancelled\' or similar). Based on template, cancelled orders are excluded from sales.\n    # Let\'s assume status \'cancelled\' is the exclusion criterion based on common ERP patterns and template context.\n    # Template says: "已取消的订单不计入销售额与销量"\n    \n    sql_orders_by_customer = """\n        SELECT \n            c.id as customer_id,\n            c.name as customer_name,\n            so.order_no,\n            so.total_amount,\n            so.status,\n            so.order_date,\n            so.created_at as order_created_at\n        FROM virtual_erp.customers c\n        LEFT JOIN virtual_erp.sales_orders so ON c.id = so.customer_id\n        ORDER BY c.id, so.order_date\n    """\n    cursor.execute(sql_orders_by_customer)\n    orders_data = cursor.fetchall()\n\n    # Process data in Python to aggregate metrics per customer\n    customer_metrics = {}\n    for cust in customers:\n        cid = cust[\'id\']\n        customer_metrics[cid] = {\n            \'name\': cust[\'name\'],\n            \'code\': cust[\'code\'],\n            \'contact\': cust[\'contact\'],\n            \'phone\': cust[\'phone\'],\n            \'address\': cust[\'address\'],\n            \'status\': cust[\'status\'],\n            \'created_at\': str(cust[\'created_at\']),\n            \'total_sales\': 0.0,\n            \'valid_order_count\': 0,\n            \'first_order_date\': None,\n            \'last_order_date\': None,\n            \'order_details\': []\n        }\n\n    for row in orders_data:\n        cid = row[\'customer_id\']\n        if cid not in customer_metrics:\n            continue\n        \n        # Check if order is valid (not cancelled)\n        # Assuming status string \'cancelled\' means invalid for sales calculation\n        is_valid = row[\'status\'].lower() != \'cancelled\' if row[\'status\'] else False\n        \n        if is_valid:\n            amount = float(row[\'total_amount\']) if row[\'total_amount\'] else 0.0\n            customer_metrics[cid][\'total_sales\'] += amount\n            customer_metrics[cid][\'valid_order_count\'] += 1\n            \n            order_date_str = str(row[\'order_date\']) if row[\'order_date\'] else None\n            if order_date_str:\n                if customer_metrics[cid][\'first_order_date\'] is None or order_date_str < customer_metrics[cid][\'first_order_date\']:\n                    customer_metrics[cid][\'first_order_date\'] = order_date_str\n                if customer_metrics[cid][\'last_order_date\'] is None or order_date_str > customer_metrics[cid][\'last_order_date\']:\n                    customer_metrics[cid][\'last_order_date\'] = order_date_str\n                \n                customer_metrics[cid][\'order_details\'].append({\n                    \'order_no\': row[\'order_no\'],\n                    \'date\': order_date_str,\n                    \'amount\': amount\n                })\n        elif row[\'order_no\']:\n             # Record cancelled orders separately if needed for analysis, but exclude from totals\n             customer_metrics[cid][\'order_details\'].append({\n                \'order_no\': row[\'order_no\'],\n                \'date\': str(row[\'order_date\']) if row[\'order_date\'] else \'\',\n                \'amount\': float(row[\'total_amount\']) if row[\'total_amount\'] else 0.0,\n                \'status\': \'cancelled\'\n            })\n\n    # Calculate global stats for concentration and activity\n    total_customers = len(customers)\n    active_customers = [c for c in customer_metrics.values() if c[\'valid_order_count\'] > 0]\n    num_active_customers = len(active_customers)\n    \n    total_sales_all = sum(c[\'total_sales\'] for c in customer_metrics.values())\n    \n    # Sort active customers by sales descending for concentration analysis\n    sorted_active = sorted(active_customers, key=lambda x: x[\'total_sales\'], reverse=True)\n    \n    top_customer_share = 0.0\n    top_two_share = 0.0\n    \n    if total_sales_all > 0:\n        if len(sorted_active) >= 1:\n            top_customer_share = (sorted_active[0][\'total_sales\'] / total_sales_all) * 100\n        if len(sorted_active) >= 2:\n            top_two_share = ((sorted_active[0][\'total_sales\'] + sorted_active[1][\'total_sales\']) / total_sales_all) * 100\n\n    # Output Table 1: Customer Overview & Contribution\n    print("=== 客户维度分析数据 ===")\n    print(f"{\'客户名称\':<20} | {\'编码\':<10} | {\'状态\':<6} | {\'建档时间\':<20} | {\'首次下单\':<12} | {\'有效订单数\':<8} | {\'销售额(元)\':<12} | {\'销售占比%\':<10}")\n    print("-" * 130)\n    \n    handoff_data = {\n        \'active_customer_ids\': [],\n        \'top_customer_id\': None,\n        \'total_active_customers\': num_active_customers,\n        \'total_all_customers\': total_customers\n    }\n\n    for cid, data in customer_metrics.items():\n        share = (data[\'total_sales\'] / total_sales_all * 100) if total_sales_all > 0 else 0\n        status_str = "正常" if data[\'status\'] == 1 else "停用"\n        first_order = data[\'first_order_date\'] if data[\'first_order_date\'] else "-"\n        \n        print(f"{data[\'name\']:<20} | {data[\'code\']:<10} | {status_str:<6} | {data[\'created_at\'][:19]:<20} | {first_order:<12} | {data[\'valid_order_count\']:<8} | {data[\'total_sales\']:<12.2f} | {share:<10.2f}")\n        \n        if data[\'valid_order_count\'] > 0:\n            handoff_data[\'active_customer_ids\'].append(cid)\n\n    if sorted_active:\n        handoff_data[\'top_customer_id\'] = sorted_active[0].get(\'id\') # Need to map back to ID, currently iterating dict values which lost keys? No, we iterated items earlier but here we iterate values. Let\'s fix logic to keep ID.\n        \n    # Re-iterate to ensure IDs are captured correctly for handoff\n    handoff_data[\'active_customer_ids\'] = []\n    max_sales = -1\n    top_cust_id = None\n    \n    for cid, data in customer_metrics.items():\n        if data[\'valid_order_count\'] > 0:\n            handoff_data[\'active_customer_ids\'].append(cid)\n            if data[\'total_sales\'] > max_sales:\n                max_sales = data[\'total_sales\']\n                top_cust_id = cid\n    \n    handoff_data[\'top_customer_id\'] = top_cust_id\n\n    print("\\n=== 客户集中度指标 ===")\n    print(f"客户总数: {total_customers}")\n    print(f"有成交客户数: {num_active_customers}")\n    print(f"有成交客户占比: {(num_active_customers/total_customers*100) if total_customers>0 else 0:.2f}%")\n    print(f"第一大客户销售占比: {top_customer_share:.2f}%")\n    print(f"前两大客户销售占比: {top_two_share:.2f}%")\n    \n    print("\\n=== 客户活跃度与转化详情 ===")\n    for cid, data in customer_metrics.items():\n        if data[\'valid_order_count\'] > 0:\n            avg_order_val = data[\'total_sales\'] / data[\'valid_order_count\']\n            print(f"客户: {data[\'name\']} | 平均客单价: {avg_order_val:.2f} | 最近下单: {data[\'last_order_date\'] if data[\'last_order_date\'] else \'-\'}")\n        else:\n            print(f"客户: {data[\'name\']} | 无有效成交记录")\n\n    cursor.close()\n    conn.rollback()\n    conn.close()\n\n    print(\'__HANDOFF__\' + json.dumps(handoff_data))\n\nexcept Exception as e:\n    print(f"Error: {e}")\n    import traceback\n    traceback.print_exc()\n```\n**执行结果**:\n```text\nError: \'NoneType\' object has no attribute \'cursor\'\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File "<string>", line 10, in <module>\nAttributeError: \'NoneType\' object has no attribute \'cursor\'\n```\n\n### 步骤 5: 步骤5：查询供应商基础档案信息及采购入库相关的库存流水记录，分析供应商与商品的关联关系及采购业务衔接情况\n**执行代码**:\n```python\nimport json\nfrom decimal import Decimal\n\nconn = get_connection()\ncursor = conn.cursor()\n\n# 1. 查询供应商基础档案信息\nsql_suppliers = """\nSELECT \n    id,\n    code,\n    name,\n    contact,\n    phone,\n    address,\n    status,\n    created_at,\n    updated_at\nFROM virtual_erp.suppliers\n"""\ncursor.execute(sql_suppliers)\nsuppliers_rows = cursor.fetchall()\nsupplier_columns = [desc[0] for desc in cursor.description]\nsuppliers_data = [dict(zip(supplier_columns, row)) for row in suppliers_rows]\n\nprint("=== 供应商基础档案信息 ===")\nif suppliers_data:\n    for row in suppliers_data:\n        print(f"ID: {row[\'id\']}, Code: {row[\'code\']}, Name: {row[\'name\']}, Contact: {row[\'contact\']}, Phone: {row[\'phone\']}, Address: {row[\'address\']}, Status: {row[\'status\']}, CreatedAt: {row[\'created_at\']}")\nelse:\n    print("无供应商数据")\n\n# 2. 查询库存流水记录，特别是入库相关的记录，以分析采购来源\nsql_stock_logs = """\nSELECT \n    sl.id,\n    sl.product_id,\n    p.name as product_name,\n    sl.change_qty,\n    sl.change_type,\n    sl.ref_no,\n    sl.remark,\n    sl.created_at\nFROM virtual_erp.stock_logs sl\nJOIN virtual_erp.products p ON sl.product_id = p.id\nORDER BY sl.created_at DESC\n"""\ncursor.execute(sql_stock_logs)\nstock_logs_rows = cursor.fetchall()\nstock_log_columns = [desc[0] for desc in cursor.description]\nstock_logs_data = [dict(zip(stock_log_columns, row)) for row in stock_logs_rows]\n\nprint("\\n=== 库存流水记录 (含商品名称) ===")\nif stock_logs_data:\n    for row in stock_logs_data:\n        print(f"LogID: {row[\'id\']}, ProductID: {row[\'product_id\']}, ProductName: {row[\'product_name\']}, ChangeQty: {row[\'change_qty\']}, ChangeType: {row[\'change_type\']}, RefNo: {row[\'ref_no\']}, Remark: {row[\'remark\']}, CreatedAt: {row[\'created_at\']}")\nelse:\n    print("无库存流水数据")\n\n# 3. 分析供应商与商品的关联关系\n# 由于 stock_logs 中没有 supplier_id，且 products 表中也没有 supplier_id，我们需要确认是否存在其他表或字段能建立联系。\n# 根据提供的表结构，确实没有直接的供应商-商品关联字段。\n# 因此，我们将基于现有数据进行逻辑判断：如果库存流水中的 ref_no 或 remark 包含供应商信息，则提取；否则视为无法直接追溯。\n\nsupplier_ids = [s[\'id\'] for s in suppliers_data]\ninbound_logs = []\nfor log in stock_logs_data:\n    ct = str(log[\'change_type\']).upper() if log[\'change_type\'] else ""\n    if \'IN\' in ct or \'PURCHASE\' in ct:\n        inbound_logs.append(log)\n\nhandoff_data = {\n    "supplier_ids": supplier_ids,\n    "has_supplier_product_link": False,\n    "inbound_log_count": len(inbound_logs),\n    "total_stock_log_count": len(stock_logs_data)\n}\n\nprint(\'__HANDOFF__\' + json.dumps(handoff_data))\n\ncursor.close()\nconn.rollback()\nconn.close()\n```\n**执行结果**:\n```text\n=== 供应商基础档案信息 ===\nID: 1, Code: S20240001, Name: 东莞精工电子厂, Contact: 陈明, Phone: 13900139001, Address: 东莞市长安镇工业区, Status: 1, CreatedAt: 2026-10-21 15:30:08\nID: 2, Code: S20240002, Name: 杭州润泽包装材料有限公司, Contact: 刘芳, Phone: 13900139002, Address: 杭州市余杭区仁和街道, Status: 1, CreatedAt: 2026-10-21 15:30:08\n\n=== 库存流水记录 (含商品名称) ===\nLogID: 12, ProductID: 6, ProductName: 折叠办公桌 120cm, ChangeQty: 1, ChangeType: in, RefNo: SO202610210004, Remark: 订单取消回补, CreatedAt: 2026-10-21 15:57:08\nLogID: 11, ProductID: 6, ProductName: 折叠办公桌 120cm, ChangeQty: -1, ChangeType: out, RefNo: SO202610210004, Remark: 销售出库, CreatedAt: 2026-10-21 15:56:51\nLogID: 7, ProductID: 1, ProductName: 无线蓝牙耳机 Air Pro, ChangeQty: 3, ChangeType: in, RefNo: SO202610210003, Remark: 订单取消回补, CreatedAt: 2026-10-21 15:49:56\nLogID: 8, ProductID: 4, ProductName: 牛皮纸包装盒(中号), ChangeQty: 20, ChangeType: in, RefNo: SO202610210003, Remark: 订单取消回补, CreatedAt: 2026-10-21 15:49:56\nLogID: 9, ProductID: 1, ProductName: 无线蓝牙耳机 Air Pro, ChangeQty: -3, ChangeType: out, RefNo: SO202610210003, Remark: 订单恢复重新出库, CreatedAt: 2026-10-21 15:49:56\nLogID: 10, ProductID: 4, ProductName: 牛皮纸包装盒(中号), ChangeQty: -20, ChangeType: out, RefNo: SO202610210003, Remark: 订单恢复重新出库, CreatedAt: 2026-10-21 15:49:56\nLogID: 6, ProductID: 5, ProductName: 气泡袋 20x30cm, ChangeQty: 200, ChangeType: in, RefNo: None, Remark: 采购入库, CreatedAt: 2026-10-21 15:31:47\nLogID: 4, ProductID: 1, ProductName: 无线蓝牙耳机 Air Pro, ChangeQty: -3, ChangeType: out, RefNo: SO202610210003, Remark: 销售出库, CreatedAt: 2026-10-21 15:30:22\nLogID: 5, ProductID: 4, ProductName: 牛皮纸包装盒(中号), ChangeQty: -20, ChangeType: out, RefNo: SO202610210003, Remark: 销售出库, CreatedAt: 2026-10-21 15:30:22\nLogID: 1, ProductID: 1, ProductName: 无线蓝牙耳机 Air Pro, ChangeQty: -2, ChangeType: out, RefNo: SO202610210001, Remark: 销售出库, CreatedAt: 2026-10-21 15:30:08\nLogID: 2, ProductID: 3, ProductName: Type-C 数据线 1.5m, ChangeQty: -5, ChangeType: out, RefNo: SO202610210001, Remark: 销售出库, CreatedAt: 2026-10-21 15:30:08\nLogID: 3, ProductID: 2, ProductName: 65W 氮化镓快充充电器, ChangeQty: -10, ChangeType: out, RefNo: SO202610210002, Remark: 销售出库, CreatedAt: 2026-10-21 15:30:08\n```\n\n### 步骤 6: 步骤6：查询库存变动明细（进销存流水），包括本期入库与出库记录、变动类型及时间戳，结合商品当前库存分析库存结构、预警情况及动销细节\n**执行代码**:\n```python\nimport pandas as pd\n\nconn = get_connection()\ncursor = conn.cursor()\n\ntry:\n    # 1. 查询库存流水明细，关联商品表获取名称、分类、成本价、销售价、当前库存、安全库存\n    sql_stock_logs = """\n    SELECT \n        sl.id,\n        sl.created_at,\n        sl.change_type,\n        sl.change_qty,\n        sl.ref_no,\n        sl.remark,\n        p.name as product_name,\n        p.category,\n        p.cost_price,\n        p.sale_price,\n        p.stock_qty as current_stock_qty,\n        p.safety_stock\n    FROM virtual_erp.stock_logs sl\n    JOIN virtual_erp.products p ON sl.product_id = p.id\n    ORDER BY sl.created_at DESC;\n    """\n    cursor.execute(sql_stock_logs)\n    rows_stock_logs = cursor.fetchall()\n    columns_stock_logs = [desc[0] for desc in cursor.description]\n    df_stock_logs = pd.DataFrame(rows_stock_logs, columns=columns_stock_logs)\n    \n    print("=== 库存变动明细 (Stock Logs) ===")\n    if not df_stock_logs.empty:\n        print(df_stock_logs.to_string(index=False))\n    else:\n        print("无库存变动记录")\n    print("\\n")\n\n    # 2. 查询所有商品的当前库存状态及预警情况\n    sql_product_stock_status = """\n    SELECT \n        id,\n        name,\n        category,\n        sku,\n        cost_price,\n        sale_price,\n        stock_qty,\n        safety_stock,\n        status,\n        created_at,\n        updated_at\n    FROM virtual_erp.products\n    ORDER BY stock_qty DESC;\n    """\n    cursor.execute(sql_product_stock_status)\n    rows_products = cursor.fetchall()\n    columns_products = [desc[0] for desc in cursor.description]\n    df_products = pd.DataFrame(rows_products, columns=columns_products)\n    \n    print("=== 商品库存现状与预警 (Product Stock Status) ===")\n    if not df_products.empty:\n        # 计算库存金额\n        df_products[\'stock_value_cost\'] = df_products[\'stock_qty\'] * df_products[\'cost_price\']\n        df_products[\'stock_value_sale\'] = df_products[\'stock_qty\'] * df_products[\'sale_price\']\n        \n        # 判断是否低于安全库存 (预警)\n        df_products[\'is_below_safety_stock\'] = df_products[\'stock_qty\'] < df_products[\'safety_stock\']\n        \n        print(df_products[[\'id\', \'name\', \'category\', \'sku\', \'stock_qty\', \'safety_stock\', \'is_below_safety_stock\', \'cost_price\', \'sale_price\', \'stock_value_cost\', \'stock_value_sale\']].to_string(index=False))\n    else:\n        print("无商品数据")\n    print("\\n")\n\n    # 3. 统计本期（根据上一步handoff中的时间范围或全量）入库与出库汇总\n    # 由于没有明确的时间过滤参数传入，这里基于全量数据进行分类统计，以支持进销存分析\n    sql_in_out_summary = """\n    SELECT \n        change_type,\n        COUNT(*) as record_count,\n        SUM(change_qty) as total_qty_change\n    FROM virtual_erp.stock_logs\n    GROUP BY change_type;\n    """\n    cursor.execute(sql_in_out_summary)\n    rows_summary = cursor.fetchall()\n    columns_summary = [desc[0] for desc in cursor.description]\n    df_summary = pd.DataFrame(rows_summary, columns=columns_summary)\n    \n    print("=== 进销存变动类型汇总 (In/Out Summary) ===")\n    if not df_summary.empty:\n        print(df_summary.to_string(index=False))\n    else:\n        print("无汇总数据")\n    print("\\n")\n\n    # 4. 结合订单明细计算销量，用于动销率分析\n    # 查询有效订单的商品销量\n    sql_sales_volume = """\n    SELECT \n        soi.product_id,\n        p.name as product_name,\n        SUM(soi.qty) as total_sold_qty,\n        SUM(soi.amount) as total_sold_amount\n    FROM virtual_erp.sales_order_items soi\n    JOIN virtual_erp.sales_orders so ON soi.order_id = so.id\n    JOIN virtual_erp.products p ON soi.product_id = p.id\n    WHERE so.status != \'cancelled\' \n    GROUP BY soi.product_id, p.name;\n    """\n    cursor.execute(sql_sales_volume)\n    rows_sales = cursor.fetchall()\n    columns_sales = [desc[0] for desc in cursor.description]\n    df_sales = pd.DataFrame(rows_sales, columns=columns_sales)\n    \n    print("=== 商品累计销量统计 (Sales Volume by Product) ===")\n    if not df_sales.empty:\n        print(df_sales.to_string(index=False))\n    else:\n        print("无销售记录")\n    print("\\n")\n\n    # 5. 综合动销分析：将库存与销量合并\n    if not df_products.empty and not df_sales.empty:\n        df_merchandise_analysis = df_products.merge(df_sales, left_on=\'id\', right_on=\'product_id\', how=\'left\')\n        df_merchandise_analysis[\'total_sold_qty\'] = df_merchandise_analysis[\'total_sold_qty\'].fillna(0)\n        df_merchandise_analysis[\'total_sold_amount\'] = df_merchandise_analysis[\'total_sold_amount\'].fillna(0)\n        \n        # 动销率 = 销量 / (销量 + 当前库存)\n        denominator = df_merchandise_analysis[\'total_sold_qty\'] + df_merchandise_analysis[\'stock_qty\']\n        df_merchandise_analysis[\'sell_through_rate\'] = df_merchandise_analysis.apply(\n            lambda row: (row[\'total_sold_qty\'] / denominator[row.name]) if denominator[row.name] > 0 else 0, axis=1\n        )\n        \n        # 滞销标记：销量为0且库存大于0\n        df_merchandise_analysis[\'is_stagnant\'] = (df_merchandise_analysis[\'total_sold_qty\'] == 0) & (df_merchandise_analysis[\'stock_qty\'] > 0)\n        \n        print("=== 商品动销与滞销分析 (Sell-Through Analysis) ===")\n        cols_to_show = [\'id\', \'name\', \'category\', \'stock_qty\', \'total_sold_qty\', \'total_sold_amount\', \'sell_through_rate\', \'is_stagnant\', \'stock_value_cost\']\n        print(df_merchandise_analysis[cols_to_show].to_string(index=False))\n    elif not df_products.empty:\n        # 如果没有销量数据，直接显示库存并标记潜在滞销\n        df_products[\'total_sold_qty\'] = 0\n        df_products[\'total_sold_amount\'] = 0\n        df_products[\'sell_through_rate\'] = 0\n        df_products[\'is_stagnant\'] = df_products[\'stock_qty\'] > 0\n        \n        print("=== 商品动销与滞销分析 (No Sales Data) ===")\n        cols_to_show = [\'id\', \'name\', \'category\', \'stock_qty\', \'total_sold_qty\', \'total_sold_amount\', \'sell_through_rate\', \'is_stagnant\', \'stock_value_cost\']\n        print(df_products[cols_to_show].to_string(index=False))\n    else:\n        print("无法进行动销分析，缺少基础数据")\n\nfinally:\n    conn.rollback()\n    cursor.close()\n    conn.close()\n```\n**执行结果**:\n```text\n=== 库存变动明细 (Stock Logs) ===\n id          created_at change_type  change_qty         ref_no   remark    product_name category cost_price sale_price  current_stock_qty  safety_stock\n 12 2026-10-21 15:57:08          in           1 SO202610210004   订单取消回补     折叠办公桌 120cm     办公家具     210.00     399.00                 35             5\n 11 2026-10-21 15:56:51         out          -1 SO202610210004     销售出库     折叠办公桌 120cm     办公家具     210.00     399.00                 35             5\n  7 2026-10-21 15:49:56          in           3 SO202610210003   订单取消回补  无线蓝牙耳机 Air Pro     数码配件      98.00     199.00                115            20\n  8 2026-10-21 15:49:56          in          20 SO202610210003   订单取消回补      牛皮纸包装盒(中号)     包装耗材       1.80       3.50                780           200\n  9 2026-10-21 15:49:56         out          -3 SO202610210003 订单恢复重新出库  无线蓝牙耳机 Air Pro     数码配件      98.00     199.00                115            20\n 10 2026-10-21 15:49:56         out         -20 SO202610210003 订单恢复重新出库      牛皮纸包装盒(中号)     包装耗材       1.80       3.50                780           200\n  6 2026-10-21 15:31:47          in         200            NaN     采购入库     气泡袋 20x30cm     包装耗材       0.35       1.00                250           100\n  4 2026-10-21 15:30:22         out          -3 SO202610210003     销售出库  无线蓝牙耳机 Air Pro     数码配件      98.00     199.00                115            20\n  5 2026-10-21 15:30:22         out         -20 SO202610210003     销售出库      牛皮纸包装盒(中号)     包装耗材       1.80       3.50                780           200\n  1 2026-10-21 15:30:08         out          -2 SO202610210001     销售出库  无线蓝牙耳机 Air Pro     数码配件      98.00     199.00                115            20\n  2 2026-10-21 15:30:08         out          -5 SO202610210001     销售出库 Type-C 数据线 1.5m     数码配件       6.50      19.90                495           100\n  3 2026-10-21 15:30:08         out         -10 SO202610210002     销售出库    65W 氮化镓快充充电器     数码配件   