ql, params) 参数绑定，表名使用已提供的库名.表名，字段和 JOIN 必须依据本次实时字段及有效关联关系。使用 try/finally，在结束时 rollback 并关闭连接；get_connection() 不可用时抛出错误，禁止换数据源。按字段注释和技能规则解释业务条件，不臆造字段，不编造数据。每步在独立命名空间执行，前序结果只能从任务指定的衔接字典按键获取，或重新查询。需要向后续步骤传参时，按任务要求 print(\'__HANDOFF__\'+json.dumps({...}))，仅放JSON可序列化对象。数据结果必须 print 为纯文本表格，不能只用 display 或图表；空结果如实说明。\n\n你是一个精通Python和数据处理的AI修复助手。请只输出纯Python代码。'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': '你生成的 Python 代码在沙箱中执行时发生了报错。\n【原始任务】: 步骤1：查询经营总览数据，包括本期销售总额、毛利额、订单总数、有成交客户数及库存总金额\n【你的代码】:\n```python\nimport json\nfrom decimal import Decimal\n\ndef get_connection():\n    # 沙箱环境提供，此处仅为占位符，实际执行时由沙箱注入\n    pass\n\ntry:\n    conn = get_connection()\n    cursor = conn.cursor()\n\n    # 1. 查询本期销售总额、订单总数（有效订单）\n    sql_sales_summary = """\n        SELECT \n            COUNT(*) as order_count,\n            COALESCE(SUM(total_amount), 0) as total_sales\n        FROM virtual_erp.sales_orders\n        WHERE status != \'cancelled\'\n          AND YEAR(order_date) = YEAR(CURDATE())\n    """\n    cursor.execute(sql_sales_summary)\n    sales_row = cursor.fetchone()\n    order_count = sales_row[0] if sales_row else 0\n    total_sales = float(sales_row[1]) if sales_row and sales_row[1] is not None else 0.0\n\n    # 2. 查询有成交客户数\n    sql_customer_count = """\n        SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT customer_id)\n        FROM virtual_erp.sales_orders\n        WHERE status != \'cancelled\'\n          AND YEAR(order_date) = YEAR(CURDATE())\n    """\n    cursor.execute(sql_customer_count)\n    cust_row = cursor.fetchone()\n    active_customers = cust_row[0] if cust_row else 0\n\n    # 3. 查询库存总金额 (基于当前库存数量 * 成本价)\n    sql_inventory_value = """\n        SELECT COALESCE(SUM(stock_qty * cost_price), 0)\n        FROM virtual_erp.products\n        WHERE stock_qty > 0\n    """\n    cursor.execute(sql_inventory_value)\n    inv_row = cursor.fetchone()\n    inventory_total_value = float(inv_row[0]) if inv_row and inv_row[0] is not None else 0.0\n\n    # 4. 计算毛利额\n    # 需要关联订单明细和商品表来计算每笔有效订单的毛利\n    # 毛利 = (成交单价 - 成本价) * 数量\n    sql_gross_profit = """\n        SELECT COALESCE(SUM((soi.unit_price - p.cost_price) * soi.qty), 0)\n        FROM virtual_erp.sales_order_items soi\n        JOIN virtual_erp.sales_orders so ON soi.order_id = so.id\n        JOIN virtual_erp.products p ON soi.product_id = p.id\n        WHERE so.status != \'cancelled\'\n          AND YEAR(so.order_date) = YEAR(CURDATE())\n    """\n    cursor.execute(sql_gross_profit)\n    gp_row = cursor.fetchone()\n    gross_profit = float(gp_row[0]) if gp_row and gp_row[0] is not None else 0.0\n\n    # 输出结果表格\n    print("经营总览数据:")\n    print(f"{\'指标\':<20} | {\'数值\':<15}")\n    print("-" * 36)\n    print(f"{\'本期销售总额\':<20} | {total_sales:<15.2f}")\n    print(f"{\'本期毛利额\':<20} | {gross_profit:<15.2f}")\n    print(f"{\'有效订单总数\':<20} | {order_count:<15}")\n    print(f"{\'有成交客户数\':<20} | {active_customers:<15}")\n    print(f"{\'库存总金额\':<20} | {inventory_total_value:<15.2f}")\n\n    # 准备传递给后续步骤的数据\n    handoff_data = {\n        "total_sales": total_sales,\n        "gross_profit": gross_profit,\n        "order_count": order_count,\n        "active_customers": active_customers,\n        "inventory_total_value": inventory_total_value\n    }\n    \n    print(\'__HANDOFF__\' + json.dumps(handoff_data))\n\nexcept Exception as e:\n    print(f"Error: {str(e)}")\nfinally:\n    if \'cursor\' in locals():\n        cursor.close()\n    if \'conn\' in locals():\n        conn.rollback()\n        conn.close()\n```\n【执行报错】:\nError: AttributeError: \'NoneType\' object has no attribute \'rollback\'\n\n请仔细分析报错原因并修复代码。注意：\n1. 如果是 SQL 语法或字段找不到错误，请检查 JOIN 条件、表别名或使用的数据表字段名是否正确。\n2. 如果是 Pandas 数据处理报错，请检查 DataFrame 的类型或缺失值。\n3. 如果是 __HANDOFF__ 打印报错（如 json 序列化失败），请只放入可 JSON 序列化的简单参数（int/float/str/列表），并把 DataFrame 等对象排除在外。\n4. 如果报错涉及 decimal.Decimal 与 float 混算（unsupported operand type(s) for /: \'float\' and \'decimal.Decimal\'），说明 MySQL 的 DECIMAL 列或 SUM/AVG 聚合结果返回的是 Decimal，必须在参与除法、百分比等运算前显式 float() 转换；round() 之后也要 float() 才能被 json.dumps 序列化。\n请输出修复后的纯 Python 代码内容