构建排除状态的 SQL 片段\n    if valid_status_exclude:\n        placeholders = \', \'.join([\'%s\'] * len(valid_status_exclude))\n        status_condition = f"AND so.status NOT IN ({placeholders})"\n        params = [start_date, end_date] + valid_status_exclude\n    else:\n        status_condition = ""\n        params = [start_date, end_date]\n\n    sql = f"""\n    SELECT \n        p.id AS product_id,\n        p.sku,\n        p.name AS product_name,\n        p.category,\n        p.cost_price,\n        p.sale_price,\n        p.stock_qty,\n        p.safety_stock,\n        SUM(soi.qty) AS total_sales_qty,\n        SUM(soi.amount) AS total_sales_amount,\n        SUM(soi.amount - (soi.qty * p.cost_price)) AS gross_profit\n    FROM virtual_erp.sales_orders so\n    JOIN virtual_erp.sales_order_items soi ON so.id = soi.order_id\n    JOIN virtual_erp.products p ON soi.product_id = p.id\n    WHERE so.order_date BETWEEN %s AND %s\n      {status_condition}\n    GROUP BY \n        p.id,\n        p.sku,\n        p.name,\n        p.category,\n        p.cost_price,\n        p.sale_price,\n        p.stock_qty,\n        p.safety_stock\n    ORDER BY total_sales_amount DESC\n    """\n    \n    cursor.execute(sql, params)\n    columns = [desc[0] for desc in cursor.description]\n    rows = cursor.fetchall()\n    \n    # 处理数据并打印表格\n    print(f"商品维度分析数据 ({start_date} 至 {end_date}):")\n    header = "\\t".join(columns)\n    print(header)\n    print("-" * len(header))\n    \n    product_analysis_list = []\n    \n    for row in rows:\n        # 将 Decimal 转换为 float 以便 JSON 序列化及后续计算\n        processed_row = {}\n        for i, col in enumerate(columns):\n            val = row[i]\n            if isinstance(val, Decimal):\n                val = float(val)\n            elif val is None:\n                val = 0.0 if \'amount\' in col or \'profit\' in col or \'qty\' in col else None\n            processed_row[col] = val\n        \n        results.append(processed_row)\n        \n        # 格式化输出行\n        line_vals = []\n        for col in columns:\n            v = processed_row[col]\n            if isinstance(v, float):\n                line_vals.append(f"{v:.2f}")\n            else:\n                line_vals.append(str(v))\n        print("\\t".join(line_vals))\n        \n        # 准备用于 Handoff 的数据结构（简化版，只保留关键指标）\n        product_analysis_list.append({\n            "product_id": int(processed_row[\'product_id\']),\n            "sku": str(processed_row[\'sku\']),\n            "name": str(processed_row[\'product_name\']),\n            "category": str(processed_row[\'category\']),\n            "total_sales_qty": float(processed_row[\'total_sales_qty\']),\n            "total_sales_amount": float(processed_row[\'total_sales_amount\']),\n            "gross_profit": float(processed_row[\'gross_profit\']),\n            "stock_qty": int(processed_row[\'stock_qty\']),\n            "safety_stock": int(processed_row[\'safety_stock\'])\n        })\n\n    if not results:\n        print("无符合条件的销售记录。")\n\n    # 输出 Handoff 参数\n    # 后续步骤可能需要：1. ABC分析用的销售额列表；2. 滞销品识别用的库存与销售对比数据\n    handoff_payload = {\n        "product_analysis_data": product_analysis_list,\n        "period_start": start_date,\n        "period_end": end_date\n    }\n    print(\'__HANDOFF__\' + json.dumps(handoff_payload))\n\nexcept Exception as e:\n    print(f"执行出错: {str(e)}")\n    raise e\nfinally:\n    if cursor:\n        cursor.close()\n    if conn:\n        try:\n            conn.rollback()\n        except:\n            pass\n        conn.close()\n```\n【执行报错】:\nError: AttributeError: \'NoneType\' object has no attribute \'cursor\'\n\n请仔细分析报错原因并修复代码。注意：\n1. 如果是 SQL 语法或字段找不到错误，请检查 JOIN 条件、表别名或使用的数据表字段名是否正确。\n2. 如果是 Pandas 数据处理报错，请检查 DataFrame 的类型或缺失值。\n3. 如果是 __HANDOFF__ 打印报错（如 json 序列化失败），请只放入可 JSON 序列化的简单参数（int/float/str/列表），并把 DataFrame 等对象排除在外。\n4. 如果报错涉及 decimal.Decimal 与 float 混算（unsupported operand type(s) for /: \'float\' and \'decimal.Decimal\'），说明 MySQL 的 DECIMAL 列或 SUM/AVG 聚合结果返回的是 Decimal，必须在参与除法、百分比等运算前显式