2026-10-23 10:14:03,372 - openai._base_client - DEBUG - Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/chat/completions', 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-45e18862-0514-4490-981f-b5d462c137cf', 'security': {'bearer_auth': True}, 'content': None, 'json_data': {'messages': [{'role': 'system', 'content': '【当前系统时间】\n2026-10-23 10:14:03（周五）\n涉及日期、时间、时效性判断（如“今天”“本月”“最近”）时，一律以上述时间为基准，不得臆造、替换或推算错误的时间。当用户未提出时间内容时不要随意推算或带入当前时间。\n\n【报告模板】\nerp经营数据报告\n\n【模板目标】\n基于ERP或业务系统数据，对销售、商品、客户、供应商及库存进行多维度诊断，识别经营风险与结构问题，为管理层提供决策依据。\n\n【报告结构与写作规范】（必须严格遵守：章节顺序、标题、写作要点、呈现形式以本节为准；本节只是写作指引，不是报告素材，任何库名、表名、字段名、指标口径都不允许出现在报告里）\n---\nname: template-abb245cc921144d2814488cb\ndescription: "通用经营分析报告"\n---\n\n# 通用经营分析报告\n\n基于ERP或业务系统数据，对销售、商品、客户、供应商及库存进行多维度诊断，识别经营风险与结构问题，为管理层提供决策依据。\n\n根据本次资料分析和写作。示例主题和实体不作为必填目标；不能推导的内容省略并单独提示，不能凭空编造。\n\n## 一、报告概要\n\n这一部分的作用：界定分析边界，明确统计口径，并提炼核心结论以引导读者关注重点。\n\n首先说明数据来源（如系统记录）、统计截止时间及覆盖的业务实体范围（如订单数、SKU数）。其次解释关键指标的计算逻辑（如毛利定义、是否含取消订单等）。最后，用精炼的语言概括本期经营的3-4个核心特征（如规模、集中度、资金效率、流程瓶颈），直接点出主要矛盾。\n\n呈现形式：正文\n- 分析方法：梳理数据完整性与局限性\n- 分析方法：定义统计口径以避免歧义\n- 分析方法：从全局视角提取最具代表性的经营特征\n- 资料需求：统计周期起止时间\n- 资料需求：涉及的业务对象数量（客户、供应商、商品、订单）\n- 资料需求：核心财务指标汇总值\n- 资料需求：主要异常现象描述\n\n\n## 二、经营总览\n\n这一部分的作用：展示整体业绩表现，通过关键指标对比和订单概况建立宏观认知。\n\n使用表格列出销售额、毛利、毛利率、客单价、库存占用等核心KPI，并附带简要说明（如行业水平对比或环比变化）。随后简述订单的整体分布情况，包括有效/取消比例、金额区间分布，判断是否存在极端值或结构性失衡。\n\n呈现形式：表格、正文\n- 分析方法：计算并汇总关键财务与运营指标\n- 分析方法：评估指标的健康度（如毛利率是否在合理区间）\n- 分析方法：分析订单金额的离散程度与均衡性\n- 资料需求：总销售额、总毛利、毛利率\n- 资料需求：平均客单价、平均件均价\n- 资料需求：有效订单数、取消订单数\n- 资料需求：单笔订单金额分布数据\n\n\n## 三、销售订单分析\n\n这一部分的作用：深入剖析订单细节，揭示交易行为背后的构成逻辑与流转效率。\n\n分四个维度展开：1. **规模与分布**：列表展示各订单金额及占比，分析极差与均值关系；2. **构成**：拆解订单内的商品组合（品项数、件数），指出“件数与金额不成正比”等潜在成本陷阱；3. **流转**：统计各状态（待处理、已付款、发货等）的订单数量与金额，识别流程停滞环节；4. **取消**：单独分析取消订单的原因及其对特定品类或库存的连锁影响。\n\n呈现形式：表格、列表、正文\n- 分析方法：计算订单金额占比与集中度\n- 分析方法：关联分析订单件数与金额的相关性\n- 分析方法：追踪订单状态变更频率与停留时长\n- 分析方法：评估取消订单对营收结构的冲击\n- 资料需求：订单明细（ID、客户、金额、状态、时间戳）\n- 资料需求：订单行项目（商品、数量、单价）\n- 资料需求：取消订单的具体原因或备注\n\n\n## 四、商品分析\n\n这一部分的作用：评估商品的销售贡献、盈利能力及生命周期状态，优化产品组合。\n\n1. **销量与销售额**：对比销量占比与销售额占比，识别“走量不创收”或“高价低频”的商品；2. **毛利贡献**：分析各商品的毛利率与毛利额，区分高利润率低销量与低利润率高销量的策略差异；3. **分级管理**：按累计销售额将商品划分为主力、重点、补充、滞销等级别；4. **滞销专项**：详细列出零销售或低周转商品，计算其占用的库存资金比例，警示资金沉淀风险。\n\n呈现形式：表格、正文\n- 分析方法：计算单品销量/销售额占比及错位程度\n- 分析方法：分解毛利来源，评估定价策略一致性\n- 分析方法：应用帕累托原则（二八定律）进行商品分级\n- 分析方法：量化滞销商品的资金占用成本\n- 资料需求：商品维度的销量、销售额、成本、毛利\n- 资料需求：商品分类信息\n- 资料需求：库存中各商品的当前数量与价值\n\n\n## 五、客户分析\n\n这一部分的作用：衡量客户价值贡献，评估收入稳定性与客户依赖风险。\n\n1. **贡献度**：列表展示各客户的订单数、销售额及占比，对比活跃与非活跃客户；2. **集中度**：计算第一大客户占比、前两大客户占比及赫芬达尔指数（HHI）或类似集中度指标，判断是否过度依赖单一客户；3. **活跃与转化**：分析有成交客户占比，观察复购频次，识别“建档未下单”或“首单即取消”的客户类型。\n\n呈现形式：表格、正文\n- 分析方法：排序客户销售额并计算累计占比\n- 分析方法：评估客户集中度带来的经营风险\n- 分析方法：分析客户转化率与复购行为模式\n- 资料需求：客户维度的交易汇总数据\n- 资料需求：客户建档时间与首次/最近交易时间\n- 资料需求：客户订单历史序列\n\n\n## 六、供应商分析\n\n这一部分的作用：审查供应链资源的有效性，验证采购业务与实际交易的关联性。\n\n1. **资源现状**：列出供应商基本信息及状态，确认档案完整性；2. **业务衔接**：检查系统中是否存在采购单据、入库记录与供应商的对应关系，若缺失则明确指出“采购不可追溯”或“供应商空转”的问题；3. **品类映射**：基于名称或主营方向推测供应商对应的商品品类，并与实际销售额对比，发现供需错配；4. **小结**：总结供应商在成本控制、交期保障等方面的实际作用或缺失。\n\n呈现形式：表格、正文\n- 分析方法：验证供应商档案与交易记录的关联度\n- 分析方法：推断供应商与商品品类的理论对应关系\n- 分析方法：评估采购环节的数据闭环能力\n- 资料需求：供应商基础档案\n- 资料需求：采购入库记录（若有）\n- 资料需求：商品成本来源标识\n\n\n## 七、库存分析\n\n这一部分的作用：监控库存结构与资金效率，预警积压风险与缺货隐患。\n\n1. **结构与资金**：按品类统计库存数量、成本价占用资金及销售价货值，分析资金集中区域；2. **预警检查**：对比当前库存与安全库存线，识别超储或缺货商品，若全部超储则指出预警机制失效；3. **进销存动态**：列出入库、出库及净变动数据，区分正常销售出库与退货回补，还原真实采购动作；4. **动销效率**：计算动销率（销量/(销量+库存)）和库销比，评估库存周转速度，特别关注高库销比的低效商品。\n\n呈现形式：表格、正文\n- 分析方法：计算库存资金占用与销售变现潜力\n- 分析方法：评估安全库存设定的合理性\n- 分析方法：拆解库存变动来源（采购vs销售vs退货）\n- 分析方法：量化库存周转效率与呆滞风险\n- 资料需求：各商品当前库存数量与单价\n- 资料需求：安全库存设定值\n- 资料需求：期间内出入库流水明细\n- 资料需求：期间内销售数量\n\n\n## 八、经营诊断\n\n这一部分的作用：综合前述分析，提炼核心问题并按优先级排序，形成行动指南。\n\n1. **核心发现**：以表格形式列出3-7项关键问题，每项需包含“发现描述”与“数据依据”，确保结论可追溯；2. **轻重缓急**：根据涉及金额大小、数据确定性以及对未来业务的影响程度，将问题分为“紧急且重要”、“重要但不紧急”、“结构性长期问题”等层级，指导资源分配。\n\n呈现形式：表格、正文\n- 分析方法：交叉验证各章节发现的关联性\n- 分析方法：量化问题的财务影响（如资金占用、收入损失）\n- 分析方法：评估问题的紧迫性与解决难度\n- 资料需求：前文各章节的关键异常数据\n- 资料需求：问题对应的潜在经济损失估算\n\n\n## 九、结论\n\n这一部分的作用：总结全文，重申经营现状的本质特征，给出最终的管理建议方向。\n\n回顾核心财务数据，定性评价盈利能力与规模现状。分别简述商品、客户、供应商、库存四大维度的最终状态（如“结构集中”、“环节空转”、“资金沉淀”）。最后，指出当前最直接的着力点（如处置滞销库存、推进停滞订单），强调业务闭环的完整性与起步阶段的特殊性。\n\n呈现形式：正文\n- 分析方法：综合评估业务健康度\n- 分析方法：提炼最高优先级的改进措施\n- 分析方法：展望后续数据分析的重点方向\n- 资料需求：全文核心结论摘要\n- 资料需求：关键行动项清单\n\n\n## 全文规则\n\n- 所有数值必须源自提供的业务数据，严禁虚构或估算未提供的具体金额。\n- 若某环节（如供应商）缺乏实际交易记录，应如实陈述“数据缺失”或“业务未开展”，不得强行编造分析结果。\n- 分析时需区分“事实描述”与“推断”，对于无法直接验证的关系（如供应商与商品的对应），需注明是基于名称或常识的推测。\n- 表格中的数据列顺序应与模板保持一致，便于横向对比不同期间的报告。\n- 语气保持客观、专业，避免情绪化词汇，聚焦于数据反映的经营逻辑与管理漏洞。\n- 对于小样本数据（如试运行阶段），应侧重结构分析而非趋势预测，并在报告中明确说明样本局限性。\n- 保留模板明确的排名数量、筛选范围和表格列顺序；例如前三名不能自行改成前五名。本次用户明确调整时才按新要求执行。\n- 原模板没有图表且用户未要求时不主动新增图表。构成图只使用互斥的明细项，禁止把合计、小计、总计作为一个类别重复计算。\n- 库存缺口数量=max(安全库存-当前库存,0)，不能出现负数；模板要求库存风险清单时，仅列正缺口商品，不把正常库存混入风险清单。\n- 数据需求区分数据库字段、用户需确认的业务口径、前序章节结果及真正缺项；已有前文结果不要求用户重复提供。\n\n## 模板结构与排版\n\n称谓、开场、正文、结语与落款各归其位，不将它们分别扩成编号章节。章节以模板原层级为准，新资料放入相应部分。\n- 原主章节：一、报告概要\t1\n- 原主章节：二、经营总览\t1\n- 原主章节：三、销售订单分析\t1\n- 原主章节：四、商品分析\t1\n- 原主章节：五、客户分析\t1\n- 原主章节：六、供应商分析\t1\n- 原主章节：七、库存分析\t1\n- 原主章节：八、经营诊断\t1\n- 原主章节：九、结论\t1\n- 原主章节：一、报告概要\n- 原主章节：二、经营总览\n- 原主章节：三、销售订单分析\n- 原主章节：四、商品分析\n- 原主章节：五、客户分析\n- 原主章节：六、供应商分析\n- 原主章节：七、库存分析\n- 原主章节：八、经营诊断\n- 原主章节：九、结论\n- title：{"fontFamily": "Microsoft YaHei", "fontSize": 11.0, "bold": false, "alignment": "center", "firstLineIndent": 0, "leftIndent": 0, "rightIndent": 0, "spaceBefore": 150.0, "spaceAfter": 18.0, "lineMultiple": 1.75}\n- body：{"fontFamily": "SimSun", "fontSize": 12.0, "bold": false, "alignment": "justify", "firstLineIndent": 24.0, "leftIndent": 0, "rightIndent": 0, "spaceBefore": 0, "spaceAfter": 8.0, "lineMultiple": 1.75}\n- section：{"fontFamily": "SimSun", "fontSize": 12.0, "bold": false, "alignment": "left", "firstLineIndent": 0, "leftIndent": 0.0, "rightIndent": 0, "spaceBefore": 6.0, "spaceAfter": 6.0, "lineMultiple": 1.5}\n\n## 生成与核对\n\n- 先生成 Markdown。适合比较、归纳或计算的内容使用表格；有数据且需要趋势/构成图时，图表读取同一张表，不另造数字。\n- 计算记录保留原文、单位、公式及结果；图表与表格一致。原文的计划、立场和否定不转写为已完成事实。\n- 先阅读全部资料，按对象、时期和版本整理事实，再把各部分的写作意图映射到本次主题。表格数据可以来自资料推导，不要求原资料已经是表格。\n- 求和、平均、乘除和比率均需说明来源与单位。先算合计再算比率时使用精确中间值，不把推导结果冒充原文记载。\n- 对照各部分的写作意图核对是否遗漏表格、图表或必要说明；资料不足时说明省略原因，不用空壳章节凑结构。\n- 内容复核：未开始不能改成进行中，未到期不等于延期，统计变化不等于已证明的原因；没有资料的可选人员等主题省略，限制和缺项单独提示。\n\n## 图表输出约定\n\n使用 Markdown 表格保存数据。图表声明放在 chart 代码块内，table 从1开始、列从0开始，柱状图/折线图/饼图读取该表而非另一组数字：\n\n```chart\n{"type":"bar","table":1,"title":"指标对比","xColumn":0,"yColumns":[1]}\n```\n\ntype 可为 bar、line、pie；有明确流程依据时可使用 flow，提供 nodes（id、label）和 edges（source、target）。不得用“此处插图”冒充已生成图表。\n\n## 项目组取数约定\n\n只使用本Skill列明且执行时仍有权限的表字段和已登记关系。根据用户需求确定主体、期间、单位和筛选条件，运行时复核结构；本Skill不包含已查询的业务数值。SQL生成与执行由聊天流程负责，不将字段映射当成事实。\n\n【智能体全局设定】\n请你根据返回的企业名称+注册地址给出一套完整的企业详细信息并介绍企业，并支持erp系统的分析报告生成\n\n你是负责生成最终业务报告的助手。模板规范只告诉你“每一章该写什么、怎么写”，数据一律来自执行结果。请用真实数据把模板章节填满，不要把规范本身复述成报告；规范与执行结果冲突时以真实数据为准，绝不沿用模板示例里的旧数值。'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': '用户原始问题：给我一份今年erp系统的经营分析报告\n\n【模板取数执行结果】\n### 步骤 1: 步骤1：查询2026年经营总览核心KPI（销售额、毛利、毛利率、客单价、件均价）及订单状态分布（有效/取消数量、金额区间分布），需关联sales_orders, sales_order_items, products表，过滤order_date在2026-01-01至2026-12-31之间，并假设status=\'completed\'或\'shipped\'为有效订单（若不确定则统计所有状态并在结果中说明）\n**执行代码**:\n```python\nimport json\nfrom decimal import Decimal\n\nconn = None\ncursor = None\n\ntry:\n    conn = get_connection()\n    cursor = conn.cursor()\n    \n    # 定义统计期间：2026年\n    start_date = \'2026-01-01\'\n    end_date = \'2026-12-31\'\n    \n    # 假设有效订单状态为 \'completed\' 或 \'shipped\'，若不确定则先查询所有状态分布以辅助判断\n    # 这里为了计算核心KPI（销售额、毛利等），通常只关注已确认收入的订单。\n    # 根据模板要求：“需用户确认‘有效订单’的状态定义”，此处暂按 status IN (\'completed\', \'shipped\') 处理，\n    # 并在后续结果中展示所有状态的分布以供参考。如果实际数据中只有其他状态，可能需要调整。\n    valid_statuses = (\'completed\', \'shipped\')\n    \n    sql_kpi = """\n    SELECT \n        COUNT(DISTINCT so.id) AS total_orders,\n        SUM(soi.amount) AS total_sales_amount,\n        SUM(soi.amount - (soi.qty * p.cost_price)) AS total_gross_profit,\n        AVG(so.total_amount) AS avg_order_value,\n        AVG(soi.unit_price) AS avg_unit_price\n    FROM virtual_erp.sales_orders so\n    JOIN virtual_erp.sales_order_items soi ON so.id = soi.order_id\n    JOIN virtual_erp.products p ON soi.product_id = p.id\n    WHERE so.order_date BETWEEN %s AND %s\n      AND so.status IN (%s, %s)\n    """\n    \n    params_kpi = (start_date, end_date, valid_statuses[0], valid_statuses[1])\n    cursor.execute(sql_kpi, params_kpi)\n    kpi_row = cursor.fetchone()\n    \n    # 解析 KPI 结果\n    if kpi_row and kpi_row[0] is not None:\n        total_orders = int(kpi_row[0])\n        total_sales_amount = float(kpi_row[1]) if kpi_row[1] else 0.0\n        total_gross_profit = float(kpi_row[2]) if kpi_row[2] else 0.0\n        avg_order_value = float(kpi_row[3]) if kpi_row[3] else 0.0\n        avg_unit_price = float(kpi_row[4]) if kpi_row[4] else 0.0\n        \n        gross_margin_rate = (total_gross_profit / total_sales_amount * 100) if total_sales_amount > 0 else 0.0\n    else:\n        total_orders = 0\n        total_sales_amount = 0.0\n        total_gross_profit = 0.0\n        avg_order_value = 0.0\n        avg_unit_price = 0.0\n        gross_margin_rate = 0.0\n\n    # 打印经营总览核心KPI表格\n    print("=== 2026年经营总览核心KPI ===")\n    print(f"{\'指标\':<20} | {\'数值\':<20}")\n    print("-" * 45)\n    print(f"{\'有效订单数\':<20} | {total_orders:<20}")\n    print(f"{\'总销售额\':<20} | {total_sales_amount:.2f}")\n    print(f"{\'总毛利\':<20} | {total_gross_profit:.2f}")\n    print(f"{\'毛利率(%)\':<20} | {gross_margin_rate:.2f}%")\n    print(f"{\'平均客单价\':<20} | {avg_order_value:.2f}")\n    print(f"{\'平均件均价\':<20} | {avg_unit_price:.2f}")\n    print("")\n\n    # 查询订单状态分布（包括有效和无效/取消等所有状态）\n    sql_status_dist = """\n    SELECT \n        status,\n        COUNT(id) AS order_count,\n        SUM(total_amount) AS total_amount\n    FROM virtual_erp.sales_orders\n    WHERE order_date BETWEEN %s AND %s\n    GROUP BY status\n    ORDER BY order_count DESC\n    """\n    \n    params_status = (start_date, end_date)\n    cursor.execute(sql_status_dist, params_status)\n    status_rows = cursor.fetchall()\n    \n    print("=== 2026年订单状态分布 ===")\n    print(f"{\'状态\':<15} | {\'订单数量\':<10} | {\'总金额\':<15}")\n    print("-" * 45)\n    if status_rows:\n        for row in status_rows:\n            status_val = row[0] if row[0] else \'NULL\'\n            count_val = int(row[1]) if row[1] else 0\n            amount_val = float(row[2]) if row[2] else 0.0\n            print(f"{status_val:<15} | {count_val:<10} | {amount_val:.2f}")\n    else:\n        print("无数据")\n    print("")\n\n    # 查询单笔订单金额分布（基于有效订单）\n    # 分桶：0-1000, 1000-5000, 5000-10000, 10000+\n    sql_amount_dist = """\n    SELECT \n        CASE \n            WHEN total_amount < 1000 THEN \'0-1000\'\n            WHEN total_amount >= 1000 AND total_amount < 5000 THEN \'1000-5000\'\n            WHEN total_amount >= 5000 AND total_amount < 10000 THEN \'5000-10000\'\n            ELSE \'10000+\'\n        END AS amount_range,\n        COUNT(id) AS order_count,\n        SUM(total_amount) AS total_amount\n    FROM virtual_erp.sales_orders\n    WHERE order_date BETWEEN %s AND %s\n      AND status IN (%s, %s)\n    GROUP BY amount_range\n    ORDER BY MIN(total_amount)\n    """\n    \n    params_amount = (start_date, end_date, valid_statuses[0], valid_statuses[1])\n    cursor.execute(sql_amount_dist, params_amount)\n    amount_rows = cursor.fetchall()\n    \n    print("=== 2026年有效订单金额区间分布 ===")\n    print(f"{\'金额区间\':<15} | {\'订单数量\':<10} | {\'区间总金额\':<15}")\n    print("-" * 45)\n    if amount_rows:\n        for row in amount_rows:\n            range_val = row[0]\n            count_val = int(row[1]) if row[1] else 0\n            amount_val = float(row[2]) if row[2] else 0.0\n            print(f"{range_val:<15} | {count_val:<10} | {amount_val:.2f}")\n    else:\n        print("无数据")\n    print("")\n\n    # 传递关键参数给后续步骤\n    handoff_data = {\n        "start_date": start_date,\n        "end_date": end_date,\n        "valid_statuses": list(valid_statuses),\n        "total_valid_orders": total_orders,\n        "total_sales_amount": round(total_sales_amount, 2),\n        "total_gross_profit": round(total_gross_profit, 2)\n    }\n    print(\'__HANDOFF__\' + json.dumps(handoff_data))\n\nexcept Exception as e:\n    print(f"执行出错: {str(e)}")\nfinally:\n    if cursor:\n        cursor.close()\n    if conn:\n        conn.rollback()\n        conn.close()\n```\n**执行结果**:\n```text\n=== 2026年经营总览核心KPI ===\n指标                   | 数值                  \n---------------------------------------------\n有效订单数                | 0                   \n总销售额                 | 0.00\n总毛利                  | 0.00\n毛利率(%)               | 0.00%\n平均客单价                | 0.00\n平均件均价                | 0.00\n\n=== 2026年订单状态分布 ===\n状态              | 订单数量       | 总金额            \n---------------------------------------------\npending         | 2          | 1387.50\ncancelled       | 1          | 399.00\npaid            | 1          | 667.00\n\n=== 2026年有效订单金额区间分布 ===\n金额区间            | 订单数量       | 区间总金额          \n---------------------------------------------\n无数据\n\n```\n\n### 步骤 2: 步骤2：查询2026年销售订单详细流转数据，包括各状态订单的数量与金额占比，以及取消订单的备注信息分析，来源sales_orders表，按status分组统计\n**执行代码**:\n```python\nimport json\n\n# 读取上一步的衔接参数\nhandoff = _HANDOFF_5e6df14dc3\nstart_date = handoff[\'start_date\']\nend_date = handoff[\'end_date\']\n\nconn = None\ncursor = None\ntry:\n    conn = get_connection()\n    cursor = conn.cursor()\n\n    # 查询2026年各状态订单的数量与金额占比\n    sql_status_stats = """\n        SELECT \n            status,\n            COUNT(*) AS order_count,\n            SUM(total_amount) AS total_amount\n        FROM virtual_erp.sales_orders\n        WHERE order_date BETWEEN %s AND %s\n        GROUP BY status\n        ORDER BY total_amount DESC\n    """\n    cursor.execute(sql_status_stats, (start_date, end_date))\n    rows_status = cursor.fetchall()\n\n    # 计算总订单数和总金额用于占比\n    total_orders = sum(r[1] for r in rows_status) if rows_status else 0\n    total_amount_all = sum(float(r[2]) for r in rows_status) if rows_status else 0.0\n\n    print("=== 2026年销售订单各状态统计 ===")\n    print(f"{\'状态\':<15} {\'订单数量\':>10} {\'数量占比(%)\':>12} {\'订单金额\':>15} {\'金额占比(%)\':>12}")\n    print("-" * 70)\n    for row in rows_status:\n        status = row[0] if row[0] else \'NULL\'\n        count = row[1]\n        amount = float(row[2]) if row[2] else 0.0\n        count_pct = (count / total_orders * 100) if total_orders > 0 else 0.0\n        amount_pct = (amount / total_amount_all * 100) if total_amount_all > 0 else 0.0\n        print(f"{status:<15} {count:>10} {count_pct:>12.2f} {amount:>15.2f} {amount_pct:>12.2f}")\n    print(f"\\n合计: 订单数={total_orders}, 总金额={total_amount_all:.2f}")\n\n    # 查询取消订单的备注信息分析\n    sql_cancelled_remarks = """\n        SELECT \n            remark,\n            COUNT(*) AS cnt,\n            SUM(total_amount) AS cancelled_amount\n        FROM virtual_erp.sales_orders\n        WHERE order_date BETWEEN %s AND %s\n          AND status = \'cancelled\'\n        GROUP BY remark\n        ORDER BY cnt DESC\n    """\n    cursor.execute(sql_cancelled_remarks, (start_date, end_date))\n    rows_cancelled = cursor.fetchall()\n\n    print("\\n=== 2026年取消订单备注分布 ===")\n    if rows_cancelled:\n        print(f"{\'备注内容\':<40} {\'取消次数\':>10} {\'涉及金额\':>15}")\n        print("-" * 70)\n        for row in rows_cancelled:\n            remark = row[0] if row[0] else \'(无备注)\'\n            cnt = row[1]\n            amt = float(row[2]) if row[2] else 0.0\n            # 截断过长的备注以便显示\n            display_remark = remark[:38] + \'..\' if len(remark) > 40 else remark\n            print(f"{display_remark:<40} {cnt:>10} {amt:>15.2f}")\n    else:\n        print("2026年无取消订单记录。")\n\n    # 提取后续步骤可能需要的关键数据：有效订单ID列表（completed和shipped）\n    sql_valid_order_ids = """\n        SELECT id\n        FROM virtual_erp.sales_orders\n        WHERE order_date BETWEEN %s AND %s\n          AND status IN (\'completed\', \'shipped\')\n    """\n    cursor.execute(sql_valid_order_ids, (start_date, end_date))\n    valid_id_rows = cursor.fetchall()\n    valid_order_ids = [r[0] for r in valid_id_rows]\n\n    # 输出衔接参数供后续步骤使用\n    handoff_data = {\n        "valid_order_ids": valid_order_ids,\n        "cancelled_order_count": sum(r[1] for r in rows_cancelled) if rows_cancelled else 0,\n        "cancelled_total_amount": float(sum(r[2] for r in rows_cancelled)) if rows_cancelled else 0.0\n    }\n    print(\'__HANDOFF__\' + json.dumps(handoff_data))\n\nexcept Exception as e:\n    raise RuntimeError(f"查询失败: {str(e)}") from e\nfinally:\n    if cursor:\n        cursor.close()\n    if conn:\n        conn.rollback()\n        conn.close()\n```\n**执行结果**:\n```text\n=== 2026年销售订单各状态统计 ===\n状态                    订单数量      数量占比(%)            订单金额      金额占比(%)\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\npending                  2        50.00         1387.50        56.55\npaid                     1        25.00          667.00        27.19\ncancelled                1        25.00          399.00        16.26\n\n合计: 订单数=4, 总金额=2453.50\n\n=== 2026年取消订单备注分布 ===\n备注内容                                           取消次数            涉及金额\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n(无备注)                                             1          399.00\n```\n\n### 步骤 3: 步骤3：查询2026年商品维度分析数据，包括各商品的销量、销售额、成本、毛利、毛利率，并结合当前库存计算库存资金占用，来源sales_order_items, products表，按product_id聚合\n**执行代码**:\n```python\nimport json\n\n# 读取上一步衔接参数\nhandoff = _HANDOFF_5e6df14dc3\nstart_date = handoff[\'start_date\']\nend_date = handoff[\'end_date\']\nvalid_statuses = handoff[\'valid_statuses\']\n\nconn = None\ntry:\n    conn = get_connection()\n    cursor = conn.cursor()\n\n    # 构建有效状态占位符\n    status_placeholders = \', \'.join([\'%s\'] * len(valid_statuses))\n\n    sql = f"""\n        SELECT \n            p.id AS product_id,\n            p.sku,\n            p.name AS product_name,\n            p.category,\n            p.unit,\n            COALESCE(SUM(soi.qty), 0) AS total_qty,\n            COALESCE(SUM(soi.amount), 0) AS total_sales_amount,\n            COALESCE(SUM(soi.qty * p.cost_price), 0) AS total_cost,\n            COALESCE(SUM(soi.amount) - SUM(soi.qty * p.cost_price), 0) AS gross_profit,\n            CASE \n                WHEN COALESCE(SUM(soi.amount), 0) > 0 \n                THEN ROUND((SUM(soi.amount) - SUM(soi.qty * p.cost_price)) / SUM(soi.amount) * 100, 2)\n                ELSE 0 \n            END AS gross_margin_pct,\n            p.stock_qty,\n            p.sale_price,\n            p.cost_price,\n            ROUND(p.stock_qty * p.cost_price, 2) AS stock_value\n        FROM virtual_erp.products p\n        LEFT JOIN virtual_erp.sales_order_items soi ON p.id = soi.product_id\n        LEFT JOIN virtual_erp.sales_orders so ON soi.order_id = so.id\n        WHERE so.status IN ({status_placeholders})\n          AND so.order_date >= %s\n          AND so.order_date <= %s\n        GROUP BY p.id, p.sku, p.name, p.category, p.unit, p.stock_qty, p.sale_price, p.cost_price\n        ORDER BY total_sales_amount DESC\n    """\n\n    params = valid_statuses + [start_date, end_date]\n    cursor.execute(sql, params)\n    rows = cursor.fetchall()\n    columns = [desc[0] for desc in cursor.description]\n\n    # 打印结果表格\n    if not rows:\n        print("查询结果为空：2026年无符合条件的商品维度销售数据。")\n    else:\n        # 计算列宽\n        col_widths = []\n        for i, col in enumerate(columns):\n            max_len = len(col)\n            for row in rows:\n                val_str = str(row[i]) if row[i] is not None else \'NULL\'\n                if len(val_str) > max_len:\n                    max_len = len(val_str)\n            col_widths.append(max_len)\n\n        # 表头\n        header_line = \' | \'.join(str(col).ljust(col_widths[i]) for i, col in enumerate(columns))\n        separator = \'-+-\'.join(\'-\' * w for w in col_widths)\n        print(header_line)\n        print(separator)\n        for row in rows:\n            line = \' | \'.join(\n                (str(row[i]) if row[i] is not None else \'NULL\').ljust(col_widths[i])\n                for i in range(len(columns))\n            )\n            print(line)\n\n        # 汇总统计\n        total_products_with_sales = sum(1 for r in rows if float(r[columns.index(\'total_qty\')]) > 0)\n        total_stock_value_all = sum(float(r[columns.index(\'stock_value\')] or 0) for r in rows)\n        total_gross_profit_all = sum(float(r[columns.index(\'gross_profit\')] or 0) for r in rows)\n        total_sales_all = sum(float(r[columns.index(\'total_sales_amount\')] or 0) for r in rows)\n        print(f"\\n--- 汇总 ---")\n        print(f"有销售记录的商品数: {total_products_with_sales}")\n        print(f"总销售额: {total_sales_all:.2f}")\n        print(f"总毛利: {total_gross_profit_all:.2f}")\n        print(f"全部商品库存资金占用合计: {total_stock_value_all:.2f}")\n\n    # 传递关键信息给后续步骤：商品ID列表及对应指标，供后续分析使用\n    product_ids = [int(r[columns.index(\'product_id\')]) for r in rows]\n    top_selling_skus = [r[columns.index(\'sku\')] for r in rows[:10]] if rows else []\n\n    handoff_data = {\n        "product_ids": product_ids,\n        "top_selling_skus": top_selling_skus,\n        "total_stock_value_all": round(total_stock_value_all, 2) if rows else 0.0,\n        "total_gross_profit_all": round(total_gross_profit_all, 2) if rows else 0.0,\n        "total_sales_all": round(total_sales_all, 2) if rows else 0.0\n    }\n    print(\'__HANDOFF__\' + json.dumps(handoff_data))\n\nfinally:\n    if conn:\n        try:\n            conn.rollback()\n        except Exception:\n            pass\n        conn.close()\n```\n**执行结果**:\n```text\n查询结果为空：2026年无符合条件的商品维度销售数据。\n```\n\n### 步骤 4: 步骤4：查询2026年客户维度贡献度数据，包括各客户的订单数、销售额、首次及最近交易时间，用于计算客户集中度和活跃度，来源sales_orders, customers表，按customer_id聚合\n**执行代码**:\n```python\nimport json\n\n# 获取数据库连接\nconn = get_connection()\ncursor = conn.cursor()\n\ntry:\n    # 读取上一步的衔接参数，确定时间范围\n    handoff_data = _HANDOFF_5e6df14dc3\n    start_date = handoff_data.get(\'start_date\', \'2026-01-01\')\n    end_date = handoff_data.get(\'end_date\', \'2026-12-31\')\n    valid_statuses = handoff_data.get(\'valid_statuses\', [\'completed\', \'shipped\'])\n    \n    # 构建状态占位符\n    status_placeholders = \', \'.join([\'%s\'] * len(valid_statuses))\n    \n    # 查询2026年客户维度贡献度数据\n    # 包括：客户ID、客户名称、订单数、销售额、首次交易时间、最近交易时间\n    sql = f"""\n        SELECT \n            c.id AS customer_id,\n            c.name AS customer_name,\n            COUNT(so.id) AS order_count,\n            SUM(so.total_amount) AS total_sales_amount,\n            MIN(so.order_date) AS first_order_date,\n            MAX(so.order_date) AS last_order_date\n        FROM virtual_erp.sales_orders so\n        INNER JOIN virtual_erp.customers c ON so.customer_id = c.id\n        WHERE so.order_date >= %s\n          AND so.order_date <= %s\n          AND so.status IN ({status_placeholders})\n        GROUP BY c.id, c.name\n        ORDER BY total_sales_amount DESC\n    """\n    \n    params = [start_date, end_date] + valid_statuses\n    cursor.execute(sql, params)\n    \n    results = cursor.fetchall()\n    \n    # 打印结果表格\n    print("=== 2026年客户维度贡献度数据 ===")\n    print(f"{\'客户ID\':<10} {\'客户名称\':<20} {\'订单数\':<8} {\'销售额\':<15} {\'首次交易日期\':<15} {\'最近交易日期\':<15}")\n    print("-" * 90)\n    \n    if not results:\n        print("无符合条件的数据")\n    else:\n        for row in results:\n            customer_id = row[0]\n            customer_name = row[1]\n            order_count = row[2]\n            total_sales = float(row[3]) if row[3] is not None else 0.0\n            first_date = str(row[4]) if row[4] is not None else "N/A"\n            last_date = str(row[5]) if row[5] is not None else "N/A"\n            \n            print(f"{customer_id:<10} {customer_name:<20} {order_count:<8} {total_sales:<15.2f} {first_date:<15} {last_date:<15}")\n        \n        # 计算客户集中度指标（用于后续步骤）\n        total_customers = len(results)\n        total_sales_all = sum(float(r[3]) for r in results if r[3] is not None)\n        \n        # Top 10% 客户的销售额占比（简化为前几个高贡献客户）\n        top_customer_ids = []\n        cumulative_sales = 0.0\n        threshold = total_sales_all * 0.8  # 帕累托原则：80%销售额来自少数客户\n        \n        for row in results:\n            sales = float(row[3]) if row[3] is not None else 0.0\n            cumulative_sales += sales\n            top_customer_ids.append(int(row[0]))\n            if cumulative_sales >= threshold and total_sales_all > 0:\n                break\n        \n        # 准备传递给后续步骤的数据\n        handoff_output = {\n            \'customer_contribution_data\': [\n                {\n                    \'customer_id\': int(r[0]),\n                    \'customer_name\': str(r[1]),\n                    \'order_count\': int(r[2]),\n                    \'total_sales_amount\': float(r[3]) if r[3] is not None else 0.0,\n                    \'first_order_date\': str(r[4]) if r[4] is not None else None,\n                    \'last_order_date\': str(r[5]) if r[5] is not None else None\n                }\n                for r in results\n            ],\n            \'top_contributing_customer_ids\': top_customer_ids,\n            \'total_active_customers\': total_customers,\n            \'total_customer_sales\': total_sales_all\n        }\n        \n        print(\'__HANDOFF__\' + json.dumps(handoff_output))\n\nfinally:\n    conn.rollback()\n    cursor.close()\n    conn.close()\n```\n**执行结果**:\n```text\n=== 2026年客户维度贡献度数据 ===\n客户ID       客户名称                 订单数      销售额             首次交易日期          最近交易日期         \n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n无符合条件的数据\n```\n\n### 步骤 5: 步骤5：查询供应商基础档案信息及与商品的潜在关联情况，由于缺乏直接采购关联，仅列出供应商列表及状态，并说明数据局限性，来源suppliers表\n**执行代码**:\n```python\nimport json\n\ntry:\n    conn = get_connection()\nexcept Exception as e:\n    raise RuntimeError(f"无法获取数据库连接: {e}")\n\ncursor = conn.cursor()\n\n# 查询供应商基础档案信息\nsql_suppliers = """\nSELECT \n    id,\n    code,\n    name,\n    contact,\n    phone,\n    address,\n    status,\n    created_at,\n    updated_at\nFROM virtual_erp.suppliers\nORDER BY id;\n"""\n\ncursor.execute(sql_suppliers)\ncolumns = [desc[0] for desc in cursor.description]\nrows = cursor.fetchall()\n\n# 打印结果表格\nprint("=== 供应商基础档案列表 ===")\nif not rows:\n    print("(无数据)")\nelse:\n    # 表头\n    header = "\\t".join(columns)\n    print(header)\n    print("-" * len(header))\n    for row in rows:\n        # 处理 datetime 对象转为字符串以便打印\n        formatted_row = []\n        for val in row:\n            if hasattr(val, \'strftime\'):\n                formatted_row.append(val.strftime(\'%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\'))\n            else:\n                formatted_row.append(str(val) if val is not None else \'\')\n        print("\\t".join(formatted_row))\n\n# 统计供应商状态分布\nactive_count = sum(1 for r in rows if r[6] == 1)\ninactive_count = sum(1 for r in rows if r[6] == 0)\n\nprint(f"\\n=== 供应商状态统计 ===")\nprint(f"正常(status=1): {active_count} 家")\nprint(f"停用(status=0): {inactive_count} 家")\nprint(f"总计: {len(rows)} 家")\n\nprint("\\n=== 数据局限性说明 ===")\nprint("当前ERP系统数据库中，suppliers表与products表之间缺乏直接的采购关联字段（如purchase_orders或product_supplier映射表）。")\nprint("因此，本步骤仅列出供应商基础档案及状态，无法分析供应商供货商品、采购成本或供应稳定性等深度指标。")\nprint("如需进一步分析，建议补充采购订单表或商品-供应商关联关系表。")\n\n# 为后续步骤传递供应商ID列表和基本信息摘要\nsupplier_ids = [r[0] for r in rows]\nhandoff_data = {\n    "supplier_ids": supplier_ids,\n    "supplier_count": len(rows),\n    "active_supplier_count": active_count,\n    "inactive_supplier_count": inactive_count\n}\n\nprint(\'__HANDOFF__\' + json.dumps(handoff_data))\n\nfinally:\n    try:\n        cursor.close()\n    except:\n        pass\n    try:\n        conn.rollback()\n    except:\n        pass\n    try:\n        conn.close()\n    except:\n        pass\n```\n**执行结果**:\n```text\n代码已执行，无控制台输出。\n```\n\n### 步骤 6: 步骤6：查询2026年库存动态与效率分析，包括各商品当前库存、安全库存对比，以及基于stock_logs的期间出入库流水汇总，计算动销率和库销比，来源products, stock_logs表\n**执行代码**:\n```python\nimport json\n\n# 读取上一步的衔接参数\nhandoff = _HANDOFF_5e6df14dc3\nstart_date = handoff[\'start_date\']\nend_date = handoff[\'end_date\']\nvalid_statuses = handoff[\'valid_statuses\']\n\nconn = None\ncursor = None\n\ntry:\n    conn = get_connection()\n    cursor = conn.cursor()\n\n    # 1. 查询各商品当前库存、安全库存对比，以及成本价、销售价用于计算库存价值\n    sql_products = """\n        SELECT \n            p.id AS product_id,\n            p.sku,\n            p.name AS product_name,\n            p.category,\n            p.stock_qty,\n            p.safety_stock,\n            p.cost_price,\n            p.sale_price,\n            p.status AS product_status\n        FROM virtual_erp.products p\n        ORDER BY p.stock_qty DESC;\n    """\n    cursor.execute(sql_products)\n    products_rows = cursor.fetchall()\n    \n    # 构建商品字典，方便后续关联\n    product_dict = {}\n    for row in products_rows:\n        pid = row[0]\n        product_dict[pid] = {\n            \'sku\': row[1],\n            \'name\': row[2],\n            \'category\': row[3],\n            \'stock_qty\': row[4],\n            \'safety_stock\': row[5],\n            \'cost_price\': float(row[6]) if row[6] else 0.0,\n            \'sale_price\': float(row[7]) if row[7] else 0.0,\n            \'status\': row[8]\n        }\n\n    # 2. 查询期间内基于 stock_logs 的出入库流水汇总\n    # 需要确定 change_type 的含义。通常入库为正/特定类型，出库为负/特定类型。\n    # 由于表结构未明确 change_type 的具体枚举值，我们假设常见的业务逻辑：\n    # 通过观察数据或通用ERP逻辑，change_qty 正数通常为入库，负数为出库，或者通过 change_type 区分。\n    # 这里为了稳健，我们按 change_type 分组统计数量总和，并尝试识别哪些是“出库”（销售相关）和“入库”。\n    # 更准确的做法是结合 sales_order_items 来确定实际销售出库量，但题目要求基于 stock_logs。\n    # 我们先获取所有流水的类型分布，以便理解数据。\n    \n    sql_log_types = """\n        SELECT DISTINCT change_type \n        FROM virtual_erp.stock_logs \n        WHERE created_at >= %s AND created_at <= %s;\n    """\n    cursor.execute(sql_log_types, (start_date, end_date))\n    log_types = [row[0] for row in cursor.fetchall()]\n    \n    # 如果无法直接判断哪个 type 是出库，我们需要一个策略。\n    # 通常 ERP 中 \'out\' 或 \'sale\' 或 \'issue\' 代表出库，\'in\' 或 \'purchase\' 或 \'receipt\' 代表入库。\n    # 如果没有明确的映射，我们可以根据 change_qty 的正负来辅助判断，或者简单地列出所有类型的总量。\n    # 为了计算动销率，我们需要知道“销售出库量”。最可靠的方式其实是看 sales_order_items，\n    # 但题目明确要求“基于stock_logs的期间出入库流水汇总...计算动销率和库销比”。\n    # 动销率通常指：有销售记录的商品数 / 总在售商品数。\n    # 库销比通常指：期末库存金额 / 期间销售金额。\n    \n    # 让我们先汇总每种 change_type 的变动数量总和\n    sql_log_summary = """\n        SELECT \n            change_type,\n            SUM(change_qty) AS total_change_qty,\n            COUNT(*) AS record_count\n        FROM virtual_erp.stock_logs\n        WHERE created_at >= %s AND created_at <= %s\n        GROUP BY change_type;\n    """\n    cursor.execute(sql_log_summary, (start_date, end_date))\n    log_summary_rows = cursor.fetchall()\n    \n    # 打印流水类型汇总供分析\n    print("=== 期间库存流水类型汇总 ===")\n    print(f"{\'Change Type\':<20} | {\'Total Qty Change\':<15} | {\'Record Count\':<10}")\n    print("-" * 50)\n    for row in log_summary_rows:\n        ctype = str(row[0]) if row[0] else "NULL"\n        qty = int(row[1]) if row[1] is not None else 0\n        count = int(row[2]) if row[2] is not None else 0\n        print(f"{ctype:<20} | {qty:<15} | {count:<10}")\n    print("")\n\n    # 3. 计算动销率和库销比\n    # 动销率定义：期间内有销售行为（即出现在有效订单明细中）的商品种类数 / 当前在售商品总数\n    # 注意：虽然题目说基于stock_logs，但“动销”的业务本质是“卖出去了”。\n    # 如果 stock_logs 中有明确的“销售出库”类型，可以用它。否则，回退到使用 sales_order_items 是最准确的“动销”定义。\n    # 鉴于步骤5已经处理了销售数据，且 __HANDOFF__ 中有 valid_order_ids，我们可以利用这些信息。\n    # 但本步主要聚焦库存效率。\n    \n    # 获取当前在售商品总数 (status=1)\n    active_products = [p for p in product_dict.values() if p[\'status\'] == 1]\n    total_active_products = len(active_products)\n    \n    # 获取期间内产生过销售的商品ID列表\n    # 使用上一步的有效订单ID列表，或者直接查询\n    valid_order_ids = handoff.get(\'valid_order_ids\', [])\n    \n    sold_product_ids = set()\n    if valid_order_ids:\n        placeholders = \',\'.join([\'%s\'] * len(valid_order_ids))\n        sql_sold_products = f"""\n            SELECT DISTINCT soi.product_id\n            FROM virtual_erp.sales_order_items soi\n            JOIN virtual_erp.sales_orders so ON soi.order_id = so.id\n            WHERE so.id IN ({placeholders})\n              AND so.status IN ({\',\'.join([\'%s\'] * len(valid_statuses))});\n        """\n        params = valid_order_ids + valid_statuses\n        cursor.execute(sql_sold_products, params)\n        sold_product_ids = {row[0] for row in cursor.fetchall()}\n    else:\n        # 如果没有有效订单ID，直接查\n        sql_sold_products_all = """\n            SELECT DISTINCT soi.product_id\n            FROM virtual_erp.sales_order_items soi\n            JOIN virtual_erp.sales_orders so ON soi.order_id = so.id\n            WHERE so.order_date >= %s AND so.order_date <= %s\n              AND so.status IN ({placeholders});\n        """.replace(\'{placeholders}\', \',\'.join([\'%s\'] * len(valid_statuses)))\n        \n        cursor.execute(sql_sold_products_all, [start_date, end_date] + valid_statuses)\n        sold_product_ids = {row[0] for row in cursor.fetchall()}\n\n    # 动销率计算\n    # 分母：当前在售商品数。分子：期间内有过销售记录的在售商品数（交集）\n    # 有些商品可能已售罄下架，但期间卖过，算不算动销？通常动销率针对的是“在架商品”的销售活跃度。\n    # 这里我们取：(期间有销售记录的商品 ∩ 当前在售商品) / 当前在售商品总数\n    \n    current_active_ids = {pid for pid, info in product_dict.items() if info[\'status\'] == 1}\n    active_sold_ids = sold_product_ids.intersection(current_active_ids)\n    \n    num_active_sold = len(active_sold_ids)\n    turnover_rate = (num_active_sold / total_active_products * 100) if total_active_products > 0 else 0.0\n\n    # 库销比计算\n    # 库销比 = 期末库存总金额 / 期间销售总金额\n    # 期末库存总金额 = Sum(stock_qty * cost_price) for all products (or just active? usually total inventory value)\n    # 期间销售总金额 = 从 handoff 获取 total_sales_amount\n    \n    total_inventory_value = 0.0\n    for pid, info in product_dict.items():\n        # 计算库存价值，通常用成本价\n        val = info[\'stock_qty\'] * info[\'cost_price\']\n        total_inventory_value += val\n        \n    total_sales_amount = handoff.get(\'total_sales_amount\', 0.0)\n    \n    # 库销比通常是一个倍数，比如 1.5 表示库存够卖1.5个月（如果分母是月均销售额）\n    # 如果是期间总销售额，则库销比 = 库存金额 / 期间销售额\n    # 这里期间是一年，所以这个比值反映的是库存相对于全年销售的覆盖程度。\n    inventory_to_sales_ratio = (total_inventory_value / total_sales_amount) if total_sales_amount > 0 else 0.0\n\n    # 4. 输出详细表格：各商品库存与安全库存对比\n    print("=== 2026年商品库存与安全库存对比 ===")\n    print(f"{\'SKU\':<15} | {\'商品名称\':<20} | {\'分类\':<10} | {\'当前库存\':<8} | {\'安全库存\':<8} | {\'库存状态\':<10} | {\'库存成本值\':<12}")\n    print("-" * 100)\n    \n    low_stock_alerts = []\n    for pid, info in sorted(product_dict.items(), key=lambda x: x[1][\'stock_qty\']):\n        sku = info[\'sku\']\n        name = info[\'name\'][:18] + ".." if len(info[\'name\']) > 20 else info[\'name\']\n        category = info[\'category\'] or "N/A"\n        stock = info[\'stock_qty\']\n        safety = info[\'safety_stock\']\n        status_text = "在售" if info[\'status\'] == 1 else "下架"\n        \n        # 判断库存状态\n        if stock < safety:\n            inv_status = "低于安全库存"\n            low_stock_alerts.append(sku)\n        elif stock == 0 and info[\'status\'] == 1:\n            inv_status = "缺货"\n            low_stock_alerts.append(sku)\n        else:\n            inv_status = "正常"\n            \n        inv_value = stock * info[\'cost_price\']\n        \n        print(f"{sku:<15} | {name:<20} | {category:<10} | {stock:<8} | {safety:<8} | {inv_status:<10} | {inv_value:<12.2f}")\n    \n    print("")\n    \n    # 5. 输出关键指标总结\n    print("=== 库存效率关键指标 (2026年度) ===")\n    print(f"1. 当前在售商品总数: {total_active_products}")\n    print(f"2. 期间有销售记录的在售商品数: {num_active_sold}")\n    print(f"3. 商品动销率: {turnover_rate:.2f}%")\n    print(f"4. 期末库存总成本值: {total_inventory_value:.2f}")\n    print(f"5. 期间销售总额: {total_sales_amount:.2f}")\n    print(f"6. 库销比 (库存金额/销售金额): {inventory_to_sales_ratio:.2f}")\n    print(f"7. 低于安全库存或缺货的商品数: {len(low_stock_alerts)}")\n    \n    if low_stock_alerts:\n        print(f"   预警SKU列表: {\', \'.join(low_stock_alerts[:10])}{\'...\' if len(low_stock_alerts) > 10 else \'\'}")\n\n    # 准备传递给下一步的数据\n    # 可能需要传递一些库存相关的聚合数据或预警列表\n    handoff_data = {\n        "total_active_products": total_active_products,\n        "num_active_sold": num_active_sold,\n        "turnover_rate_pct": round(turnover_rate, 2),\n        "total_inventory_value": round(total_inventory_value, 2),\n        "inventory_to_sales_ratio": round(inventory_to_sales_ratio, 2),\n        "low_stock_sku_count": len(low_stock_alerts),\n        "low_stock_skus": low_stock_alerts[:20] # 限制长度以防过大\n    }\n    \n    print(\'__HANDOFF__\' + json.dumps(handoff_data))\n\nexcept Exception as e:\n    print(f"Error executing step 6: {str(e)}")\n    import traceback\n    traceback.print_exc()\nfinally:\n    if cursor:\n        try:\n            cursor.close()\n        except:\n            pass\n    if conn:\n        try:\n            conn.rollback()\n            conn.close()\n        except:\n            pass\n```\n**执行结果**:\n```text\n=== 期间库存流水类型汇总 ===\nChange Type          | Total Qty Change | Record Count\n--------------------------------------------------\nin                   | 224             | 4         \nout                  | -64             | 8         \n\n=== 2026年商品库存与安全库存对比 ===\nSKU             | 商品名称                 | 分类         | 当前库存     | 安全库存     | 库存状态       | 库存成本值       \n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nP3001           | 折叠办公桌 120cm          | 办公家具       | 35       | 5        | 正常         | 7350.00     \nP1001           | 无线蓝牙耳机 Air Pro       | 数码配件       | 115      | 20       | 正常         | 11270.00    \nP1002           | 65W 氮化镓快充充电器         | 数码配件       | 190      | 30       | 正常         | 8550.00     \nP2002           | 气泡袋 20x30cm          | 包装耗材       | 250      | 100      | 正常         | 87.50       \nP1003           | Type-C 数据线 1.5m      | 数码配件       | 495      | 100      | 正常         | 3217.50     \nP2001           | 牛皮纸包装盒(中号)           | 包装耗材       | 780      | 200      | 正常         | 1404.00     \n\n=== 库存效率关键指标 (2026年度) ===\n1. 当前在售商品总数: 6\n2. 期间有销售记录的在售商品数: 0\n3. 商品动销率: 0.00%\n4. 期末库存总成本值: 31879.00\n5. 期间销售总额: 0.00\n6. 库销比 (库存金额/销售金额): 0.00\n7. 低于安全库存或缺货的商品数: 0\n```\n\n### 步骤 7: 步骤7：综合前六步数据，识别核心经营风险（如高库存低动销、客户过度集中、负毛利商品等），生成经营诊断问题清单\n**执行代码**:\n```python\nimport json\n\n# 读取上一步的衔接参数\nhandoff_data = _HANDOFF_5e6df14dc3\n\nstart_date = handoff_data.get(\'start_date\', \'2026-01-01\')\nend_date = handoff_data.get(\'end_date\', \'2026-12-31\')\nvalid_statuses = handoff_data.get(\'valid_statuses\', [\'completed\', \'shipped\'])\ntotal_valid_orders = handoff_data.get(\'total_valid_orders\', 0)\ntotal_sales_amount = handoff_data.get(\'total_sales_amount\', 0.0)\ntotal_gross_profit = handoff_data.get(\'total_gross_profit\', 0.0)\ncancelled_order_count = handoff_data.get(\'cancelled_order_count\', 0)\ncancelled_total_amount = handoff_data.get(\'cancelled_total_amount\', 0.0)\ntotal_stock_value_all = handoff_data.get(\'total_stock_value_all\', 0.0)\ntotal_gross_profit_all = handoff_data.get(\'total_gross_profit_all\', 0.0)\ntotal_sales_all = handoff_data.get(\'total_sales_all\', 0.0)\ntotal_active_products = handoff_data.get(\'total_active_products\', 0)\nnum_active_sold = handoff_data.get(\'num_active_sold\', 0)\nturnover_rate_pct = handoff_data.get(\'turnover_rate_pct\', 0.0)\ntotal_inventory_value = handoff_data.get(\'total_inventory_value\', 0.0)\ninventory_to_sales_ratio = handoff_data.get(\'inventory_to_sales_ratio\', 0.0)\nlow_stock_sku_count = handoff_data.get(\'low_stock_sku_count\', 0)\nlow_stock_skus = handoff_data.get(\'low_stock_skus\', [])\n\nconn = None\ntry:\n    conn = get_connection()\n    cursor = conn.cursor()\n\n    # 1. 客户集中度分析：前3大客户销售额占比\n    sql_customer_concentration = """\n        SELECT \n            c.name AS customer_name,\n            SUM(so.total_amount) AS sales_amount,\n            COUNT(so.id) AS order_count\n        FROM virtual_erp.sales_orders so\n        JOIN virtual_erp.customers c ON so.customer_id = c.id\n        WHERE so.order_date BETWEEN %s AND %s\n          AND so.status IN ({})\n        GROUP BY c.id, c.name\n        ORDER BY sales_amount DESC\n        LIMIT 10\n    """.format(\',\'.join([\'%s\'] * len(valid_statuses)))\n    \n    params_customer = [start_date, end_date] + valid_statuses\n    cursor.execute(sql_customer_concentration, params_customer)\n    customer_rows = cursor.fetchall()\n    \n    total_sales_for_concentration = sum(row[1] for row in customer_rows) if customer_rows else 0\n    top3_customers = []\n    top3_sales_sum = 0\n    for i, row in enumerate(customer_rows[:3]):\n        cust_name = row[0]\n        cust_sales = float(row[1]) if row[1] else 0.0\n        top3_customers.append({\'name\': cust_name, \'sales\': cust_sales})\n        top3_sales_sum += cust_sales\n    \n    concentration_ratio = (top3_sales_sum / total_sales_for_concentration * 100) if total_sales_for_concentration > 0 else 0\n\n    # 2. 负毛利商品识别\n    sql_negative_margin = """\n        SELECT \n            p.sku,\n            p.name AS product_name,\n            soi.unit_price,\n            p.cost_price,\n            (soi.unit_price - p.cost_price) AS unit_margin,\n            SUM(soi.amount) AS total_revenue,\n            SUM(soi.qty * p.cost_price) AS total_cost,\n            SUM(soi.amount) - SUM(soi.qty * p.cost_price) AS gross_profit\n        FROM virtual_erp.sales_order_items soi\n        JOIN virtual_erp.sales_orders so ON soi.order_id = so.id\n        JOIN virtual_erp.products p ON soi.product_id = p.id\n        WHERE so.order_date BETWEEN %s AND %s\n          AND so.status IN ({})\n        GROUP BY p.id, p.sku, p.name, soi.unit_price, p.cost_price\n        HAVING gross_profit < 0\n        ORDER BY gross_profit ASC\n        LIMIT 20\n    """.format(\',\'.join([\'%s\'] * len(valid_statuses)))\n    \n    params_neg_margin = [start_date, end_date] + valid_statuses\n    cursor.execute(sql_negative_margin, params_neg_margin)\n    negative_margin_rows = cursor.fetchall()\n    \n    negative_margin_products = []\n    for row in negative_margin_rows:\n        negative_margin_products.append({\n            \'sku\': row[0],\n            \'product_name\': row[1],\n            \'unit_price\': float(row[2]) if row[2] else 0.0,\n            \'cost_price\': float(row[3]) if row[3] else 0.0,\n            \'unit_margin\': float(row[4]) if row[4] else 0.0,\n            \'gross_profit\': float(row[7]) if row[7] else 0.0\n        })\n\n    # 3. 高库存低动销商品（库存价值高但今年无销售或销售极少）\n    sql_high_stock_low_turn = """\n        SELECT \n            p.sku,\n            p.name AS product_name,\n            p.stock_qty,\n            p.cost_price,\n            (p.stock_qty * p.cost_price) AS stock_value,\n            COALESCE(SUM(soi.qty), 0) AS sold_qty_this_year\n        FROM virtual_erp.products p\n        LEFT JOIN virtual_erp.sales_order_items soi ON p.id = soi.product_id\n        LEFT JOIN virtual_erp.sales_orders so ON soi.order_id = so.id \n            AND so.order_date BETWEEN %s AND %s\n            AND so.status IN ({})\n        WHERE p.status = 1\n        GROUP BY p.id, p.sku, p.name, p.stock_qty, p.cost_price\n        HAVING stock_value > 0 AND sold_qty_this_year <= 2\n        ORDER BY stock_value DESC\n        LIMIT 20\n    """.format(\',\'.join([\'%s\'] * len(valid_statuses)))\n    \n    params_high_stock = [start_date, end_date] + valid_statuses\n    cursor.execute(sql_high_stock_low_turn, params_high_stock)\n    high_stock_low_turn_rows = cursor.fetchall()\n    \n    high_stock_low_turn_products = []\n    for row in high_stock_low_turn_rows:\n        high_stock_low_turn_products.append({\n            \'sku\': row[0],\n            \'product_name\': row[1],\n            \'stock_qty\': int(row[2]) if row[2] else 0,\n            \'stock_value\': float(row[4]) if row[4] else 0.0,\n            \'sold_qty_this_year\': int(row[5]) if row[5] else 0\n        })\n\n    # 4. 订单取消率分析\n    total_orders_all = total_valid_orders + cancelled_order_count\n    cancel_rate = (cancelled_order_count / total_orders_all * 100) if total_orders_all > 0 else 0\n\n    # 5. 毛利率分析\n    overall_gross_margin = (total_gross_profit / total_sales_amount * 100) if total_sales_amount > 0 else 0\n\n    # 构建诊断问题清单\n    issues = []\n    \n    # 客户集中度过高\n    if concentration_ratio > 50 and len(top3_customers) >= 3:\n        issues.append({\n            \'issue\': \'客户过度集中\',\n            \'severity\': \'高\',\n            \'description\': f\'前3大客户贡献了{concentration_ratio:.1f}%的销售额，存在单一客户依赖风险。\',\n            \'details\': top3_customers\n        })\n    elif concentration_ratio > 30 and len(top3_customers) >= 3:\n        issues.append({\n            \'issue\': \'客户集中度偏高\',\n            \'severity\': \'中\',\n            \'description\': f\'前3大客户贡献了{concentration_ratio:.1f}%的销售额，建议拓展新客户以降低依赖。\',\n            \'details\': top3_customers\n        })\n\n    # 负毛利商品\n    if negative_margin_products:\n        neg_loss_total = sum(p[\'gross_profit\'] for p in negative_margin_products)\n        issues.append({\n            \'issue\': \'存在负毛利商品\',\n            \'severity\': \'高\',\n            \'description\': f\'发现{len(negative_margin_products)}个商品在今年销售中出现负毛利，累计亏损约{abs(neg_loss_total):.2f}元。需检查定价策略或成本核算。\',\n            \'details\': negative_margin_products[:5]\n        })\n\n    # 高库存低动销\n    if high_stock_low_turn_products:\n        stagnant_stock_value = sum(p[\'stock_value\'] for p in high_stock_low_turn_products)\n        issues.append({\n            \'issue\': \'高库存低动销\',\n            \'severity\': \'中\',\n            \'description\': f\'{len(high_stock_low_turn_products)}个在售商品库存价值较高但今年销量极低（≤2件），积压库存价值约{stagnant_stock_value:.2f}元，占用资金且有过期/贬值风险。\',\n            \'details\': high_stock_low_turn_products[:5]\n        })\n\n    # 订单取消率过高\n    if cancel_rate > 10:\n        issues.append({\n            \'issue\': \'订单取消率偏高\',\n            \'severity\': \'中\',\n            \'description\': f\'今年订单取消率为{cancel_rate:.1f}%（{cancelled_order_count}单取消，涉及金额{cancelled_total_amount:.2f}元），高于正常水平，需排查原因（如缺货、价格变动、客户流失等）。\',\n            \'details\': {\'cancelled_count\': cancelled_order_count, \'cancelled_amount\': cancelled_total_amount, \'cancel_rate\': round(cancel_rate, 2)}\n        })\n\n    # 整体毛利率偏低\n    if overall_gross_margin < 15 and total_sales_amount > 0:\n        issues.append({\n            \'issue\': \'整体毛利率偏低\',\n            \'severity\': \'中\',\n            \'description\': f\'今年有效订单整体毛利率为{overall_gross_margin:.1f}%，低于行业健康水平（通常>20%），需优化产品结构或成本控制。\',\n            \'details\': {\'gross_margin\': round(overall_gross_margin, 2), \'total_sales\': total_sales_amount, \'total_gross_profit\': total_gross_profit}\n        })\n\n    # 库存周转率过低\n    if turnover_rate_pct < 2 and total_active_products > 0:\n        issues.append({\n            \'issue\': \'库存周转率过低\',\n            \'severity\': \'中\',\n            \'description\': f\'今年库存周转率仅为{turnover_rate_pct:.2f}%，表明大量商品未产生销售，库存效率低下。\',\n            \'details\': {\'turnover_rate\': round(turnover_rate_pct, 2), \'active_products\': total_active_products, \'sold_products\': num_active_sold}\n        })\n\n    # 输出诊断结果\n    print("=" * 80)\n    print("【步骤7】经营诊断问题清单")\n    print("=" * 80)\n    \n    if not issues:\n        print("\\n未发现显著经营风险，各项指标处于合理范围。")\n    else:\n        print(f"\\n共发现 {len(issues)} 项核心经营风险：\\n")\n        for idx, issue in enumerate(issues, 1):\n            print(f"{idx}. [{issue[\'severity\']}] {issue[\'issue\']}")\n            print(f"   描述: {issue[\'description\']}")\n            if issue[\'details\']:\n                print(f"   详情示例:")\n                if isinstance(issue[\'details\'], list):\n                    for d in issue[\'details\'][:3]:\n                        print(f"     - {d}")\n                elif isinstance(issue[\'details\'], dict):\n                    for k, v in issue[\'details\'].items():\n                        print(f"     - {k}: {v}")\n            print("-" * 60)\n\n    # 准备传递给下一步的关键信息\n    # 提取需要后续关注的SKU列表（负毛利+高库存低动销）\n    risk_skus = set()\n    for p in negative_margin_products:\n        risk_skus.add(p[\'sku\'])\n    for p in high_stock_low_turn_products:\n        risk_skus.add(p[\'sku\'])\n    \n    handoff_result = {\n        \'diagnosis_issues_count\': len(issues),\n        \'risk_skus\': list(risk_skus),\n        \'negative_margin_product_count\': len(negative_margin_products),\n        \'high_stock_low_turn_product_count\': len(high_stock_low_turn_products),\n        \'customer_concentration_ratio\': round(concentration_ratio, 2),\n        \'overall_gross_margin\': round(overall_gross_margin, 2),\n        \'order_cancel_rate\': round(cancel_rate, 2)\n    }\n    \n    print(\'__HANDOFF__\' + json.dumps(handoff_result))\n\nfinally:\n    if conn:\n        try:\n            conn.rollback()\n        except Exception:\n            pass\n        conn.close()\n```\n**执行结果**:\n```text\n================================================================================\n【步骤7】经营诊断问题清单\n================================================================================\n\n共发现 3 项核心经营风险：\n\n1. [中] 高库存低动销\n   描述: 2个在售商品库存价值较高但今年销量极低（≤2件），积压库存价值约7437.50元，占用资金且有过期/贬值风险。\n   详情示例:\n     - {\'sku\': \'P3001\', \'product_name\': \'折叠办公桌 120cm\', \'stock_qty\': 35, \'stock_value\': 7350.0, \'sold_qty_this_year\': 1}\n     - {\'sku\': \'P2002\', \'product_name\': \'气泡袋 20x30cm\', \'stock_qty\': 250, \'stock_value\': 87.5, \'sold_qty_this_year\': 0}\n------------------------------------------------------------\n2. [中] 订单取消率偏高\n   描述: 今年订单取消率为100.0%（1单取消，涉及金额399.00元），高于正常水平，需排查原因（如缺货、价格变动、客户流失等）。\n   详情示例:\n     - cancelled_count: 1\n     - cancelled_amount: 399.0\n     - cancel_rate: 100.0\n------------------------------------------------------------\n3. [中] 库存周转率过低\n   描述: 今年库存周转率仅为0.00%，表明大量商品未产生销售，库存效率低下。\n   详情示例:\n     - turnover_rate: 0.0\n     - active_products: 6\n     - sold_products: 0\n------------------------------------------------------------\n```\n\n### 步骤 8: 步骤8：基于诊断结果，撰写报告概要、结论及建议，整合所有章节内容形成完整报告\n**执行代码**:\n```python\nimport json\n\n# 读取上一步落盘的衔接参数\nhandoff = _HANDOFF_5e6df14dc3\n\n# 提取关键指标用于报告撰写\nstart_date = handoff.get(\'start_date\', \'2026-01-01\')\nend_date = handoff.get(\'end_date\', \'2026-12-31\')\ntotal_valid_orders = handoff.get(\'total_valid_orders\', 0)\ntotal_sales_amount = handoff.get(\'total_sales_amount\', 0.0)\ntotal_gross_profit = handoff.get(\'total_gross_profit\', 0.0)\ncancelled_order_count = handoff.get(\'cancelled_order_count\', 0)\ncancelled_total_amount = handoff.get(\'cancelled_total_amount\', 0.0)\ntotal_active_products = handoff.get(\'total_active_products\', 0)\nnum_active_sold = handoff.get(\'num_active_sold\', 0)\nturnover_rate_pct = handoff.get(\'turnover_rate_pct\', 0.0)\ntotal_inventory_value = handoff.get(\'total_inventory_value\', 0.0)\ninventory_to_sales_ratio = handoff.get(\'inventory_to_sales_ratio\', 0.0)\nlow_stock_sku_count = handoff.get(\'low_stock_sku_count\', 0)\nlow_stock_skus = handoff.get(\'low_stock_skus\', [])\ndiagnosis_issues_count = handoff.get(\'diagnosis_issues_count\', 0)\nrisk_skus = handoff.get(\'risk_skus\', [])\nnegative_margin_product_count = handoff.get(\'negative_margin_product_count\', 0)\nhigh_stock_low_turn_product_count = handoff.get(\'high_stock_low_turn_product_count\', 0)\ncustomer_concentration_ratio = handoff.get(\'customer_concentration_ratio\', 0)\noverall_gross_margin = handoff.get(\'overall_gross_margin\', 0)\norder_cancel_rate = handoff.get(\'order_cancel_rate\', 0.0)\n\n# 计算毛利率（如果未提供则从利润/销售额计算）\nif total_sales_amount > 0:\n    gross_margin_calc = round(total_gross_profit / total_sales_amount * 100, 2)\nelse:\n    gross_margin_calc = 0.0\n\n# 使用传入的 overall_gross_margin，若为0且销售额>0则用计算值\ngross_margin_display = overall_gross_margin if overall_gross_margin != 0 else gross_margin_calc\n\n# 构建报告文本\nreport_lines = []\nreport_lines.append("=" * 80)\nreport_lines.append("ERP系统经营分析报告")\nreport_lines.append(f"分析期间：{start_date} 至 {end_date}")\nreport_lines.append("=" * 80)\nreport_lines.append("")\n\n# 一、报告概要\nreport_lines.append("【一、报告概要】")\nreport_lines.append("-" * 40)\nreport_lines.append(f"本报告基于ERP系统在 {start_date} 至 {end_date} 期间的销售订单、商品库存及客户数据，")\nreport_lines.append("对经营状况进行全面诊断与分析。核心发现如下：")\nreport_lines.append("")\nreport_lines.append(f"• 有效订单总数：{total_valid_orders} 单")\nreport_lines.append(f"• 总销售额：¥{total_sales_amount:,.2f}")\nreport_lines.append(f"• 总毛利润：¥{total_gross_profit:,.2f}")\nreport_lines.append(f"• 综合毛利率：{