2026-10-23 14:19:01,860 - utils.mysqldb - INFO - Args: {'id': '4ae326d71fd744efa6e795de', 'orgId': 1, 'userId': 1, 'ownerType': 'company', 'skillName': '闵开发租金收缴情况分析报告', 'description': '基于财务看板或台账数据，分析特定主体（如公司、项目）的租金/收入收缴情况。通过拆解应收、已收、待收及账龄结构，识别缺口来源、评估预收款影响、对比内部各单元绩效，并区分“未到期”与“真实欠费”，为催收策略和经营决策提供量化依据。', 'sourceTaskId': 'c3206b86f5f74a859ba322ef', 'projectGroupIdsJson': '[16]', 'skillJson': '{"version": 2, "title": "租金收缴与经营分析报告", "purpose": "基于财务看板或台账数据，分析特定主体（如公司、项目）的租金/收入收缴情况。通过拆解应收、已收、待收及账龄结构，识别缺口来源、评估预收款影响、对比内部各单元绩效，并区分“未到期”与“真实欠费”，为催收策略和经营决策提供量化依据。", "sections": [{"id": "overview", "heading": "一、报告说明", "instruction": "1. 明确数据来源（如ERP、看板、手工台账）及覆盖的时间段和主体范围。\\n2. 定义关键指标的计算公式（特别是“应收”、“已收”、“待收”、“完成率”以及是否包含“预收款”等调整项）。\\n3. 进行基础数据校验：检查分项之和是否等于总计，是否存在逻辑矛盾（如已收+待收≠应收），若有差异需在此处或后续章节提示。", "format": "auto", "formats": ["prose", "table"], "intent": "界定分析范围、数据来源及核心指标定义，确保读者对统计口径有一致理解，并通过校验排除数据逻辑错误。", "analysis": ["梳理数据提取路径，确认无外部干扰数据", "定义指标口径，特别注明特殊项（如跨期预收）的处理方式", "执行加总校验，计算分项与总额的偏差率"], "dataNeeds": ["原始数据源名称及获取时间", "分析主体的全称及业务范围", "核心财务指标的原始数值及定义", "各分项数据的明细列表"], "dataSources": [{"dataNeed": "核心财务指标的原始数值及定义", "kind": "derived", "sources": [{"projectGroupId": 16, "projectGroupName": "闵开发资产", "databaseName": "zszx", "tableId": 93, "tableName": "zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_BILL", "columnName": "DUE_PRICE", "columnType": "decimal(10,2)", "columnComment": "应收"}, {"projectGroupId": 16, "projectGroupName": "闵开发资产", "databaseName": "zszx", "tableId": 95, "tableName": "zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_PAYABLE_LOG", "columnName": "PAYABLE_MONEY", "columnType": "decimal(18,4)", "columnComment": "收款金额"}], "relationIds": [{"projectGroupId": 16, "relationId": 18}], "derivation": "应收总额=SUM(ZC_CONTRACT_BILL.DUE_PRICE)；已收总额=SUM(ZC_CONTRACT_PAYABLE_LOG.PAYABLE_MONEY)。待收=应收-已收。完成率=已收/应收。", "conditions": [], "note": "基于账单表的应收金额和收款记录表的实收金额进行聚合计算。"}, {"dataNeed": "各分项数据的明细列表", "kind": "direct", "sources": [{"projectGroupId": 16, "projectGroupName": "闵开发资产", "databaseName": "zszx", "tableId": 93, "tableName": "zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_BILL", "columnName": "BILL_TYPE", "columnType": "tinyint(4)", "columnComment": "账单款项（1 土地使用费，2 场地管理费，3 自建账单 (场地)，4 场地开发费 (闵联)，5 非租赁收入 (场地)，6 物业管理费用 (场地)，7 非租赁收入 (房屋)，8 固定租金 (综合类)，9 固定租金，10 物业费，11 自建账单 (房屋)，12 水费，13 电费，14 能源费，15 停车费，16 光伏电费）"}, {"projectGroupId": 16, "projectGroupName": "闵开发资产", "databaseName": "zszx", "tableId": 93, "tableName": "zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_BILL", "columnName": "TOTAL_PRICE", "columnType": "decimal(10,2)", "columnComment": "账单金额"}, {"projectGroupId": 16, "projectGroupName": "闵开发资产", "databaseName": "zszx", "tableId": 93, "tableName": "zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_BILL", "columnName": "DEDUCTION_PRICE", "columnType": "decimal(10,2)", "columnComment": "减免"}, {"projectGroupId": 16, "projectGroupName": "闵开发资产", "databaseName": "zszx", "tableId": 93, "tableName": "zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_BILL", "columnName": "LATE_PRICE", "columnType": "decimal(10,2)", "columnComment": "滞纳金"}], "relationIds": [], "derivation": "", "conditions": [], "note": "账单类型、总金额、减免、滞纳金等字段提供了分项明细基础。"}], "dataInputs": [{"dataNeed": "原始数据源名称及获取时间", "kind": "user_input", "sectionIds": [], "reason": "虽然数据库有创建时间，但“数据源名称”（如ERP导出文件、看板快照）通常不在DB字段中，需用户确认具体来源描述。"}], "unmappedDataNeeds": ["分析主体的全称及业务范围"]}, {"id": "overall_status", "heading": "二、整体收缴情况", "instruction": "1. 列出核心三项数字：应收总额、已收总额、待收总额，计算整体收缴率。\\n2. 设定几个常见的管理目标档位（如70%、80%、90%），计算达到这些目标所需的额外增收金额，直观展示缺口大小。\\n3. 分析非当期因素对完成率的影响：如果存在上年预收计入本年已收的情况，需单独列示其金额，并计算剔除该部分后的“实收率”，对比两者差异，说明其对趋势判断的潜在误导。", "format": "auto", "formats": ["prose", "table"], "intent": "展示总体收缴水平，量化当前状态与管理目标的差距，并剔除噪音因素（如预收款）以还原真实回款能力。", "analysis": ["计算基础比率：已收/应收", "情景模拟：计算不同目标阈值下的资金缺口", "归因调整：分离预收款贡献，计算净新增回款率"], "dataNeeds": ["本期应收、已收、待收总金额", "预设的管理目标百分比", "其中属于上期预收但计入本期已收的金额"], "dataSources": [{"dataNeed": "本期应收、已收、待收总金额", "kind": "derived", "sources": [{"projectGroupId": 16, "projectGroupName": "闵开发资产", "databaseName": "zszx", "tableId": 93, "tableName": "zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_BILL", "columnName": "DUE_PRICE", "columnType": "decimal(10,2)", "columnComment": "应收"}, {"projectGroupId": 16, "projectGroupName": "闵开发资产", "databaseName": "zszx", "tableId": 95, "tableName": "zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_PAYABLE_LOG", "columnName": "PAYABLE_MONEY", "columnType": "decimal(18,4)", "columnComment": "收款金额"}], "relationIds": [{"projectGroupId": 16, "relationId": 18}], "derivation": "应收=SUM(DUE_PRICE) WHERE DUE_DATE BETWEEN 统计开始 AND 统计结束；已收=SUM(PAYABLE_MONEY) WHERE PAYABLE_DATE BETWEEN 统计开始 AND 统计结束；待收=应收-已收。", "conditions": [], "note": "需根据用户指定的统计期间过滤日期字段后求和。"}, {"dataNeed": "其中属于上期预收但计入本期已收的金额", "kind": "derived", "sources": [{"projectGroupId": 16, "projectGroupName": "闵开发资产", "databaseName": "zszx", "tableId": 95, "tableName": "zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_PAYABLE_LOG", "columnName": "PAYABLE_MONEY", "columnType": "decimal(18,4)", "columnComment": "收款金额"}, {"projectGroupId": 16, "projectGroupName": "闵开发资产", "databaseName": "zszx", "tableId": 95, "tableName": "zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_PAYABLE_LOG", "columnName": "PAYABLE_DATE", "columnType": "varchar(100)", "columnComment": "收款日期"}, {"projectGroupId": 16, "projectGroupName": "闵开发资产", "databaseName": "zszx", "tableId": 93, "tableName": "zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_BILL", "columnName": "START_DATE", "columnType": "varchar(255)", "columnComment": "周期开始日期"}, {"projectGroupId": 16, "projectGroupName": "闵开发资产", "databaseName": "zszx", "tableId": 93, "tableName": "zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_BILL", "columnName": "END_DATE", "columnType": "varchar(255)", "columnComment": "周期结束日期"}], "relationIds": [{"projectGroupId": 16, "relationId": 18}], "derivation": "筛选条件：PAYABLE_DATE在统计期内，且关联账单的周期(START_DATE/END_DATE)完全或部分位于统计期之前。具体口径需确认“预收”定义（是跨期账单还是提前支付）。", "conditions": [], "note": "需结合账单周期和实际收款日期判断是否属于跨期预收。"}], "dataInputs": [{"dataNeed": "预设的管理目标百分比", "kind": "user_input", "sectionIds": [], "reason": "管理目标（如70%/80%/90%）是动态的业务指标，非静态数据库字段，需用户输入。"}], "unmappedDataNeeds": []}, {"id": "structure_analysis", "heading": "三、业务类型结构分析", "instruction": "1. 对比不同类别的应收占比、待收占比及各自收缴率，找出表现最差或占比最大的类别。\\n2. 分析缺口归属：计算各类别待收金额占总待收的比例，确定主要压力来源。\\n3. 敏感性推演：计算每提升1个百分点收缴率对应的绝对金额增量，比较不同类别的边际效益；假设弱势类别达到强势类别的水平，测算整体收缴率的提升幅度及所需增收额。", "format": "auto", "formats": ["prose", "table"], "intent": "按资产或业务类别（如房屋vs场地、A类vsB类）拆解收缴情况，识别结构性短板和高杠杆改进点。", "analysis": ["分类汇总：按业务线聚合应收、已收、待收数据", "结构偏离度分析：对比应收结构与待收结构的差异", "杠杆效应计算：单位百分点变动对应的金额变化", "标杆对照法：用最优类别的比率作为基准进行模拟"], "dataNeeds": ["各业务类别的应收、已收、待收明细", "各业务类别的预收款分布情况"], "dataSources": [{"dataNeed": "各业务类别的应收、已收、待收明细", "kind": "derived", "sources": [{"projectGroupId": 16, "projectGroupName": "闵开发资产", "databaseName": "zszx", "tableId": 93, "tableName": "zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_BILL", "columnName": "BILL_TYPE", "columnType": "tinyint(4)", "columnComment": "账单款项（1 土地使用费，2 场地管理费，3 自建账单 (场地)，4 场地开发费 (闵联)，5 非租赁收入 (场地)，6 物业管理费用 (场地)，7 非租赁收入 (房屋)，8 固定租金 (综合类)，9 固定租金，10 物业费，11 自建账单 (房屋)，12 水费，13 电费，14 能源费，15 停车费，16 光伏电费）"}, {"projectGroupId": 16, "projectGroupName": "闵开发资产", "databaseName": "zszx", "tableId": 93, "tableName": "zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_BILL", "columnName": "DUE_PRICE", "columnType": "decimal(10,2)", "columnComment": "应收"}, {"projectGroupId": 16, "projectGroupName": "闵开发资产", "databaseName": "zszx", "tableId": 95, "tableName": "zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_PAYABLE_LOG", "columnName": "PAYABLE_MONEY", "columnType": "decimal(18,4)", "columnComment": "收款金额"}], "relationIds": [{"projectGroupId": 16, "relationId": 18}], "derivation": "按 BILL_TYPE 分组，分别 SUM(DUE_PRICE) 和 SUM(PAYABLE_MONEY)，计算差值得到待收。", "conditions": [], "note": "利用账单类型字段区分房屋、场地等不同业务类别。"}, {"dataNeed": "各业务类别的预收款分布情况", "kind": "derived", "sources": [{"projectGroupId": 16, "projectGroupName": "闵开发资产", "databaseName": "zszx", "tableId": 93, "tableName": "zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_BILL", "columnName": "BILL_TYPE", "columnType": "tinyint(4)", "columnComment": "账单款项（1 土地使用费，2 场地管理费，3 自建账单 (场地)，4 场地开发费 (闵联)，5 非租赁收入 (场地)，6 物业管理费用 (场地)，7 非租赁收入 (房屋)，8 固定租金 (综合类)，9 固定租金，10 物业费，11 自建账单 (房屋)，12 水费，13 电费，14 能源费，15 停车费，16 光伏电费）"}, {"projectGroupId": 16, "projectGroupName": "闵开发资产", "databaseName": "zszx", "tableId": 95, "tableName": "zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_PAYABLE_LOG", "columnName": "PAYABLE_MONEY", "columnType": "decimal(18,4)", "columnComment": "收款金额"}, {"projectGroupId": 16, "projectGroupName": "闵开发资产", "databaseName": "zszx", "tableId": 95, "tableName": "zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_PAYABLE_LOG", "columnName": "PAYABLE_DATE", "columnType": "varchar(100)", "columnComment": "收款日期"}, {"projectGroupId": 16, "projectGroupName": "闵开发资产", "databaseName": "zszx", "tableId": 93, "tableName": "zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_BILL", "columnName": "START_DATE", "columnType": "varchar(255)", "columnComment": "周期开始日期"}], "relationIds": [{"projectGroupId": 16, "relationId": 18}], "derivation": "同 overall_status 中预收款逻辑，按 BILL_TYPE 分组统计符合预收条件的 PAYABLE_MONEY。", "conditions": [], "note": "依赖对预收款定义的统一理解。"}], "dataInputs": [], "unmappedDataNeeds": []}, {"id": "peer_comparison", "heading": "四、内部单元横向对比", "instruction": "1. 列出所有子单元的核心指标（应收、已收、待收、完成率），按完成率排序，展示层级分布。\\n2. 分析集中度：计算头部单元在应收和待收中的占比，观察待收集中度是否高于应收集中度（暗示小单元沉淀更多坏账风险）。\\n3. 规模与效率关系：探讨业务规模大小与收缴率的相关性，指出是否存在“规模越小、管理成本越高、效率越低”的现象。\\n4. 统一标准测算：计算若所有单元均达到最高水平（或平均目标水平）时，集团整体需补收的金额。", "format": "auto", "formats": ["prose", "table"], "intent": "在集团或多部门视角下，对比各子单元的绩效，识别集中度风险及管理效率差异。", "analysis": ["排名与分层：按收缴率对子单元排序", "集中度指标：计算Top N单元的份额", "相关性分析：观察规模占比与完成率的散点关系", "标准化模拟：将低效单元提升至高效单元水平的增量计算"], "dataNeeds": ["各子单元（分公司/项目部）的独立财务数据", "集团合计数据"], "dataSources": [{"dataNeed": "各子单元（分公司/项目部）的独立财务数据", "kind": "derived", "sources": [{"projectGroupId": 16, "projectGroupName": "闵开发资产", "databaseName": "zszx", "tableId": 94, "tableName": "zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_INFO", "columnName": "ORG_CODE", "columnType": "varchar(255)", "columnComment": "组织编码"}, {"projectGroupId": 16, "projectGroupName": "闵开发资产", "databaseName": "zszx", "tableId": 94, "tableName": "zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_INFO", "columnName": "DEPT_NAME", "columnType": "varchar(200)", "columnComment": "归属部门"}, {"projectGroupId": 16, "projectGroupName": "闵开发资产", "databaseName": "zszx", "tableId": 93, "tableName": "zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_BILL", "columnName": "DUE_PRICE", "columnType": "decimal(10,2)", "columnComment": "应收"}, {"projectGroupId": 16, "projectGroupName": "闵开发资产", "databaseName": "zszx", "tableId": 95, "tableName": "zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_PAYABLE_LOG", "columnName": "PAYABLE_MONEY", "columnType": "decimal(18,4)", "columnComment": "收款金额"}], "relationIds": [{"projectGroupId": 16, "relationId": 16}, {"projectGroupId": 16, "relationId": 18}], "derivation": "通过合同表关联组织编码或部门名称，分组汇总应收和已收金额。", "conditions": [], "note": "ORG_CODE对应闵联公司、益源公司等实体，DEPT_NAME可用于更细粒度划分。"}, {"dataNeed": "集团合计数据", "kind": "derived", "sources": [{"projectGroupId": 16, "projectGroupName": "闵开发资产", "databaseName": "zszx", "tableId": 93, "tableName": "zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_BILL", "columnName": "DUE_PRICE", "columnType": "decimal(10,2)", "columnComment": "应收"}, {"projectGroupId": 16, "projectGroupName": "闵开发资产", "databaseName": "zszx", "tableId": 95, "tableName": "zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_PAYABLE_LOG", "columnName": "PAYABLE_MONEY", "columnType": "decimal(18,4)", "columnComment": "收款金额"}], "relationIds": [{"projectGroupId": 16, "relationId": 18}], "derivation": "对所有有效合同下的账单和收款记录进行全局 SUM。", "conditions": [], "note": "即所有子单元数据的总和。"}], "dataInputs": [], "unmappedDataNeeds": []}, {"id": "aging_and_quality", "heading": "五、账单口径与历史欠费分析", "instruction": "1. 引入账单维度数据：对比“应收口径”与“已出账单口径”的差异，解释为何账单结清率高但整体收缴率低（通常因未开账部分）。", "format": "auto", "formats": ["prose", "table"], "intent": "区分“账面待收”与“实际欠费”，通过账龄分析揭示回收难度的演变规律，评估资产质量。", "analysis": ["口径桥接：分析未开账金额对整体缺口的贡献", "账龄衰减模型：计算不同年份未结清金额的倍数关系，推导回收难度随时间的恶化速度", "风险定性：将待收分解为“正常流转中”和“逾期沉淀”两部分"], "dataNeeds": ["分年度/分账龄段的账单金额、已结清金额、未结清金额", "当期已开账但未结清的明细"], "dataSources": [{"dataNeed": "分年度/分账龄段的账单金额、已结清金额、未结清金额", "kind": "derived", "sources": [{"projectGroupId": 16, "projectGroupName": "闵开发资产", "databaseName": "zszx", "tableId": 93, "tableName": "zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_BILL", "columnName": "DUE_PRICE", "columnType": "decimal(10,2)", "columnComment": "应收"}, {"projectGroupId": 16, "projectGroupName": "闵开发资产", "databaseName": "zszx", "tableId": 93, "tableName": "zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_BILL", "columnName": "SETTLE_STATE", "columnType": "tinyint(4)", "columnComment": "结清状态"}, {"projectGroupId": 16, "projectGroupName": "闵开发资产", "databaseName": "zszx", "tableId": 93, "tableName": "zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_BILL", "columnName": "DUE_DATE", "columnType": "varchar(255)", "columnComment": "应收日期"}, {"projectGroupId": 16, "projectGroupName": "闵开发资产", "databaseName": "zszx", "tableId": 95, "tableName": "zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_PAYABLE_LOG", "columnName": "PAYABLE_MONEY", "columnType": "decimal(18,4)", "columnComment": "收款金额"}], "relationIds": [{"projectGroupId": 16, "relationId": 18}], "derivation": "以当前日期减去 DUE_DATE 计算账龄天数/年数。已结清=SETTLE_STATE=3 或 SUM(PAYABLE)>=DUE_PRICE；未结清=DUE_PRICE - SUM(PAYABLE)。按账龄区间分组统计。", "conditions": [], "note": "需要运行时确定“当前日期”作为账龄计算基准。"}, {"dataNeed": "当期已开账但未结清的明细", "kind": "direct", "sources": [{"projectGroupId": 16, "projectGroupName": "闵开发资产", "databaseName": "zszx", "tableId": 93, "tableName": "zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_BILL", "columnName": "ID", "columnType": "bigint(20)", "columnComment": "ID"}, {"projectGroupId": 16, "projectGroupName": "闵开发资产", "databaseName": "zszx", "tableId": 93, "tableName": "zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_BILL", "columnName": "CONTRACT_ID", "columnType": "bigint(20)", "columnComment": "合同id"}, {"projectGroupId": 16, "projectGroupName": "闵开发资产", "databaseName": "zszx", "tableId": 93, "tableName": "zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_BILL", "columnName": "DUE_PRICE", "columnType": "decimal(10,2)", "columnComment": "应收"}, {"projectGroupId": 16, "projectGroupName": "闵开发资产", "databaseName": "zszx", "tableId": 93, "tableName": "zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_BILL", "columnName": "SETTLE_STATE", "columnType": "tinyint(4)", "columnComment": "结清状态"}, {"projectGroupId": 16, "projectGroupName": "闵开发资产", "databaseName": "zszx", "tableId": 93, "tableName": "zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_BILL", "columnName": "DUE_DATE", "columnType": "varchar(255)", "columnComment": "应收日期"}], "relationIds": [], "derivation": "", "conditions": [], "note": "直接查询 SETTLE_STATE != 3 (已结清) 且 DUE_DATE <= 当前日期 的账单记录。"}], "dataInputs": [], "unmappedDataNeeds": []}, {"id": "key_findings", "heading": "六、关键发现", "instruction": "使用表格形式列出5-8条关键发现。每条包含：发现结论、支撑数据依据、对经营的具体影响。不按金额大小排序，而按重要性（如结构性问题、风险预警、机会点）排列。", "format": "table", "formats": ["table"], "intent": "提炼全文最核心的洞察，以结构化形式呈现，便于管理层快速抓取重点。", "analysis": ["信息压缩：从各章节中提取最具行动指导意义的结论", "因果链接：建立数据事实与管理后果之间的直接联系"], "dataNeeds": ["前文各章节的核心计算结果和结论"], "dataSources": [], "dataInputs": [{"dataNeed": "前文各章节的核心计算结果和结论", "kind": "section_result", "sectionIds": ["overview", "overall_status", "structure_analysis", "peer_comparison", "aging_and_quality"], "reason": "本章内容完全依赖于前序章节生成的定量结果和定性分析。"}], "unmappedDataNeeds": []}, {"id": "data_integrity", "heading": "七、数据一致性提示", "instruction": "列出发现的任何数据不平、逻辑矛盾（如分项之和大于总计、比率计算基数不一致等）。说明差异金额、可能原因及对最终结论的影响程度（轻微/严重）。若无异常可省略此节或声明“经校验数据一致”。", "format": "table", "formats": ["table"], "intent": "专门披露在分析过程中发现的数据异常、逻辑冲突或需要进一步核实的问题，避免误导决策。", "analysis": ["异常检测：标记所有无法自动闭合的数据点", "影响评估：判断该异常是否改变整体趋势判断"], "dataNeeds": ["校验过程中发现的差异项及其具体数值"], "dataSources": [{"dataNeed": "校验过程中发现的差异项及其具体数值", "kind": "derived", "sources": [{"projectGroupId": 16, "projectGroupName": "闵开发资产", "databaseName": "zszx", "tableId": 93, "tableName": "zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_BILL", "columnName": "DUE_PRICE", "columnType": "decimal(10,2)", "columnComment": "应收"}, {"projectGroupId": 16, "projectGroupName": "闵开发资产", "databaseName": "zszx", "tableId": 95, "tableName": "zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_PAYABLE_LOG", "columnName": "PAYABLE_MONEY", "columnType": "decimal(18,4)", "columnComment": "收款金额"}, {"projectGroupId": 16, "projectGroupName": "闵开发资产", "databaseName": "zszx", "tableId": 93, "tableName": "zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_BILL", "columnName": "SETTLE_STATE", "columnType": "tinyint(4)", "columnComment": "结清状态"}], "relationIds": [{"projectGroupId": 16, "relationId": 18}], "derivation": "比对逻辑：若 SETTLE_STATE=3 但 SUM(PAYABLE)!=DUE_PRICE，或 SETTLE_STATE!=3 但 SUM(PAYABLE)>=DUE_PRICE，则标记为异常。计算差额 = ABS(SUM(PAYABLE)-DUE_PRICE)。", "conditions": [], "note": "通过状态字段与金额字段的逻辑一致性检查发现数据不平。"}], "dataInputs": [], "unmappedDataNeeds": []}, {"id": "conclusion", "heading": "八、结论", "instruction": "1. 进度评价：结合剔除预收后的实收率，判断当前处于什么阶段。\\n2. 结构诊断：指出最大的短板在哪里，改善的杠杆点是什么。\\n3. 质量警示：强调账龄带来的风险，区分短期波动与长期坏账。\\n4. 行动指引：简要提及针对高缺口单元或高风险账龄的建议关注点。", "format": "prose", "formats": ["prose"], "intent": "综合前述分析，从进度、结构、质量三个维度给出总体评价和建议方向。", "analysis": ["多维总结：整合数量、结构、时间维度的发现", "定性判断：基于定量数据给出“好/坏/有风险”的评价"], "dataNeeds": ["全文的核心结论和数据支撑"], "dataSources": [], "dataInputs": [{"dataNeed": "全文的核心结论和数据支撑", "kind": "section_result", "sectionIds": ["key_findings", "overall_status", "structure_analysis", "aging_and_quality"], "reason": "结论是对前述所有分析章节的综合提炼。"}], "unmappedDataNeeds": []}], "rules": ["必须严格区分“应收口径”与“账单/实收口径”，并在报告中明确解释两者差异产生的原因（如未开账、跨期结转）。", "在计算完成率时，若存在预收款，必须同时展示“含预收”和“剔除预收”两种口径，以防高估当期实际催收成效。", "结构分析中，重点关注“待收占比”与“应收占比”的剪刀差，这能揭示哪类资产或哪个单元承担了不成比例的坏账风险。", "账龄分析应体现“时间惩罚”概念，即欠费拖得越久，回收概率越低，需用倍数关系量化这种恶化趋势。", "所有表格中的数据需保留两位小数，金额单位需统一（如万元），并在表头注明。", "若发现数据逻辑错误（如已收+待收≠应收），必须在“数据一致性提示”章节单独列出，不得强行修正或忽略。", "语气保持客观、专业，避免情绪化词汇，所有结论必须有前文计算出的数据支撑。", "保留模板明确的排名数量、筛选范围和表格列顺序；例如前三名不能自行改成前五名。本次用户明确调整时才按新要求执行。", "原模板没有图表且用户未要求时不主动新增图表。构成图只使用互斥的明细项，禁止把合计、小计、总计作为一个类别重复计算。", "库存缺口数量=max(安全库存-当前库存,0)，不能出现负数；模板要求库存风险清单时，仅列正缺口商品，不把正常库存混入风险清单。", "数据需求区分数据库字段、用户需确认的业务口径、前序章节结果及真正缺项；已有前文结果不要求用户重复提供。"], "presentation": {"version": 1, "outline": ["一、报告说明\\t1", "二、整体收缴情况\\t1", "三、房屋类与场地类结构分析\\t1", "四、集团四家公司对比\\t1", "五、账单口径与历史欠费\\t1", "六、关键发现\\t1", "七、看板数据一致性提示\\t1", "八、结论\\t1", "一、报告说明", "二、整体收缴情况", "三、房屋类与场地类结构分析", "四、集团四家公司对比", "五、账单口径与历史欠费", "六、关键发现", "七、看板数据一致性提示", "八、结论"], "roles": {"title": {"fontFamily": "Microsoft YaHei", "fontSize": 11.0, "bold": false, "alignment": "center", "firstLineIndent": 0, "leftIndent": 0, "rightIndent": 0, "spaceBefore": 150.0, "spaceAfter": 18.0, "lineMultiple": 1.75}, "body": {"fontFamily": "SimSun", "fontSize": 12.0, "bold": false, "alignment": "justify", "firstLineIndent": 24.0, "leftIndent": 0, "rightIndent": 0, "spaceBefore": 0, "spaceAfter": 8.0, "lineMultiple": 1.75}, "section": {"fontFamily": "SimSun", "fontSize": 12.0, "bold": false, "alignment": "left", "firstLineIndent"