2026-10-23 14:23:19,869 - openai._base_client - DEBUG - Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/chat/completions', 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-b5d2c9dd-f6b3-45be-abd7-bca881bf8d0c', 'security': {'bearer_auth': True}, 'content': None, 'json_data': {'messages': [{'role': 'system', 'content': '【当前系统时间】\n2026-10-23 14:23:19（周五）\n涉及日期、时间、时效性判断（如“今天”“本月”“最近”）时，一律以上述时间为基准，不得臆造、替换或推算错误的时间。当用户未提出时间内容时不要随意推算或带入当前时间。\n\n【报告模板】\n闵开发租金收缴情况分析报告\n\n【模板目标】\n基于财务看板或台账数据，分析特定主体（如公司、项目）的租金/收入收缴情况。通过拆解应收、已收、待收及账龄结构，识别缺口来源、评估预收款影响、对比内部各单元绩效，并区分“未到期”与“真实欠费”，为催收策略和经营决策提供量化依据。\n\n【报告结构与写作规范】（必须严格遵守：章节顺序、标题、写作要点、呈现形式以本节为准；本节只是写作指引，不是报告素材，任何库名、表名、字段名、指标口径都不允许出现在报告里）\n---\nname: template-4ae326d71fd744efa6e795de\ndescription: "租金收缴与经营分析报告"\n---\n\n# 租金收缴与经营分析报告\n\n基于财务看板或台账数据，分析特定主体（如公司、项目）的租金/收入收缴情况。通过拆解应收、已收、待收及账龄结构，识别缺口来源、评估预收款影响、对比内部各单元绩效，并区分“未到期”与“真实欠费”，为催收策略和经营决策提供量化依据。\n\n根据本次资料分析和写作。示例主题和实体不作为必填目标；不能推导的内容省略并单独提示，不能凭空编造。\n\n## 一、报告说明\n\n这一部分的作用：界定分析范围、数据来源及核心指标定义，确保读者对统计口径有一致理解，并通过校验排除数据逻辑错误。\n\n1. 明确数据来源（如ERP、看板、手工台账）及覆盖的时间段和主体范围。\n2. 定义关键指标的计算公式（特别是“应收”、“已收”、“待收”、“完成率”以及是否包含“预收款”等调整项）。\n3. 进行基础数据校验：检查分项之和是否等于总计，是否存在逻辑矛盾（如已收+待收≠应收），若有差异需在此处或后续章节提示。\n\n呈现形式：正文、表格\n- 分析方法：梳理数据提取路径，确认无外部干扰数据\n- 分析方法：定义指标口径，特别注明特殊项（如跨期预收）的处理方式\n- 分析方法：执行加总校验，计算分项与总额的偏差率\n- 资料需求：原始数据源名称及获取时间\n- 资料需求：分析主体的全称及业务范围\n- 资料需求：核心财务指标的原始数值及定义\n- 资料需求：各分项数据的明细列表\n\n\n## 二、整体收缴情况\n\n这一部分的作用：展示总体收缴水平，量化当前状态与管理目标的差距，并剔除噪音因素（如预收款）以还原真实回款能力。\n\n1. 列出核心三项数字：应收总额、已收总额、待收总额，计算整体收缴率。\n2. 设定几个常见的管理目标档位（如70%、80%、90%），计算达到这些目标所需的额外增收金额，直观展示缺口大小。\n3. 分析非当期因素对完成率的影响：如果存在上年预收计入本年已收的情况，需单独列示其金额，并计算剔除该部分后的“实收率”，对比两者差异，说明其对趋势判断的潜在误导。\n\n呈现形式：正文、表格\n- 分析方法：计算基础比率：已收/应收\n- 分析方法：情景模拟：计算不同目标阈值下的资金缺口\n- 分析方法：归因调整：分离预收款贡献，计算净新增回款率\n- 资料需求：本期应收、已收、待收总金额\n- 资料需求：预设的管理目标百分比\n- 资料需求：其中属于上期预收但计入本期已收的金额\n\n\n## 三、业务类型结构分析\n\n这一部分的作用：按资产或业务类别（如房屋vs场地、A类vsB类）拆解收缴情况，识别结构性短板和高杠杆改进点。\n\n1. 对比不同类别的应收占比、待收占比及各自收缴率，找出表现最差或占比最大的类别。\n2. 分析缺口归属：计算各类别待收金额占总待收的比例，确定主要压力来源。\n3. 敏感性推演：计算每提升1个百分点收缴率对应的绝对金额增量，比较不同类别的边际效益；假设弱势类别达到强势类别的水平，测算整体收缴率的提升幅度及所需增收额。\n\n呈现形式：正文、表格\n- 分析方法：分类汇总：按业务线聚合应收、已收、待收数据\n- 分析方法：结构偏离度分析：对比应收结构与待收结构的差异\n- 分析方法：杠杆效应计算：单位百分点变动对应的金额变化\n- 分析方法：标杆对照法：用最优类别的比率作为基准进行模拟\n- 资料需求：各业务类别的应收、已收、待收明细\n- 资料需求：各业务类别的预收款分布情况\n\n\n## 四、内部单元横向对比\n\n这一部分的作用：在集团或多部门视角下，对比各子单元的绩效，识别集中度风险及管理效率差异。\n\n1. 列出所有子单元的核心指标（应收、已收、待收、完成率），按完成率排序，展示层级分布。\n2. 分析集中度：计算头部单元在应收和待收中的占比，观察待收集中度是否高于应收集中度（暗示小单元沉淀更多坏账风险）。\n3. 规模与效率关系：探讨业务规模大小与收缴率的相关性，指出是否存在“规模越小、管理成本越高、效率越低”的现象。\n4. 统一标准测算：计算若所有单元均达到最高水平（或平均目标水平）时，集团整体需补收的金额。\n\n呈现形式：正文、表格\n- 分析方法：排名与分层：按收缴率对子单元排序\n- 分析方法：集中度指标：计算Top N单元的份额\n- 分析方法：相关性分析：观察规模占比与完成率的散点关系\n- 分析方法：标准化模拟：将低效单元提升至高效单元水平的增量计算\n- 资料需求：各子单元（分公司/项目部）的独立财务数据\n- 资料需求：集团合计数据\n\n\n## 五、账单口径与历史欠费分析\n\n这一部分的作用：区分“账面待收”与“实际欠费”，通过账龄分析揭示回收难度的演变规律，评估资产质量。\n\n1. 引入账单维度数据：对比“应收口径”与“已出账单口径”的差异，解释为何账单结清率高但整体收缴率低（通常因未开账部分）。\n\n呈现形式：正文、表格\n- 分析方法：口径桥接：分析未开账金额对整体缺口的贡献\n- 分析方法：账龄衰减模型：计算不同年份未结清金额的倍数关系，推导回收难度随时间的恶化速度\n- 分析方法：风险定性：将待收分解为“正常流转中”和“逾期沉淀”两部分\n- 资料需求：分年度/分账龄段的账单金额、已结清金额、未结清金额\n- 资料需求：当期已开账但未结清的明细\n\n\n## 六、关键发现\n\n这一部分的作用：提炼全文最核心的洞察，以结构化形式呈现，便于管理层快速抓取重点。\n\n使用表格形式列出5-8条关键发现。每条包含：发现结论、支撑数据依据、对经营的具体影响。不按金额大小排序，而按重要性（如结构性问题、风险预警、机会点）排列。\n\n呈现形式：表格\n- 分析方法：信息压缩：从各章节中提取最具行动指导意义的结论\n- 分析方法：因果链接：建立数据事实与管理后果之间的直接联系\n- 资料需求：前文各章节的核心计算结果和结论\n\n\n## 七、数据一致性提示\n\n这一部分的作用：专门披露在分析过程中发现的数据异常、逻辑冲突或需要进一步核实的问题，避免误导决策。\n\n列出发现的任何数据不平、逻辑矛盾（如分项之和大于总计、比率计算基数不一致等）。说明差异金额、可能原因及对最终结论的影响程度（轻微/严重）。若无异常可省略此节或声明“经校验数据一致”。\n\n呈现形式：表格\n- 分析方法：异常检测：标记所有无法自动闭合的数据点\n- 分析方法：影响评估：判断该异常是否改变整体趋势判断\n- 资料需求：校验过程中发现的差异项及其具体数值\n\n\n## 八、结论\n\n这一部分的作用：综合前述分析，从进度、结构、质量三个维度给出总体评价和建议方向。\n\n1. 进度评价：结合剔除预收后的实收率，判断当前处于什么阶段。\n2. 结构诊断：指出最大的短板在哪里，改善的杠杆点是什么。\n3. 质量警示：强调账龄带来的风险，区分短期波动与长期坏账。\n4. 行动指引：简要提及针对高缺口单元或高风险账龄的建议关注点。\n\n呈现形式：正文\n- 分析方法：多维总结：整合数量、结构、时间维度的发现\n- 分析方法：定性判断：基于定量数据给出“好/坏/有风险”的评价\n- 资料需求：全文的核心结论和数据支撑\n\n\n## 全文规则\n\n- 必须严格区分“应收口径”与“账单/实收口径”，并在报告中明确解释两者差异产生的原因（如未开账、跨期结转）。\n- 在计算完成率时，若存在预收款，必须同时展示“含预收”和“剔除预收”两种口径，以防高估当期实际催收成效。\n- 结构分析中，重点关注“待收占比”与“应收占比”的剪刀差，这能揭示哪类资产或哪个单元承担了不成比例的坏账风险。\n- 账龄分析应体现“时间惩罚”概念，即欠费拖得越久，回收概率越低，需用倍数关系量化这种恶化趋势。\n- 所有表格中的数据需保留两位小数，金额单位需统一（如万元），并在表头注明。\n- 若发现数据逻辑错误（如已收+待收≠应收），必须在“数据一致性提示”章节单独列出，不得强行修正或忽略。\n- 语气保持客观、专业，避免情绪化词汇，所有结论必须有前文计算出的数据支撑。\n- 保留模板明确的排名数量、筛选范围和表格列顺序；例如前三名不能自行改成前五名。本次用户明确调整时才按新要求执行。\n- 原模板没有图表且用户未要求时不主动新增图表。构成图只使用互斥的明细项，禁止把合计、小计、总计作为一个类别重复计算。\n- 库存缺口数量=max(安全库存-当前库存,0)，不能出现负数；模板要求库存风险清单时，仅列正缺口商品，不把正常库存混入风险清单。\n- 数据需求区分数据库字段、用户需确认的业务口径、前序章节结果及真正缺项；已有前文结果不要求用户重复提供。\n\n## 模板结构与排版\n\n称谓、开场、正文、结语与落款各归其位，不将它们分别扩成编号章节。章节以模板原层级为准，新资料放入相应部分。\n- 原主章节：一、报告说明\t1\n- 原主章节：二、整体收缴情况\t1\n- 原主章节：三、房屋类与场地类结构分析\t1\n- 原主章节：四、集团四家公司对比\t1\n- 原主章节：五、账单口径与历史欠费\t1\n- 原主章节：六、关键发现\t1\n- 原主章节：七、看板数据一致性提示\t1\n- 原主章节：八、结论\t1\n- 原主章节：一、报告说明\n- 原主章节：二、整体收缴情况\n- 原主章节：三、房屋类与场地类结构分析\n- 原主章节：四、集团四家公司对比\n- 原主章节：五、账单口径与历史欠费\n- 原主章节：六、关键发现\n- 原主章节：七、看板数据一致性提示\n- 原主章节：八、结论\n- title：{"fontFamily": "Microsoft YaHei", "fontSize": 11.0, "bold": false, "alignment": "center", "firstLineIndent": 0, "leftIndent": 0, "rightIndent": 0, "spaceBefore": 150.0, "spaceAfter": 18.0, "lineMultiple": 1.75}\n- body：{"fontFamily": "SimSun", "fontSize": 12.0, "bold": false, "alignment": "justify", "firstLineIndent": 24.0, "leftIndent": 0, "rightIndent": 0, "spaceBefore": 0, "spaceAfter": 8.0, "lineMultiple": 1.75}\n- section：{"fontFamily": "SimSun", "fontSize": 12.0, "bold": false, "alignment": "left", "firstLineIndent": 0, "leftIndent": 0.0, "rightIndent": 0, "spaceBefore": 6.0, "spaceAfter": 6.0, "lineMultiple": 1.5}\n\n## 生成与核对\n\n- 先生成 Markdown。适合比较、归纳或计算的内容使用表格；有数据且需要趋势/构成图时，图表读取同一张表，不另造数字。\n- 计算记录保留原文、单位、公式及结果；图表与表格一致。原文的计划、立场和否定不转写为已完成事实。\n- 先阅读全部资料，按对象、时期和版本整理事实，再把各部分的写作意图映射到本次主题。表格数据可以来自资料推导，不要求原资料已经是表格。\n- 求和、平均、乘除和比率均需说明来源与单位。先算合计再算比率时使用精确中间值，不把推导结果冒充原文记载。\n- 对照各部分的写作意图核对是否遗漏表格、图表或必要说明；资料不足时说明省略原因，不用空壳章节凑结构。\n- 内容复核：未开始不能改成进行中，未到期不等于延期，统计变化不等于已证明的原因；没有资料的可选人员等主题省略，限制和缺项单独提示。\n\n## 图表输出约定\n\n使用 Markdown 表格保存数据。图表声明放在 chart 代码块内，table 从1开始、列从0开始，柱状图/折线图/饼图读取该表而非另一组数字：\n\n```chart\n{"type":"bar","table":1,"title":"指标对比","xColumn":0,"yColumns":[1]}\n```\n\ntype 可为 bar、line、pie；有明确流程依据时可使用 flow，提供 nodes（id、label）和 edges（source、target）。不得用“此处插图”冒充已生成图表。\n\n## 项目组取数约定\n\n只使用本Skill列明且执行时仍有权限的表字段和已登记关系。根据用户需求确定主体、期间、单位和筛选条件，运行时复核结构；本Skill不包含已查询的业务数值。SQL生成与执行由聊天流程负责，不将字段映射当成事实。\n\n【智能体全局设定】\n请你根据返回的企业名称+注册地址给出一套完整的企业详细信息并介绍企业，并支持erp系统的分析报告生成\n\n你是负责生成最终业务报告的助手。模板规范只告诉你“每一章该写什么、怎么写”，数据一律来自执行结果。请用真实数据把模板章节填满，不要把规范本身复述成报告；规范与执行结果冲突时以真实数据为准，绝不沿用模板示例里的旧数值。'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': '用户原始问题：给我一份今年闵开发租金分析报告\n\n【模板取数执行结果】\n### 步骤 1: 步骤1：查询2026年闵开发整体租金收缴概况，包括应收总额、已收总额、待收总额及收缴率，并计算剔除预收款后的实收率。需关联ZC_CONTRACT_INFO（过滤ORG_CODE为闵开发相关编码）、ZC_CONTRACT_BILL和ZC_CONTRACT_PAYABLE_LOG表，统计DUE_DATE在2026年的账单应收，以及PAYABLE_DATE在2026年的收款，同时识别收款日期在2026年但账单周期完全在2026年之前的预收金额。\n**执行代码**:\n```python\nimport json\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom decimal import Decimal\n\ndef get_connection():\n    # 沙箱环境提供的连接函数，此处仅做占位说明，实际执行由沙箱注入\n    raise NotImplementedError("get_connection() must be provided by the sandbox environment")\n\ntry:\n    conn = get_connection()\n    cursor = conn.cursor()\n\n    # 定义统计期间：2026年\n    start_date_str = \'2026-01-01\'\n    end_date_str = \'2026-12-31\'\n    \n    # 闵开发相关的组织编码过滤条件\n    # 根据常见命名规则，假设 ORG_CODE 包含 \'MKF\' 或类似标识，或者通过 DEPT_NAME/ORG_NAME 匹配。\n    # 由于题目要求过滤 ORG_CODE 为闵开发相关编码，且表结构中 ZC_CONTRACT_INFO.ORG_CODE 是 varchar(255)。\n    # 通常“闵开发”可能对应特定的代码前缀。在没有确切映射表的情况下，我们尝试使用 LIKE \'%MIN%\' 或具体已知代码。\n    # 但更稳妥的方式是查看数据分布。这里假设“闵开发”对应的 ORG_CODE 可能以特定字符串开头或包含关键字。\n    # 鉴于这是模板任务，我将使用一个通用的过滤逻辑：假设 ORG_CODE 中包含 \'MKF\' (Min Kai Fa) 或者通过关联资产主表的 ONELVL_ORG_CODE。\n    # 为了准确性，我们先查询一下有哪些 ORG_CODE 涉及“闵开发”。如果无法动态获取，通常这类系统会有固定的编码。\n    # 让我们先执行一个探查查询，看看 ZC_CONTRACT_INFO 中有哪些 ORG_CODE 和 DEPT_NAME 与“闵开发”相关。\n    \n    sql_probe = """\n    SELECT DISTINCT ORG_CODE, DEPT_NAME \n    FROM zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_INFO \n    WHERE ENABLED = 1 AND REMOVED = 0 \n    AND (DEPT_NAME LIKE \'%闵开发%\' OR ORG_CODE LIKE \'%MKF%\' OR ORG_CODE LIKE \'%MIN%\')\n    LIMIT 10;\n    """\n    cursor.execute(sql_probe)\n    probe_results = cursor.fetchall()\n    \n    if not probe_results:\n        # 如果没有找到明确的匹配，可能需要放宽条件或检查其他字段\n        # 再次尝试只查 ORG_CODE 不为空的记录，看是否有规律\n        sql_probe_all = """\n        SELECT DISTINCT ORG_CODE, DEPT_NAME \n        FROM zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_INFO \n        WHERE ENABLED = 1 AND REMOVED = 0 \n        LIMIT 20;\n        """\n        cursor.execute(sql_probe_all)\n        all_orgs = cursor.fetchall()\n        print("未直接匹配到\'闵开发\'关键词，列出部分组织供参考:")\n        for row in all_orgs:\n            print(row)\n        # 假设我们需要手动指定或根据业务常识。在许多系统中，“闵开发”可能对应 "MKF" 或 "MINFA" 等。\n        # 这里为了继续流程，我们假设一个常见的测试值或从上下文推断。\n        # 如果必须运行，我将使用一个宽泛的过滤，或者假设用户指的是整个数据库范围内的“闵开发”项目。\n        # 考虑到报告标题是“闵开发租金分析报告”，通常指代该主体下的所有合同。\n        # 让我们尝试查找包含 "闵" 字的部门名称\n        cursor.execute("""\n            SELECT DISTINCT ORG_CODE, DEPT_NAME \n            FROM zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_INFO \n            WHERE ENABLED = 1 AND REMOVED = 0 AND DEPT_NAME LIKE \'%闵%\'\n        """)\n        min_results = cursor.fetchall()\n        if min_results:\n            org_codes = [r[0] for r in min_results if r[0]]\n            print(f"Found Org Codes associated with \'Min\': {org_codes}")\n        else:\n            org_codes = []\n            print("Warning: No specific Org Code found for \'Min\'. Proceeding with all enabled contracts or assuming global scope.")\n            \n    else:\n        org_codes = list(set([r[0] for r in probe_results if r[0]]))\n        print(f"Identified Org Codes for Min Development: {org_codes}")\n\n    # 构建主查询\n    # 1. 应收总额: SUM(DUE_PRICE) from BILL where DUE_DATE in 2026 and Contract belongs to target Orgs\n    # 2. 已收总额: SUM(PAYABLE_MONEY) from PAYABLE_LOG where PAYABLE_DATE in 2026 and Contract belongs to target Orgs\n    # 3. 预收款: SUM(PAYABLE_MONEY) from PAYABLE_LOG where PAYABLE_DATE in 2026, BUT Bill START_DATE < 2026-01-01 AND Bill END_DATE < 2026-01-01\n    \n    # 注意：日期字段在表中是 varchar，需要小心处理比较。格式通常为 \'YYYY-MM-DD\'。\n    \n    # 为了简化SQL并避免复杂的子查询嵌套导致性能问题，我们将分步计算或使用CTE（如果MySQL版本支持）。\n    # 这里使用标准JOIN方式。\n    \n    # 定义目标组织列表字符串用于IN子句\n    if org_codes:\n        placeholders = \',\'.join([\'%s\'] * len(org_codes))\n        org_filter_sql = f"ci.ORG_CODE IN ({placeholders})"\n        params_org = tuple(org_codes)\n    else:\n        # Fallback: If no specific codes found, maybe filter by Dept Name directly in main query?\n        # Or assume all data is relevant if it\'s a single-entity sandbox.\n        # Let\'s try filtering by DEPT_NAME LIKE \'%闵%\' in the join condition instead of ORG_CODE if ORG_CODE list is empty.\n        org_filter_sql = "ci.DEPT_NAME LIKE %s"\n        params_org = (\'%闵%\',)\n\n    # Query 1: Overall Receivable (Due Price)\n    sql_receivable = f"""\n    SELECT SUM(b.DUE_PRICE) AS total_due\n    FROM zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_BILL b\n    JOIN zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_INFO ci ON b.CONTRACT_ID = ci.ID\n    WHERE b.ENABLED = 1 AND b.REMOVED = 0\n      AND ci.ENABLED = 1 AND ci.REMOVED = 0\n      AND {org_filter_sql}\n      AND b.DUE_DATE >= %s AND b.DUE_DATE <= %s\n    """\n    params_recv = params_org + (start_date_str, end_date_str)\n    cursor.execute(sql_receivable, params_recv)\n    res_recv = cursor.fetchone()\n    total_due = float(res_recv[0]) if res_recv and res_recv[0] else 0.0\n\n    # Query 2: Total Received (Payable Money) in 2026\n    sql_received = f"""\n    SELECT SUM(pl.PAYABLE_MONEY) AS total_paid\n    FROM zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_PAYABLE_LOG pl\n    JOIN zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_INFO ci ON pl.CONTRACT_ID = ci.ID\n    WHERE pl.ENABLED = 1 AND pl.REMOVED = 0\n      AND ci.ENABLED = 1 AND ci.REMOVED = 0\n      AND {org_filter_sql}\n      AND pl.PAYABLE_DATE >= %s AND pl.PAYABLE_DATE <= %s\n    """\n    params_paid = params_org + (start_date_str, end_date_str)\n    cursor.execute(sql_received, params_paid)\n    res_paid = cursor.fetchone()\n    total_paid = float(res_paid[0]) if res_paid and res_paid[0] else 0.0\n\n    # Query 3: Pre-received Amount (Received in 2026 but Bill Period entirely before 2026)\n    # Condition: PayDate in 2026, Bill.StartDate < 2026-01-01 AND Bill.EndDate < 2026-01-01\n    sql_pre_receive = f"""\n    SELECT SUM(pl.PAYABLE_MONEY) AS pre_amount\n    FROM zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_PAYABLE_LOG pl\n    JOIN zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_BILL b ON pl.BILL_ID = b.ID\n    JOIN zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_INFO ci ON pl.CONTRACT_ID = ci.ID\n    WHERE pl.ENABLED = 1 AND pl.REMOVED = 0\n      AND b.ENABLED = 1 AND b.REMOVED = 0\n      AND ci.ENABLED = 1 AND ci.REMOVED = 0\n      AND {org_filter_sql}\n      AND pl.PAYABLE_DATE >= %s AND pl.PAYABLE_DATE <= %s\n      AND b.START_DATE < %s \n      AND b.END_DATE < %s\n    """\n    # Note: START_DATE and END_DATE are varchar. Assuming format YYYY-MM-DD allows string comparison.\n    params_pre = params_org + (start_date_str, end_date_str, start_date_str, start_date_str)\n    cursor.execute(sql_pre_receive, params_pre)\n    res_pre = cursor.fetchone()\n    pre_received = float(res_pre[0]) if res_pre and res_pre[0] else 0.0\n\n    # Calculations\n    outstanding = total_due - total_paid\n    collection_rate = (total_paid / total_due * 100) if total_due > 0 else 0.0\n    \n    # Net received excluding pre-payment contribution to current year\'s due?\n    # The prompt asks for "实收率" after removing pre-receipts.\n    # Interpretation: \n    # Standard Collection Rate = Total Paid / Total Due.\n    # Adjusted Real Collection Rate: We want to know how much of the CURRENT YEAR\'S DUE was actually collected.\n    # However, Total Paid includes money collected for bills that might be from previous years (pre-received into this year\'s cash flow) \n    # OR bills from this year.\n    # The "Pre-received" identified above is money paid in 2026 for bills ending BEFORE 2026. This is effectively collecting old debt early or paying future? \n    # Wait, definition in prompt: "收款日期在2026年但账单周期完全在2026年之前". This means paying off OLD bills.\n    # So, Total Paid (in 2026) = (Payment for 2026 Bills) + (Payment for Old Bills).\n    # To get "Real Collection Rate" for 2026 performance, we should probably look at:\n    # How much of the 2026 Due was paid? \n    # But the SQL for Total Paid sums ALL payments in 2026 regardless of which bill they pay.\n    # A more accurate "Net New Cash Flow attributable to Current Year Obligations" is hard without matching payment to specific bill due date.\n    # However, the prompt specifically asks to calculate "剔除预收款后的实收率".\n    # Usually, this implies: (Total Paid - Pre-received Amount related to current period confusion?) \n    # Actually, if I pay an old bill in 2026, that reduces my 2026 Outstanding (if outstanding is defined as All Unpaid).\n    # But here Outstanding = Total Due (2026) - Total Paid (2026). This formula assumes all payments apply to current dues, which is flawed if there are cross-period payments.\n    # Let\'s stick to the prompt\'s implied logic:\n    # 1. Calculate basic rates.\n    # 2. Identify the "Pre-received" amount (payments made in 2026 for periods prior to 2026).\n    # 3. "Adjusted Real Collection": Often means (Total Paid - Payments for Prior Years) / Total Due? \n    #    Or simply reporting the difference.\n    #    Let\'s interpret "剔除预收款后的实收率" as: \n    #    Numerator: Total Paid in 2026 MINUS the portion that represents "Pre-receipts" (which are technically collections of past debts, inflating current cash but not necessarily reflecting current billing efficiency? Or vice versa?).\n    #    Actually, if I collect old debt, my "Collection Rate" based on simple sum looks good. But if I haven\'t collected new debt, it\'s misleading.\n    #    Let\'s calculate:\n    #    Effective Collections for Current Year Context = Total Paid - Pre_Received_Old_Debt? \n    #    No, usually "Pre-receipt" means receiving money for FUTURE services. Here the definition is "Bill period BEFORE 2026", so it\'s "Late Payment of Past Debt" or "Early Settlement of Past Debt".\n    #    The prompt calls it "预收款" (Pre-receipt) but defines it as "Bill cycle completely before 2026". This is contradictory terminology (usually called Arrears Collection), but we follow the data definition.\n    #    So, Amount Collected for 2026 Bills = Total Paid (2026) - Amount Paid for Pre-2026 Bills.\n    #    Then Real Collection Rate = (Amount Collected for 2026 Bills) / Total Due (2026).\n    \n    collected_for_current_bills = total_paid - pre_received\n    real_collection_rate = (collected_for_current_bills / total_due * 100) if total_due > 0 else 0.0\n\n    # Prepare Output Table\n    data = {\n        \'指标\': [\'应收总额 (2026)\', \'已收总额 (2026)\', \'待收总额\', \'整体收缴率 (%)\', \'其中: 跨期回款(旧账)\', \'剔除跨期后实收额\', \'剔除跨期后实收率 (%)\'],\n        \'金额/比率\': [\n            round(total_due, 2),\n            round(total_paid, 2),\n            round(outstanding, 2),\n            round(collection_rate, 2),\n            round(pre_received, 2),\n            round(collected_for_current_bills, 2),\n            round(real_collection_rate, 2)\n        ]\n    }\n    df = pd.DataFrame(data)\n    \n    print("=== 2026年闵开发租金收缴概况 ===")\n    print(df.to_string(index=False))\n    \n    # Handoff for subsequent steps\n    # Pass the calculated totals and potentially the org codes used\n    handoff_data = {\n        \'total_due\': total_due,\n        \'total_paid\': total_paid,\n        \'outstanding\': outstanding,\n        \'collection_rate\': collection_rate,\n        \'pre_received\': pre_received,\n        \'real_collection_rate\': real_collection_rate,\n        \'used_org_codes\': org_codes if org_codes else [\'Fallback: DeptName Like %闵%\']\n    }\n    print(\'__HANDOFF__\' + json.dumps(handoff_data))\n\nexcept Exception as e:\n    print(f"Error during execution: {str(e)}")\n    import traceback\n    traceback.print_exc()\nfinally:\n    if \'cursor\' in locals():\n        cursor.close()\n    if \'conn\' in locals():\n        conn.rollback()\n        conn.close()\n```\n**执行结果**:\n```text\nError during execution: get_connection() must be provided by the sandbox environment\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File "<string>", line 10, in <module>\n  File "<string>", line 7, in get_connection\nNotImplementedError: get_connection() must be provided by the sandbox environment\n```\n\n### 步骤 2: 步骤2：按业务类型（BILL_TYPE）分解2026年应收、已收、待收及收缴率，分析各业务类型的结构占比及缺口贡献度。\n**执行代码**:\n```python\nimport json\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom decimal import Decimal\n\ndef get_connection():\n    # 沙箱环境提供，此处仅为占位说明，实际执行时由沙箱注入\n    raise RuntimeError("get_connection() must be provided by the sandbox environment")\n\ntry:\n    conn = get_connection()\n    cursor = conn.cursor()\n\n    # 查询2026年各业务类型（BILL_TYPE）的应收、已收、待收及收缴率\n    sql = """\n    SELECT \n        b.BILL_TYPE,\n        CASE b.BILL_TYPE\n            WHEN 1 THEN \'土地使用费\'\n            WHEN 2 THEN \'场地管理费\'\n            WHEN 3 THEN \'自建账单 (场地)\'\n            WHEN 4 THEN \'场地开发费 (闵联)\'\n            WHEN 5 THEN \'非租赁收入 (场地)\'\n            WHEN 6 THEN \'物业管理费用 (场地)\'\n            WHEN 7 THEN \'非租赁收入 (房屋)\'\n            WHEN 8 THEN \'固定租金 (综合类)\'\n            WHEN 9 THEN \'固定租金\'\n            WHEN 10 THEN \'物业费\'\n            WHEN 11 THEN \'自建账单 (房屋)\'\n            WHEN 12 THEN \'水费\'\n            WHEN 13 THEN \'电费\'\n            WHEN 14 THEN \'能源费\'\n            WHEN 15 THEN \'停车费\'\n            WHEN 16 THEN \'光伏电费\'\n            ELSE CONCAT(\'未知类型(\', b.BILL_TYPE, \')\')\n        END AS BILL_TYPE_NAME,\n        SUM(b.DUE_PRICE) AS TOTAL_DUE,\n        SUM(COALESCE(p.PAYABLE_MONEY, 0)) AS TOTAL_RECEIVED,\n        SUM(b.DUE_PRICE) - SUM(COALESCE(p.PAYABLE_MONEY, 0)) AS TOTAL_PENDING,\n        CASE \n            WHEN SUM(b.DUE_PRICE) = 0 OR SUM(b.DUE_PRICE) IS NULL THEN 0\n            ELSE ROUND(SUM(COALESCE(p.PAYABLE_MONEY, 0)) / SUM(b.DUE_PRICE) * 100, 2)\n        END AS COLLECTION_RATE\n    FROM zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_BILL b\n    LEFT JOIN zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_PAYABLE_LOG p \n        ON b.ID = p.BILL_ID \n        AND p.ENABLED = 1 \n        AND p.REMOVED = 0\n    WHERE b.START_DATE >= \'2026-01-01\' \n      AND b.END_DATE <= \'2026-12-31\'\n      AND b.ENABLED = 1 \n      AND b.REMOVED = 0\n    GROUP BY b.BILL_TYPE\n    ORDER BY TOTAL_DUE DESC\n    """\n\n    cursor.execute(sql)\n    columns = [desc[0] for desc in cursor.description]\n    rows = cursor.fetchall()\n\n    # 转换为 DataFrame\n    df = pd.DataFrame(rows, columns=columns)\n\n    # 处理 Decimal 类型以便后续计算和 JSON 序列化\n    for col in [\'TOTAL_DUE\', \'TOTAL_RECEIVED\', \'TOTAL_PENDING\', \'COLLECTION_RATE\']:\n        if col in df.columns:\n            df[col] = df[col].apply(lambda x: float(x) if isinstance(x, Decimal) else (float(x) if x is not None else 0.0))\n\n    # 计算结构占比（基于总应收）\n    total_due_all = df[\'TOTAL_DUE\'].sum()\n    if total_due_all > 0:\n        df[\'DUE_STRUCTURE_RATIO\'] = (df[\'TOTAL_DUE\'] / total_due_all * 100).round(2)\n    else:\n        df[\'DUE_STRUCTURE_RATIO\'] = 0.0\n\n    # 计算缺口贡献度（基于总待收）\n    total_pending_all = df[\'TOTAL_PENDING\'].sum()\n    if total_pending_all > 0:\n        df[\'PENDING_CONTRIBUTION\'] = (df[\'TOTAL_PENDING\'] / total_pending_all * 100).round(2)\n    else:\n        df[\'PENDING_CONTRIBUTION\'] = 0.0\n\n    # 输出纯文本表格\n    print("=" * 120)\n    print("【步骤2】2026年按业务类型分解：应收、已收、待收、收缴率、结构占比及缺口贡献度")\n    print("=" * 120)\n    \n    if df.empty:\n        print("未查询到2026年相关账单数据。")\n    else:\n        # 格式化输出\n        display_cols = [\'BILL_TYPE\', \'BILL_TYPE_NAME\', \'TOTAL_DUE\', \'TOTAL_RECEIVED\', \'TOTAL_PENDING\', \'COLLECTION_RATE\', \'DUE_STRUCTURE_RATIO\', \'PENDING_CONTRIBUTION\']\n        header = "\\t".join(display_cols)\n        print(header)\n        print("-" * len(header))\n        for _, row in df.iterrows():\n            line = "\\t".join([str(row[c]) for c in display_cols])\n            print(line)\n        \n        print("\\n汇总:")\n        print(f"总应收金额: {total_due_all:.2f}")\n        print(f"总已收金额: {df[\'TOTAL_RECEIVED\'].sum():.2f}")\n        print(f"总待收金额: {total_pending_all:.2f}")\n        overall_rate = round(df[\'TOTAL_RECEIVED\'].sum() / total_due_all * 100, 2) if total_due_all > 0 else 0\n        print(f"整体收缴率: {overall_rate}%")\n\n    # 提取关键结果用于后续步骤：所有涉及的合同ID列表（通过账单关联的合同）\n    # 重新查询获取涉及2026年账单的合同ID，去重\n    sql_contract_ids = """\n    SELECT DISTINCT c.ID\n    FROM zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_INFO c\n    INNER JOIN zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_BILL b ON c.ID = b.CONTRACT_ID\n    WHERE b.START_DATE >= \'2026-01-01\' \n      AND b.END_DATE <= \'2026-12-31\'\n      AND b.ENABLED = 1 \n      AND b.REMOVED = 0\n      AND c.ENABLED = 1 \n      AND c.REMOVED = 0\n    """\n    cursor.execute(sql_contract_ids)\n    contract_id_rows = cursor.fetchall()\n    contract_ids = [int(r[0]) for r in contract_id_rows]\n\n    # 打印交接信息\n    print(\'__HANDOFF__\' + json.dumps({\'contract_ids_2026\': contract_ids}))\n\nexcept Exception as e:\n    print(f"执行出错: {str(e)}")\n    import traceback\n    traceback.print_exc()\nfinally:\n    try:\n        if \'cursor\' in locals():\n            cursor.close()\n        if \'conn\' in locals():\n            conn.rollback()\n            conn.close()\n    except Exception:\n        pass\n```\n**执行结果**:\n```text\n执行出错: get_connection() must be provided by the sandbox environment\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File "<string>", line 10, in <module>\n  File "<string>", line 7, in get_connection\nRuntimeError: get_connection() must be provided by the sandbox environment\n```\n\n### 步骤 3: 步骤3：按内部单元（DEPT_NAME或ORG_CODE）分解2026年应收、已收、待收及收缴率，并按收缴率排序，识别头部和尾部单元，计算待收集中度。\n**执行代码**:\n```python\nimport json\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom decimal import Decimal\n\n# 获取数据库连接\ntry:\n    conn = get_connection()\nexcept Exception as e:\n    raise RuntimeError(f"无法获取数据库连接: {e}")\n\ntry:\n    cursor = conn.cursor()\n    \n    # 定义2026年的时间范围\n    start_date = \'2026-01-01\'\n    end_date = \'2026-12-31\'\n    \n    # SQL查询：按部门/组织分解2026年应收、已收、待收及收缴率\n    # 关联合同信息表(ZC_CONTRACT_INFO)和账单表(ZC_CONTRACT_BILL)以及收款记录表(ZC_CONTRACT_PAYABLE_LOG)\n    # 注意：ZC_CONTRACT_PAYABLE_LOG 是收款记录，需要关联到具体的账单或合同。\n    # 根据JOIN规则：ZC_CONTRACT_INFO.ID = ZC_CONTRACT_PAYABLE_LOG.CONTRACT_ID\n    # 但更精确的收款通常是针对账单的，不过这里为了简化且符合常见报表逻辑，我们看是否有BILL_ID关联。\n    # JOIN规则显示: ZC_CONTRACT_BILL.ID = ZC_CONTRACT_PAYABLE_LOG.BILL_ID (1对1关系描述可能有误，通常是一对多，但字段存在)\n    # 让我们使用 BILL_ID 来关联收款，这样更准确对应“应收”和“已收”。\n    \n    sql = """\n    SELECT \n        COALESCE(ci.DEPT_NAME, ci.ORG_CODE, \'未知单元\') AS unit_name,\n        SUM(cb.DUE_PRICE) AS total_due,\n        SUM(COALESCE(cpl.PAYABLE_MONEY, 0)) AS total_paid,\n        SUM(cb.DUE_PRICE) - SUM(COALESCE(cpl.PAYABLE_MONEY, 0)) AS total_unpaid\n    FROM zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_INFO ci\n    INNER JOIN zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_BILL cb ON ci.ID = cb.CONTRACT_ID\n    LEFT JOIN zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_PAYABLE_LOG cpl ON cb.ID = cpl.BILL_ID AND cpl.REMOVED = 0 AND cpl.ENABLED = 1\n    WHERE ci.REMOVED = 0 \n      AND ci.ENABLED = 1\n      AND cb.REMOVED = 0 \n      AND cb.ENABLED = 1\n      AND cb.START_DATE <= %s\n      AND cb.END_DATE >= %s\n    GROUP BY unit_name\n    HAVING total_due > 0\n    ORDER BY total_due DESC\n    """\n    \n    params = [end_date, start_date]\n    \n    cursor.execute(sql, params)\n    rows = cursor.fetchall()\n    columns = [desc[0] for desc in cursor.description]\n    \n    if not rows:\n        print("未查询到2026年相关数据")\n        df = pd.DataFrame(columns=columns + [\'collection_rate\', \'unpaid_concentration\'])\n    else:\n        df = pd.DataFrame(rows, columns=columns)\n        \n        # 处理Decimal类型转换为float以便计算\n        numeric_cols = [\'total_due\', \'total_paid\', \'total_unpaid\']\n        for col in numeric_cols:\n            df[col] = df[col].apply(lambda x: float(x) if isinstance(x, Decimal) else x)\n            \n        # 计算收缴率\n        df[\'collection_rate\'] = (df[\'total_paid\'] / df[\'total_due\']).round(4)\n        \n        # 计算总待收金额用于集中度分析\n        total_unpaid_all = df[\'total_unpaid\'].sum()\n        \n        if total_unpaid_all > 0:\n            df[\'unpaid_concentration\'] = (df[\'total_unpaid\'] / total_unpaid_all).round(4)\n        else:\n            df[\'unpaid_concentration\'] = 0.0\n            \n        # 按收缴率排序（升序，尾部在前；或者降序，头部在前？题目要求识别头部和尾部）\n        # 通常“头部”指表现好的（高收缴率），“尾部”指表现差的（低收缴率）。\n        # 这里先按收缴率升序排列，方便查看尾部问题单元，也可以按需调整。\n        # 为了报告清晰，我们可以保留原始顺序或重新排序。\n        # 题目要求：按收缴率排序。\n        df_sorted = df.sort_values(by=\'collection_rate\', ascending=True).reset_index(drop=True)\n        \n        # 输出表格\n        print("=" * 80)\n        print("2026年闵开发租金收入按内部单元分解分析报告")\n        print("=" * 80)\n        print(df_sorted.to_string(index=False))\n        print("-" * 80)\n        \n        # 识别头部和尾部\n        top_n = 5\n        bottom_n = 5\n        \n        # 头部：收缴率最高的前N个单元\n        head_units = df_sorted.tail(top_n)[[\'unit_name\', \'collection_rate\']].iloc[::-1]\n        print("\\n【头部单元】(收缴率最高 Top {})".format(top_n))\n        print(head_units.to_string(index=False))\n        \n        # 尾部：收缴率最低的前N个单元\n        tail_units = df_sorted.head(bottom_n)[[\'unit_name\', \'collection_rate\']]\n        print("\\n【尾部单元】(收缴率最低 Bottom {})".format(bottom_n))\n        print(tail_units.to_string(index=False))\n        \n        # 待收集中度分析\n        # 找出贡献了大部分待收金额的单元\n        df_unpaid_sorted = df.sort_values(by=\'total_unpaid\', ascending=False).reset_index(drop=True)\n        df_unpaid_sorted[\'cumulative_unpaid_ratio\'] = df_unpaid_sorted[\'total_unpaid\'].cumsum() / total_unpaid_all\n        \n        # 找到累计占比超过80%的单元数量\n        threshold_80 = df_unpaid_sorted[df_unpaid_sorted[\'cumulative_unpaid_ratio\'] <= 0.8]\n        count_80 = len(threshold_80) + 1 if len(threshold_80) < len(df_unpaid_sorted) else len(df_unpaid_sorted)\n        \n        print("\\n【待收集中度分析】")\n        print(f"总待收金额: {total_unpaid_all:.2f}")\n        print(f"前 {count_80} 个单元贡献了约80%的待收金额。")\n        print("\\n主要待收单元 (Top 10 by Unpaid Amount):")\n        print(df_unpaid_sorted.head(10)[[\'unit_name\', \'total_unpaid\', \'unpaid_concentration\', \'cumulative_unpaid_ratio\']].to_string(index=False))\n\n    # 准备交接数据：后续步骤可能需要用到这些单元名称或ID列表，这里暂存关键统计结果\n    handoff_data = {\n        "report_year": 2026,\n        "total_due": float(df[\'total_due\'].sum()) if not df.empty else 0.0,\n        "total_paid": float(df[\'total_paid\'].sum()) if not df.empty else 0.0,\n        "total_unpaid": float(total_unpaid_all) if not df.empty else 0.0,\n        "overall_collection_rate": float(df[\'total_paid\'].sum() / df[\'total_due\'].sum()) if not df.empty and df[\'total_due\'].sum() > 0 else 0.0,\n        "head_units": head_units[\'unit_name\'].tolist() if not df.empty else [],\n        "tail_units": tail_units[\'unit_name\'].tolist() if not df.empty else []\n    }\n    \n    print(\'__HANDOFF__\' + json.dumps(handoff_data))\n\nfinally:\n    try:\n        cursor.close()\n    except:\n        pass\n    try:\n        conn.rollback()\n    except:\n        pass\n    try:\n        conn.close()\n    except:\n        pass\n```\n**执行结果**:\n```text\n================================================================================\n2026年闵开发租金收入按内部单元分解分析报告\n================================================================================\nunit_name    total_due   total_paid  total_unpaid  collection_rate  unpaid_concentration\n    益源招商部  17782869.67   7339980.99   10442888.68           0.4128                0.0622\n      LHW   6374269.75   3408442.91    2965826.84           0.5347                0.0177\n  临港企业服务部  38601216.28  21336600.73   17264615.55           0.5527                0.1028\n   临港招商中心   6821222.06   4178657.92    2642564.14           0.6126                0.0157\n   闵联招商中心  30071013.77  19569021.46   10501992.31           0.6508                0.0625\n   MLLGYQ  94469555.41  65859232.73   28610322.68           0.6971                0.1703\n    MHKFQ 253321947.10 180899692.45   72422254.65           0.7141                0.4311\n  闵联资产管理部  83119703.73  60051577.49   23068126.24           0.7225                0.1373\n     闵临置业   1140198.75   1068198.75      72000.00           0.9369                0.0004\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n【头部单元】(收缴率最高 Top 5)\nunit_name  collection_rate\n     闵临置业           0.9369\n  闵联资产管理部           0.7