n            c.CUSTOMER_NAME AS 客户名称,\n            a.ASSET_NAME AS 租赁资产,\n            c.ROOM_NO AS 房号,\n            CASE c.ASSET_TYPE \n                WHEN 1 THEN \'厂房\' \n                WHEN 2 THEN \'土地\' \n                WHEN 3 THEN \'楼宇\' \n                WHEN 4 THEN \'其他\' \n                ELSE \'未知\' \n            END AS 资产类型,\n            c.LEASE_AREA AS 租赁面积_平方米,\n            c.CONTRACT_TYPE AS 租赁合同类型,\n            c.START_DATE AS 开始日期,\n            c.END_DATE AS 结束日期\n        FROM zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_INFO c\n        LEFT JOIN zszx.ZC_ASSET_INFO_MAIN a ON c.ASSET_ID = a.ID\n        WHERE c.CUSTOMER_NAME LIKE %s\n          AND c.CONTRACT_STATE = 1\n          AND c.REMOVED = 0\n          AND c.ENABLED = 1\n          AND (a.REMOVED IS NULL OR a.REMOVED = 0)\n          AND (a.ENABLED IS NULL OR a.ENABLED = 1)\n        ORDER BY c.CONTRACT_NO ASC\n        """\n        \n        params = (\'%百事可乐%\',)\n        cursor.execute(sql, params)\n        rows = cursor.fetchall()\n        columns = [desc[0] for desc in cursor.description]\n        \n        if not rows:\n            print("未查询到客户名称包含\'百事可乐\'的有效租赁合同明细。")\n            return pd.DataFrame(columns=columns)\n            \n        df = pd.DataFrame(rows, columns=columns)\n        return df\n        \n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f"查询出错: {e}")\n        raise e\n    finally:\n        if conn:\n            try:\n                conn.rollback()\n            except:\n                pass\n            conn.close()\n\ndf = get_data()\n\nif not df.empty:\n    print(f"共查询到 {len(df)} 份有效合同明细：")\n    print(df.to_string(index=False))\nelse:\n    print("无数据返回。")\n```\n**执行结果**:\n```text\n共查询到 7 份有效合同明细：\n        合同编号          出租方         客户名称                    租赁资产                               房号 资产类型 租赁面积_平方米   租赁合同类型       开始日期       结束日期\nSMC2013BD007 上海闵行联合发展有限公司 上海百事可乐饮料有限公司           D-江川路街道15街坊4丘                    D-江川路街道15街坊4丘   土地 42151.00   场地使用合同 2013-01-01 2039-03-14\nSMC2024AM067 上海闵行联合发展有限公司 上海百