      "DEADLINE_DESCRIBE": {\n        "columnComment": "期限说明",\n        "type": "varchar(255)",\n        "remark": "期限说明"\n      },\n      "LESSOR_ID": {\n        "columnComment": "出租方ID",\n        "type": "bigint(20)",\n        "remark": "出租方ID"\n      },\n      "LESSOR": {\n        "columnComment": "出租方",\n        "type": "varchar(255)",\n        "remark": "出租方"\n      },\n      "CUSTOMER_ID": {\n        "columnComment": "客户ID（乙方）",\n        "type": "bigint(20)",\n        "remark": "客户ID（乙方）"\n      },\n      "CUSTOMER_NAME": {\n        "columnComment": "客户名称",\n        "type": "varchar(255)",\n        "remark": "客户名称"\n      },\n      "CONTRACT_STATE": {\n        "columnComment": "合同状态（1有效合同 2无效合同）",\n        "type": "tinyint(4)",\n        "remark": "合同状态（1有效合同 2无效合同）"\n      },\n      "IS_TRACK": {\n        "columnComment": "是否跟踪",\n        "type": "tinyint(4)",\n        "remark": "是否跟踪"\n      },\n      "SIGN_DATE": {\n        "columnComment": "起租日期",\n        "type": "varchar(50)",\n        "remark": "起租日期"\n      },\n      "EXECUT_DATE": {\n        "columnComment": "签定时间",\n        "type": "varchar(50)",\n        "remark": "签定时间"\n      },\n      "DEPT_ID": {\n        "columnComment": "归属部门ID",\n        "type": "bigint(20)",\n        "remark": "归属部门ID"\n      },\n      "DEPT_NAME": {\n        "columnComment": "归属部门",\n        "type": "varchar(200)",\n        "remark": "归属部门"\n      },\n      "LEASE_TYPE": {\n        "columnComment": "租赁类型(1.新签 2.续租)",\n        "type": "tinyint(4)",\n        "remark": "租赁类型(1.新签 2.续租)"\n      },\n      "SORT": {\n        "columnComment": "排序",\n        "type": "int(11)",\n        "remark": "排序"\n      },\n      "REMARKS": {\n        "columnComment": "备注",\n        "type": "varchar(255)",\n        "remark": "备注"\n      },\n      "COL_1": {\n        "columnComment": "预留字段1",\n        "type": "varchar(100)",\n        "remark": "预留字段1"\n      },\n      "COL_2": {\n        "columnComment": "预留字段2",\n        "type": "varchar(100)",\n        "remark": "预留字段2"\n      },\n      "COL_3": {\n        "columnComment": "预留字段3",\n        "type": "varchar(100)",\n        "remark": "预留字段3"\n      },\n      "COL_4": {\n        "columnComment": "预留字段4",\n        "type": "varchar(100)",\n        "remark": "预留字段4"\n      },\n      "COL_5": {\n        "columnComment": "预留字段5",\n        "type": "varchar(100)",\n        "remark": "预留字段5"\n      },\n      "COL_6": {\n        "columnComment": "预留字段6",\n        "type": "varchar(100)",\n        "remark": "预留字段6"\n      },\n      "COL_7": {\n        "columnComment": "预留字段7",\n        "type": "varchar(100)",\n        "remark": "预留字段7"\n      },\n      "COL_8": {\n        "columnComment": "预留字段8",\n        "type": "varchar(100)",\n        "remark": "预留字段8"\n      },\n      "COL_9": {\n        "columnComment": "预留字段9",\n        "type": "varchar(100)",\n        "remark": "预留字段9"\n      },\n      "COL_10": {\n        "columnComment": "预留字段10",\n        "type": "varchar(100)",\n        "remark": "预留字段10"\n      },\n      "ENABLED": {\n        "columnComment": "是否有效",\n        "type": "tinyint(4)",\n        "remark": "是否有效"\n      },\n      "REMOVED": {\n        "columnComment": "是否删除",\n        "type": "tinyint(4)",\n        "remark": "是否删除"\n      },\n      "CREATE_USER_ID": {\n        "columnComment": "创建人ID",\n        "type": "bigint(20)",\n        "remark": "创建人ID"\n      },\n      "CREATE_USER_NAME": {\n        "columnComment": "创建人",\n        "type": "varchar(50)",\n        "remark": "创建人"\n      },\n      "CREATE_TIME": {\n        "columnComment": "创建时间",\n        "type": "varchar(50)",\n        "remark": "创建时间"\n      },\n      "UPDATE_USER_ID": {\n        "columnComment": "更新人ID",\n        "type": "bigint(20)",\n        "remark": "更新人ID"\n      },\n      "UPDATE_USER_NAME": {\n        "columnComment": "更新人",\n        "type": "varchar(50)",\n        "remark": "更新人"\n      },\n      "UPDATE_TIME": {\n        "columnComment": "更新时间",\n        "type": "varchar(50)",\n        "remark": "更新时间"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n]\n\n【多表关联关系 (JOIN 规则)】\n如果任务涉及多个表的数据联合查询，请务必参考以下关联规则：\n- `sourceTableId` / `targetTableId`: 需要进行关联的表 ID（对应上方表结构数据中的 `tableId`）\n- `sourceColumn`: 源表用于 JOIN 的物理字段名\n- `targetColumn`: 目标表用于 JOIN 的物理字段名\n- `relationContent` / `remarks`: 关联关系的业务场景说明（如：1对多、外键等）\n\n关联关系数据：\n[\n  {\n    "sourceTableId": 92,\n    "targetTableId": 94,\n    "relationContent": "资产主表对应的多份合同信息表",\n    "sourceColumn": "ID",\n    "targetColumn": "ASSET_ID",\n    "remarks": null\n  },\n  {\n    "sourceTableId": 92,\n    "targetTableId": 102,\n    "relationContent": "一个资产对应多个厂房数据。",\n    "sourceColumn": "ID",\n    "targetColumn": "MAIN_ID",\n    "remarks": null\n  }\n]\n\n【客户沙箱数据访问】\n使用沙箱提供的 get_connection()，通过 cursor.execute(sql, params) 参数绑定查询。不需要也不得索取、输出或猜测数据库连接信息。查询后回滚只读事务并关闭连接。\n**SQL 注意**：所有 SQL 必须为 MySQL 兼容语法；若代码执行报“字段不存在”等错误，请先回到上方表结构核对真实物理字段名，再做自动修复，不要臆造字段。\n\n\n你是 Python 数据分析助手。代码仅在客户沙箱中执行，只输出纯 Python。客户数据通过沙箱提供的 get_connection() 获取 DB-API 连接；禁止编造或填写连接参数，禁止使用 pymysql.connect、SQLAlchemy create_engine、读取平台配置或输出任何凭据。只能执行只读 MySQL SELECT 查询，所有条件值使用 cursor.execute(sql, params) 参数绑定，表名使用已提供的库名.表名，字段和 JOIN 必须依据本次实时字段及有效关联关系。使用 try/finally，在结束时 rollback 并关闭连接；get_connection() 不可用时抛出错误，禁止换数据源。按字段注释和技能规则解释业务条件，不臆造字段，不编造数据。每步在独立命名空间执行，前序结果只能从任务指定的衔接字典按键获取，或重新查询。需要向后续步骤传参时，按任务要求 print(\'__HANDOFF__\'+json.dumps({...}))，仅放JSON可序列化对象。数据结果必须 print 为纯文本表格，不能只用 display 或图表；空结果如实说明。\n\n你是一个精通Python和数据处理的AI修复助手。请只输出纯Python代码。'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': '你生成的 Python 代码在沙箱中执行时发生了报错。\n【原始任务】: 步骤1：查询闵开发（orgCode=\'MHKFQ\'）旗下所有资产的详细信息，包括资产名称、可租面积、不可租面积，并关联合同表计算已出租面积，进而推导空置面积与空置率，同时列出即将到期的合同信息\n【你的代码】:\n```python\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom datetime import datetime, timedelta\n\ntry:\n    conn = get_connection()\n    cursor = conn.cursor()\n    \n    # 1. 查询资产基础信息 (厂房表关联主表)\n    sql_asset = """\n    SELECT \n        m.ID AS asset_id,\n        m.ASSET_NAME,\n        m.ASSET_TYPE,\n        cf.ASSET_KZ_AREA,\n        cf.ASSET_BKZ_AREA,\n        cf.ASSET_TOTAL_AREA\n    FROM zszx.ZC_ASSET_INFO_MAIN m\n    JOIN zszx.ZC_ASSET_INFO_CF cf ON m.ID = cf.MAIN_ID\n    WHERE m.ORG_CODE = %s\n      AND m.REMOVED = 0\n      AND m.ENABLED = 1\n      AND cf.REMOVED = 0\n      AND cf.ENABLED = 1\n    """\n    cursor.execute(sql_asset, (\'MHKFQ\',))\n    columns_asset = [desc[0] for desc in cursor.description]\n    rows_asset = cursor.fetchall()\n    df_assets = pd.DataFrame(rows_asset, columns=columns_asset)\n    \n    # 2. 查询有效合同及到期时间，用于计算已租面积和即将到期分析\n    # 注意：ASSET_TYPE在合同表中也是存在的，但为了统一口径，我们主要依据资产ID关联\n    # 这里假设租赁面积代表已占用/出租面积。如果同一资产有多个有效合同，需要聚合或去重逻辑。\n    # 通常一个物理空间在同一时间只有一个有效租赁合同（除非分租），这里按SUM处理以防多份合同覆盖不同区域，\n    # 或者更严谨地，如果业务上“可租面积”是固定的，那么“已租面积”应该是当前生效合同的租赁面积之和。\n    # 考虑到数据可能脏乱，先获取所有有效合同明细。\n    \n    sql_contract = """\n    SELECT \n        c.ASSET_ID,\n        c.LEASE_AREA,\n        c.END_DATE,\n        c.CUSTOMER_NAME,\n        c.CONTRACT_NO,\n        c.START_DATE\n    FROM zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_INFO c\n    WHERE c.ORG_CODE = %s\n      AND c.CONTRACT_STATE = 1\n      AND c.REMOVED = 0\n      AND c.ENABLED = 1\n    """\n    cursor.execute(sql_contract, (\'MHKFQ\',))\n    columns_contract = [desc[0] for desc in cursor.description]\n    rows_contract = cursor.fetchall()\n    df_contracts = pd.DataFrame(rows_contract, columns=columns_contract)\n    \n    cursor.close()\n    conn.rollback()\n    conn.close()\n    \nexcept Exception as e:\n    print(f"Error fetching data: {e}")\n    raise e\n\n# --- 数据处理与分析 ---\n\nif not df_assets.empty:\n    # 转换面积为数值类型，处理可能的空值或非数字字符串\n    def safe_float(x):\n        try:\n            return float(x) if x is not None and str(x).strip() != \'\' else 0.0\n        except:\n            return 0.0\n\n    df_assets[\'KZ_AREA_NUM\'] = df_assets[\'ASSET_KZ_AREA\'].apply(safe_float)\n    df_assets[\'BKZ_AREA_NUM\'] = df_assets[\'ASSET_BKZ_AREA\'].apply(safe_float)\n    df_assets[\'TOTAL_AREA_NUM\'] = df_assets[\'ASSET_TOTAL_AREA\'].apply(safe_float)\n    \n    # 如果没有可租面积字段，尝试用总面积减去不可租？根据规则优先使用 ASSET_KZ_AREA\n    # 如果 KZ_AREA 为 0 但 TOTAL > 0，可能需要业务判断，这里暂按 KZ_AREA 为准\n    \n    # 聚合合同数据：计算每个资产的已租面积（有效合同租赁面积之和）\n    # 注意：这里简单求和。如果存在重叠租赁，这可能会高估已租面积，但在缺乏更细粒度房间号匹配的情况下，这是常见近似。\n    # 另外，需要过滤掉已经结束的合同吗？CONTRACT_STATE=1 通常表示当前有效，但 END_DATE 也可能过期但未更新状态。\n    # 为了准确反映“当前空置”，我们应只考虑 END_DATE >= 今天 的合同作为“已租”。\n    \n    today_str = datetime.now().strftime(\'%Y-%m-%d\')\n    \n    # 确保 END_DATE 格式一致进行字符串比较或转换为日期对象\n    # 假设 END_DATE 是 \'YYYY-MM-DD\' 格式的字符串\n    df_contracts[\'END_DATE_DT\'] = pd.to_datetime(df_contracts[\'END_DATE\'], errors=\'coerce\')\n    df_contracts[\'START_DATE_DT\'] = pd.to_datetime(df_contracts[\'START_DATE\'], errors=\'coerce\')\n    \n    # 筛选当前有效的合同：结束日期 >= 今天\n    active_contracts = df_contracts[df_contracts[\'END_DATE_DT\'] >= datetime.now()]\n    \n    # 按资产ID汇总已租面积\n    leased_area_by_asset = active_contracts.groupby(\'ASSET_ID\')[\'LEASE_AREA\'].sum().reset_index()\n    leased_area_by_asset.rename(columns={\'LEASE_AREA\': \'CURRENT_LEASED_AREA\'}, inplace=True)\n    \n    # 合并资产信息与已租面积\n    df_analysis = df_assets.merge(leased_area_by_asset, left_on=\'asset_id\', right_on=\'ASSET_ID\', how=\'left\')\n    df_analysis[\'CURRENT_LEASED_AREA\'] = df_analysis[\'CURRENT_LEASED_AREA\'].fillna(0)\n    \n    # 计算空置面积\n    # 空置面积 = 可租面积 - 已租面积\n    # 防止负数（数据异常时）\n    df_analysis[\'VACANT_AREA\'] = df_analysis[\'KZ_AREA_NUM\'] - df_analysis[\'CURRENT_LEASED_AREA\']\n    df_analysis[\'VACANT_AREA\'] = df_analysis[\'VACANT_AREA\'].clip(lower=0)\n    \n    # 计算空置率\n    # 空置率 = 空置面积 / 可租面积 * 100%\n    df_analysis[\'VACANCY_RATE\'] = df_analysis.apply(\n        lambda row: (row[\'VACANT_AREA\'] / row[\'KZ_AREA_NUM\'] * 100) if row[\'KZ_AREA_NUM\'] > 0 else 0, \n        axis=1\n    )\n    \n    # 识别即将到期的合同 (例如未来3个月内到期)\n    three_months_later = datetime.now() + timedelta(days=90)\n    expiring_soon_contracts = df_contracts[\n        (df_contracts[\'END_DATE_DT\'] >= datetime.now()) & \n        (df_contracts[\'END_DATE_DT\'] <= three_months_later)\n    ]\n    \n    # 将即将到期合同信息映射回资产，以便展示\n    # 如果一个资产有多个即将到期合同，取最近的一个或列表化。这里为了表格清晰，先标记是否有即将到期合同\n    expiring_asset_ids = set(expiring_soon_contracts[\'ASSET_ID\'].unique())\n    df_analysis[\'HAS_EXPIRING_SOON\'] = df_analysis[\'asset_id\'].isin(expiring_asset_ids).map({True: \'是\', False: \'否\'})\n    \n    # 生成详细报告表格\n    # 选择关键列\n    report_cols = [\'ASSET_NAME\', \'ASSET_TYPE\', \'KZ_AREA_NUM\', \'CURRENT_LEASED_AREA\', \'VACANT_AREA\', \'VACANCY_RATE\', \'HAS_EXPIRING_SOON\']\n    df_report = df_analysis[report_cols].copy()\n    \n    # 格式化输出\n    df_report[\'ASSET_TYPE\'] = df_report[\'ASSET_TYPE\'].map({1: \'厂房\', 2: \'土地\', 3: \'楼宇\', 4: \'其他\'}).fillna(\'未知\')\n    df_report[\'KZ_AREA_NUM\'] = df_report[\'KZ_AREA_NUM\'].round(2)\n    df_report[\'CURRENT_LEASED_AREA\'] = df_report[\'CURRENT_LEASED_AREA\'].round(2)\n    df_report[\'VACANT_AREA\'] = df_report[\'VACANT_AREA\'].round(2)\n    df_report[\'VACANCY_RATE\'] = df_report[\'VACANCY_RATE\'].round(2)\n    \n    # 排序：按空置率降序，方便查看问题资产\n    df_report.sort_values(by=\'VACANCY_RATE\', ascending=False, inplace=True)\n    \n    print("=== 闵开发(MHKFQ)资产空置情况分析报告 ===")\n    print("\\n--- 1. 资产空置明细表 ---")\n    print(df_report.to_string(index=False))\n    \n    print("\\n--- 2. 整体统计摘要 ---")\n    total_kz_area = df_analysis[\'KZ_AREA_NUM\'].sum()\n    total_vacant_area = df_analysis[\'VACANT_AREA\'].sum()\n    overall_vacancy_rate = (total_vacant_area / total_kz_area * 100) if total_kz_area > 0 else 0\n    count_assets = len(df_analysis)\n    count_vacant_assets = len(df_analysis[df_analysis[\'VACANT_AREA\'] > 0])\n    \n    print(f"资产总数: {count_assets}")\n    print(f"存在空置的资产数: {count_vacant_assets}")\n    print(f"总可租面积: {total_kz_area:.2f} 平方米")\n    print(f"总空置面积: {total_vacant_area:.2f} 平方米")\n    print(f"整体空置率: {overall_vacancy_rate:.2f}%")\n    \n    print("\\n--- 3. 即将到期合同详情 (未来3个月内) ---")\n    if not expiring_soon_contracts.empty:\n        # 关联资产名称\n        exp_detail = expiring_soon_contracts.merge(df_assets[[\'asset_id\', \'ASSET_NAME\']], left_on=\'ASSET_ID\', right_on=\'asset_id\', how=\'left\')\n        exp_detail_cols = [\'ASSET_NAME\', \'CUSTOMER_NAME\', \'CONTRACT_NO\', \'LEASE_AREA\', \'START_DATE\', \'END_DATE\']\n        exp_detail_report = exp_detail[exp_detail_cols].copy()\n        exp_detail_report[\'LEASE_AREA\'] = exp_detail_report[\'LEASE_AREA\'].round(2)\n        exp_detail_report.sort_values(by=\'END_DATE\', inplace=True)\n        print(exp_detail_report.to_string(index=False))\n    else:\n        print("无即将到期合同。")\n\nelse:\n    print("未查询到闵开发(MHKFQ)的有效资产数据。")\n```\n【执行报错】:\nError: TypeError: unsupported operand type(s) for -: \'float\' and \'decimal.Decimal\'\n\n请仔细分析报错原因并修复代码。注意：\n1. 如果是 SQL 语法或字段找不到错误，请检查 JOIN 条件、表别名或使用的数据表字段名是否正确。\n2. 如果是 Pandas 数据处理报错，请检查 DataFrame 的类型或缺失值。\n3. 如果是 __HANDOFF__ 打印报错（如 json 序列化失败），请只放入可 JSON 序列化的简单参数（int/float/str/列表），并把 DataFrame 等对象排除在外。\n4. 如果报错涉及 decimal.Decimal 与 float 混算（unsupported operand type(s) for /: \'float\' and \'decimal.Decimal\'），说明 MySQL 的 DECIMAL 列或 SUM/AVG 聚合结果返回的是 Decimal，必须在参与除法、百分比等运算前显式 float() 转换；round() 之后也要 float() 才能被 json.dumps 序列化。\n5. 如果提示“无输出”，说明代码执行完没有 print 任何内容。请补上 print(...)，把本步结果（如 df.to_string(index=False) 或关键数值）以纯文本打印出来，否则后续步骤和最终总结拿不到数据。\n请输出修复后的纯 Python 代码内容，不要包含任何 Markdown 标记（如 ```python 等）。'}], 'model': 'qwen3.8-flash', 'temperature': 0.3}, 'extra_json': {'enable_thinking': False}}
