   SELECT \n        c.CONTRACT_NO AS \'合同编号\',\n        c.LESSOR AS \'出租方\',\n        c.CUSTOMER_NAME AS \'客户名称\',\n        a.ASSET_NAME AS \'租赁资产\',\n        c.ROOM_NO AS \'房号\',\n        CASE a.ASSET_TYPE \n            WHEN 1 THEN \'厂房\' \n            WHEN 2 THEN \'土地\' \n            WHEN 3 THEN \'楼宇\' \n            WHEN 4 THEN \'其他\' \n            ELSE CAST(a.ASSET_TYPE AS CHAR) \n        END AS \'资产类型\',\n        c.LEASE_AREA AS \'租赁面积(㎡)\',\n        c.CONTRACT_TYPE AS \'租赁合同类型\',\n        c.START_DATE AS \'开始日期\',\n        c.END_DATE AS \'结束日期\'\n    FROM zszx.ZC_CONTRACT_INFO c\n    LEFT JOIN zszx.ZC_ASSET_INFO_MAIN a ON c.ASSET_ID = a.ID\n    WHERE c.CUSTOMER_NAME LIKE %s\n      AND c.CONTRACT_STATE = 1\n      AND c.REMOVED = 0\n      AND c.ENABLED = 1\n    ORDER BY c.START_DATE DESC\n    """\n    \n    params = (\'%ABB%\',)\n    \n    try:\n        cursor.execute(sql, params)\n        columns = [desc[0] for desc in cursor.description]\n        rows = cursor.fetchall()\n        \n        if not rows:\n            print("未查询到符合条件的有效合同数据。")\n            return\n        \n        df = pd.DataFrame(rows, columns=columns)\n        \n        # 确保数值类型正确显示，避免科学计数法或多余小数位问题（根据需求调整）\n        if \'租赁面积(㎡)\' in df.columns:\n             df[\'租赁面积(㎡)\'] = df[\'租赁面积(㎡)\'].apply(lambda x: f"{x:.2f}" if pd.notnull(x) else "")\n             \n        print(df.to_string(index=False))\n        \n    finally:\n        cursor.close()\n        conn.rollback()\n        conn.close()\n\nget_data()\n```\n**执行结果**:\n```text\n合同编号            出租方        客户名称                    租赁资产                                                                                                                房号 资产类型  租赁面积(㎡)   租赁合同类型       开始日期       结束日期\nMLC2026BD016 上海闵联临港联合发展有限公司 上海ABB工程有限公司   LG-闵联临港园区一期地块（A1地块）厂房                                                                      4#厂房-励磁：2000㎡；LG-一期-A1地块-幢12-A3厂房-1：1276.74㎡   厂房  3276.74 工业厂房租赁合同 2026-08-01 2031-07-31\nMLC2026BD020 上海闵联临港联合发展有限公司 AB